(3765592, 529478, 33164, '<td valign="top">I really like the feel of this shot. I also really think a good candid needs to show some emotion in the subject. The subject here has no detail. almost a sillouette.  Again, really like the shot and the feel, but feel that for the challenge it would be nice to see more detail in the subject.</td>', 'I really like the feel of this shot. I also really think a good candid needs to show some emotion in the subject. The subject here has no detail. almost a sillouette.  Again, really like the shot and the feel, but feel that for the challenge it would be nice to see more detail in the subject.', '2007-06-11 01:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
