(3766504, 531883, 27133, '<td valign="top">A little soft but good candid composition.</td>', 'A little soft but good candid composition.', '2007-06-11 06:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3766508, 532596, 33352, '<td valign="top">sharp and crisp not very strong in the moment...</td>', 'sharp and crisp not very strong in the moment...', '2007-06-11 06:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3766510, 532527, 8522, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really interest me I''m afraid. The composition doesn''t work for me, but well done on blurring your background. If you''re going to feature someone''s hand in a photo, make sure it''s all there. Hands are almost as expressive and important as the face, that''s one of the reasons that this shot doesn''t work for me. Part of an accidentally included knee doesn''t work either. The light on the face isn''t great, and the towel''s shadow doesn''t look good.</td>', 'Doesn''t really interest me I''m afraid. The composition doesn''t work for me, but well done on blurring your background. If you''re going to feature someone''s hand in a photo, make sure it''s all there. Hands are almost as expressive and important as the face, that''s one of the reasons that this shot doesn''t work for me. Part of an accidentally included knee doesn''t work either. The light on the face isn''t great, and the towel''s shadow doesn''t look good.', '2007-06-11 06:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3766512, 530677, 33352, '<td valign="top">many moments cpatured here, and well focused...</td>', 'many moments cpatured here, and well focused...', '2007-06-11 06:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3766513, 532572, 33352, '<td valign="top">no impact...</td>', 'no impact...', '2007-06-11 06:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3766516, 532424, 8522, '<td valign="top">I''m not so sure it''s possible to have candids of babies in the same way that you can''t have a candid of your cat. I don''t think the baby has any awareness of what a camera is. Step out of your comfort zone and get some photos of strangers!</td>', 'I''m not so sure it''s possible to have candids of babies in the same way that you can''t have a candid of your cat. I don''t think the baby has any awareness of what a camera is. Step out of your comfort zone and get some photos of strangers!', '2007-06-11 06:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3766518, 531540, 33352, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a Candid moment..</td>', 'Now that''s a Candid moment..', '2007-06-11 06:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
