(3766528, 531837, 8522, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous candid, superb subject and great expression/timing. The composition isn''t amazing though, I''d have placed her more to the left. Currently, you have a lot of space in the left side of the photo which doesn''t serve much purpose. Also, try not to chop off people''s elbows if you have most of it in the frame. I wish her right hand was sharper.</td>', 'What a gorgeous candid, superb subject and great expression/timing. The composition isn''t amazing though, I''d have placed her more to the left. Currently, you have a lot of space in the left side of the photo which doesn''t serve much purpose. Also, try not to chop off people''s elbows if you have most of it in the frame. I wish her right hand was sharper.', '2007-06-11 06:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
