(3766705, 531482, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very good candid image, though given the person walking nearest to the squatting man is looking directly at him perhaps the title could have been changed.  Still, I give points for pictures rather than titles and this is a very good one</td>', 'Very good candid image, though given the person walking nearest to the squatting man is looking directly at him perhaps the title could have been changed.  Still, I give points for pictures rather than titles and this is a very good one', '2007-06-11 07:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
