(3766833, 531883, 68035, '<td valign="top">Yep this feels like a ''real'' candid and a great little slice of life shot.  Duotone works very well and this is one of the best I have seen in the 200+ I have scored already</td>', 'Yep this feels like a ''real'' candid and a great little slice of life shot.  Duotone works very well and this is one of the best I have seen in the 200+ I have scored already', '2007-06-11 07:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3766834, 532623, 8522, '<td valign="top">A bit snapshottish... I don''t think the man''s expression is extreme enough to carry the photo. The light is pretty harsh. The background isn''t good... being at a different angle to avoid trees growing out of the car would have helped. The colours arent'' easy on the eye. It''s a bit too contrasty. The car''s shadow reflects the bad choice of time for light. Crop feels a bit too tight on the left.</td>', 'A bit snapshottish... I don''t think the man''s expression is extreme enough to carry the photo. The light is pretty harsh. The background isn''t good... being at a different angle to avoid trees growing out of the car would have helped. The colours arent'' easy on the eye. It''s a bit too contrasty. The car''s shadow reflects the bad choice of time for light. Crop feels a bit too tight on the left.', '2007-06-11 07:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3766836, 530445, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot although for me I find the border a bit of a distraction</td>', 'Nice shot although for me I find the border a bit of a distraction', '2007-06-11 07:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3766838, 532055, 8522, '<td valign="top">Needs both subjects to be in focus. Not sure b&amp;w helps your photo here. Background is distracting. Dog''s lead takes away from shot and leads eye out of the frame. Subject doesn''t really interest me, it looks more like a family snapshot.</td>', 'Needs both subjects to be in focus. Not sure b&w helps your photo here. Background is distracting. Dog''s lead takes away from shot and leads eye out of the frame. Subject doesn''t really interest me, it looks more like a family snapshot.', '2007-06-11 07:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3766841, 530723, 6999, '<td valign="top">He looks so damn pleased with himself. Probably got a PhD in astrophysics or something ...</td>', 'He looks so damn pleased with himself. Probably got a PhD in astrophysics or something ...', '2007-06-11 07:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3766842, 531846, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely image although (and this is somewhat bizarre given the subject of the photo) it almost feels staged</td>', 'Lovely image although (and this is somewhat bizarre given the subject of the photo) it almost feels staged', '2007-06-11 07:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3766845, 530742, 8522, '<td valign="top">Post processing totally gratuitous and makes the texture of the clothes look awful. The dog doesn''t work in the shot at all as you can''t see it''s face. Composition feels unbalanced, too much negative space in top left of frame. Skin tones too purple. Doorframe growing out of man''s head.</td>', 'Post processing totally gratuitous and makes the texture of the clothes look awful. The dog doesn''t work in the shot at all as you can''t see it''s face. Composition feels unbalanced, too much negative space in top left of frame. Skin tones too purple. Doorframe growing out of man''s head.', '2007-06-11 07:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3766846, 532838, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice image of an artist at work although not quite sure the desat works for my particular taste</td>', 'Nice image of an artist at work although not quite sure the desat works for my particular taste', '2007-06-11 07:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3766849, 532754, 8522, '<td valign="top">The left hand and rail spoils the profile of the man''s face. Composition feels cluttered and unbalanced. Man''s face is too high in frame. Not sure what you''re communicating here.</td>', 'The left hand and rail spoils the profile of the man''s face. Composition feels cluttered and unbalanced. Man''s face is too high in frame. Not sure what you''re communicating here.', '2007-06-11 07:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
