(3766857, 531378, 68035, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image reminiscent of a 1950''s film, in terms of candid -not quite, but in terms of a shot I wish I had taken, definitelt</td>', 'A beautiful image reminiscent of a 1950''s film, in terms of candid -not quite, but in terms of a shot I wish I had taken, definitelt', '2007-06-11 07:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
