(3766863, 532228, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very good candid of men at work.  Not sure about the vignetting but still an excellent image - 7</td>', 'Very good candid of men at work.  Not sure about the vignetting but still an excellent image - 7', '2007-06-11 07:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3766866, 532865, 8522, '<td valign="top">Pet peeve... chopping off fingers when most of the hand is in shot. The green sepia looks terrible. But you''ve caught a nice moment. It almost looks posed, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt. You could crop much tighter, there''s way too much negative space at the top. I don''t like it that you can''t read the writing on the t-shirt, be careful if there''s text in a photo. It makes you want to read the rest of it.</td>', 'Pet peeve... chopping off fingers when most of the hand is in shot. The green sepia looks terrible. But you''ve caught a nice moment. It almost looks posed, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt. You could crop much tighter, there''s way too much negative space at the top. I don''t like it that you can''t read the writing on the t-shirt, be careful if there''s text in a photo. It makes you want to read the rest of it.', '2007-06-11 07:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3766871, 532000, 8522, '<td valign="top">A but over-processed, skin tones are a bit too purple. Greens don''t look too good. The bokeh of this lens isn''t too great. Good composition though. You''d have been better off cloning out his right arm. The feel of the photo is a bit too drab and depressing for my taste.</td>', 'A but over-processed, skin tones are a bit too purple. Greens don''t look too good. The bokeh of this lens isn''t too great. Good composition though. You''d have been better off cloning out his right arm. The feel of the photo is a bit too drab and depressing for my taste.', '2007-06-11 08:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
