(3767009, 533090, 68035, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that this is possibly a posed candid although the fact that your subject is so intent on what he has doing really means you ''get away'' with it<br/> <br/>Nice dof and lighting</td>', 'I''m guessing that this is possibly a posed candid although the fact that your subject is so intent on what he has doing really means you ''get away'' with it Nice dof and lighting', '2007-06-11 09:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767010, 531467, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely image though not quite a candid in my own opinion.  Excellent composition though</td>', 'Lovely image though not quite a candid in my own opinion.  Excellent composition though', '2007-06-11 09:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767012, 532740, 68035, '<td valign="top">Stunning image although I do struggle a bit with the idea of this as a candid</td>', 'Stunning image although I do struggle a bit with the idea of this as a candid', '2007-06-11 09:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767014, 531586, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice candid and congrats on not getting any blow out with the sunshine</td>', 'Very nice candid and congrats on not getting any blow out with the sunshine', '2007-06-11 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767015, 531473, 66201, '<td valign="top">Strange shot: the girl in the background is desaturated right? Her skin looks dead though in comparison to the very warm flesh in the foreground.</td>', 'Strange shot: the girl in the background is desaturated right? Her skin looks dead though in comparison to the very warm flesh in the foreground.', '2007-06-11 09:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767016, 532388, 37581, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful shot, full of fun and movement. 9 from me.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful shot, full of fun and movement. 9 from me.', '2007-06-11 09:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767017, 531575, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely image and the desat works well.  Great expression on the childs face</td>', 'Lovely image and the desat works well.  Great expression on the childs face', '2007-06-11 09:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767019, 532269, 37581, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors in this. And he looks like he is in paradise alone with his icecream. 9 from me.</td>', 'beautiful colors in this. And he looks like he is in paradise alone with his icecream. 9 from me.', '2007-06-11 09:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767020, 531296, 68035, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh I so hope this isnt posed but I think it might be.  Still its not my job to second guess you.  Very nice image and the desat works well</td>', 'Ohhhh I so hope this isnt posed but I think it might be.  Still its not my job to second guess you.  Very nice image and the desat works well', '2007-06-11 09:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767021, 530677, 66201, '<td valign="top">Really lovely: excellent contrasts and great lighting from natural source.</td>', 'Really lovely: excellent contrasts and great lighting from natural source.', '2007-06-11 09:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767023, 531898, 37581, '<td valign="top">heh, that is one great song. Excellent shot, choice of b/w does really intensify the water.</td>', 'heh, that is one great song. Excellent shot, choice of b/w does really intensify the water.', '2007-06-11 09:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767025, 531914, 68035, '<td valign="top">One of a number of lovely images of ''grizzled old timers'' in this challenge<br/> <br/>Excellent dof and capture</td>', 'One of a number of lovely images of ''grizzled old timers'' in this challenge Excellent dof and capture', '2007-06-11 09:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767026, 532341, 37581, '<td valign="top">I really like this, skinny legs and all.<br/>Looks like he is really trying to figure out the best way through the maze.</td>', 'I really like this, skinny legs and all.Looks like he is really trying to figure out the best way through the maze.', '2007-06-11 09:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767028, 532268, 66201, '<td valign="top">Lovely moment: the DOF is a bit shallow though. All focus is on the hand - would have loved the baby''s face to be clear as well.</td>', 'Lovely moment: the DOF is a bit shallow though. All focus is on the hand - would have loved the baby''s face to be clear as well.', '2007-06-11 09:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767031, 532396, 37581, '<td valign="top">haha, that is one thick milkshake. Excellent fun and summery shot.</td>', 'haha, that is one thick milkshake. Excellent fun and summery shot.', '2007-06-11 09:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767032, 531938, 66201, '<td valign="top">Whites are a bit blown out. Nice location.</td>', 'Whites are a bit blown out. Nice location.', '2007-06-11 09:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767033, 532093, 8522, '<td valign="top">A bit hard to make out the rest of the photo other than the face. The photo feels too intimate to be a true candid, it feels more like a portrait. The lighting doesn''t quite work for me, I would have prefered it if you''d managed to get the light on just part of his face. The knee seems to be the sharpest part of the photo, it really needs to be the eyes. Perhaps you could have cropped it to avoid the blown highlights.</td>', 'A bit hard to make out the rest of the photo other than the face. The photo feels too intimate to be a true candid, it feels more like a portrait. The lighting doesn''t quite work for me, I would have prefered it if you''d managed to get the light on just part of his face. The knee seems to be the sharpest part of the photo, it really needs to be the eyes. Perhaps you could have cropped it to avoid the blown highlights.', '2007-06-11 09:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767035, 532927, 37581, '<td valign="top">This one really grows on me. I do like the low angle, the way the trooper seems to be invisible to the pedestrian striding by. And that glass of slushie (?) is the extra touch of humor IMO.</td>', 'This one really grows on me. I do like the low angle, the way the trooper seems to be invisible to the pedestrian striding by. And that glass of slushie (?) is the extra touch of humor IMO.', '2007-06-11 09:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767036, 532286, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely European feel to this image, good capture</td>', 'Lovely European feel to this image, good capture', '2007-06-11 09:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767037, 531294, 37581, '<td valign="top">I love the quietness of the man amidst that chairback chaos. Beautiful tones.</td>', 'I love the quietness of the man amidst that chairback chaos. Beautiful tones.', '2007-06-11 09:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767038, 530317, 68035, '<td valign="top">One of a number of lovely images of ''grizzled old timers'' in this challenge<br/> <br/>Excellent dof and capture</td>', 'One of a number of lovely images of ''grizzled old timers'' in this challenge Excellent dof and capture', '2007-06-11 09:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767039, 533016, 66201, '<td valign="top">Ah he''s great: this is so crisp and yet he''s caught in animation...love it.</td>', 'Ah he''s great: this is so crisp and yet he''s caught in animation...love it.', '2007-06-11 09:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767041, 532442, 66201, '<td valign="top">The highlights are blown out a bit. I like the angle he''s at in the composition.</td>', 'The highlights are blown out a bit. I like the angle he''s at in the composition.', '2007-06-11 09:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767043, 532979, 68035, '<td valign="top">One of a number of lovely images of ''grizzled old timers'' in this challenge<br/> <br/>Excellent dof and capture and made more poigniant by the fact that regardless of the tribulations that life has thrown at him the subject on the left still has a genuine smile</td>', 'One of a number of lovely images of ''grizzled old timers'' in this challenge Excellent dof and capture and made more poigniant by the fact that regardless of the tribulations that life has thrown at him the subject on the left still has a genuine smile', '2007-06-11 09:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767044, 532504, 8522, '<td valign="top">Way too intrusive for my taste. If this is just photojournalism, why have you desaturated your backgound? Photojournalism still needs to be artistic. The composition doesn''t work well here, the police officers need to be facing the camera more. There''s not enough sense of context for this to work well as photojournalism.</td>', 'Way too intrusive for my taste. If this is just photojournalism, why have you desaturated your backgound? Photojournalism still needs to be artistic. The composition doesn''t work well here, the police officers need to be facing the camera more. There''s not enough sense of context for this to work well as photojournalism.', '2007-06-11 09:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767046, 530216, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, although perhaps the focus could have been a fraction tighter</td>', 'Very nice image, although perhaps the focus could have been a fraction tighter', '2007-06-11 09:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767048, 532254, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely genuine feeling candid, great expression at the B&amp;W works well</td>', 'Lovely genuine feeling candid, great expression at the B&W works well', '2007-06-11 09:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767051, 529507, 68035, '<td valign="top">Super dof and great capture of someone who wears their lifestory on their face</td>', 'Super dof and great capture of someone who wears their lifestory on their face', '2007-06-11 09:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767052, 532233, 8522, '<td valign="top">One of the main marks of good photography (IMO) is that it captures something unusual that you don''t see everyday. You''ll find that photos which meet this criteria usually do well on DPC. A bored person is the antithesis of this approach. This photo doesn''t tell much of a story.</td>', 'One of the main marks of good photography (IMO) is that it captures something unusual that you don''t see everyday. You''ll find that photos which meet this criteria usually do well on DPC. A bored person is the antithesis of this approach. This photo doesn''t tell much of a story.', '2007-06-11 09:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767053, 533200, 18219, '<td valign="top">his face looks a little too purple.<br/>maybe if it was totally converted to black and white????<br/>nice image though.</td>', 'his face looks a little too purple.maybe if it was totally converted to black and white????nice image though.', '2007-06-11 09:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767059, 533002, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very evocative image and great lighting.  Colours work exceptionally well</td>', 'Very evocative image and great lighting.  Colours work exceptionally well', '2007-06-11 09:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767060, 532927, 18219, '<td valign="top">i think the stormtrooper is looking at you and is aware that the photo is being taken.<br/>he''s probably even smiling!!!<br/> <br/>i''m just kidding of course.<br/>nice juxtaposition with the faceless legs crossing the path of the faceless ''trooper.</td>', 'i think the stormtrooper is looking at you and is aware that the photo is being taken.he''s probably even smiling!!! i''m just kidding of course.nice juxtaposition with the faceless legs crossing the path of the faceless ''trooper.', '2007-06-11 09:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767061, 532868, 70661, '<td valign="top">Nice candid capture but to me the colors look messed up.</td>', 'Nice candid capture but to me the colors look messed up.', '2007-06-11 09:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767062, 532060, 8522, '<td valign="top">A distracting red border can''t rescue the out of focus face and bad composition. The expression isn''t great, and a good candid usually needs a sense of context and story.</td>', 'A distracting red border can''t rescue the out of focus face and bad composition. The expression isn''t great, and a good candid usually needs a sense of context and story.', '2007-06-11 09:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767064, 532812, 18219, '<td valign="top">i like the tones you''ve used on this.<br/>and the composition is great.</td>', 'i like the tones you''ve used on this.and the composition is great.', '2007-06-11 09:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767065, 532266, 68035, '<td valign="top">Interesting image and I like the techique you employed</td>', 'Interesting image and I like the techique you employed', '2007-06-11 09:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767068, 533093, 68035, '<td valign="top">Subject has a very haunting face which you have captured well</td>', 'Subject has a very haunting face which you have captured well', '2007-06-11 09:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767070, 533095, 68035, '<td valign="top">I struggle a bit with the idea of pets/animals as candids but no denying that you have captured a good image</td>', 'I struggle a bit with the idea of pets/animals as candids but no denying that you have captured a good image', '2007-06-11 09:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767071, 532357, 18219, '<td valign="top">one thing to improve the picture (in my opinion) would be to crop tighter to the lady and to leave some room on the right so it gives them room to "look".<br/>If you know what i mean.</td>', 'one thing to improve the picture (in my opinion) would be to crop tighter to the lady and to leave some room on the right so it gives them room to "look".If you know what i mean.', '2007-06-11 09:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767072, 531540, 68035, '<td valign="top">I struggle a bit with the idea of animals as candids but no denying that you have captured a good image, super dof</td>', 'I struggle a bit with the idea of animals as candids but no denying that you have captured a good image, super dof', '2007-06-11 09:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767073, 532999, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture although it does seem a tad posed (if it isnt then kudos to you)</td>', 'Very nice capture although it does seem a tad posed (if it isnt then kudos to you)', '2007-06-11 09:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767074, 532940, 8522, '<td valign="top">You got out and grabbed a candid of some strangers, so well done! Keep pushing your comfort zone though, it''s usually better if you can see most of the face. Find out how to straighten a photo... this is wonky. If you have text in a photo, make sure it''s all visible. The composition feels a little too stretched here, there''s too much space in the middle. It''s hard to know where the eye can rest comfortably. A man being interested in some food in a shop window isn''t quite enough interest for me. It''s too mundane and everyday.</td>', 'You got out and grabbed a candid of some strangers, so well done! Keep pushing your comfort zone though, it''s usually better if you can see most of the face. Find out how to straighten a photo... this is wonky. If you have text in a photo, make sure it''s all visible. The composition feels a little too stretched here, there''s too much space in the middle. It''s hard to know where the eye can rest comfortably. A man being interested in some food in a shop window isn''t quite enough interest for me. It''s too mundane and everyday.', '2007-06-11 09:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767076, 533100, 68035, '<td valign="top">Simple, effective and candid.  Nice image</td>', 'Simple, effective and candid.  Nice image', '2007-06-11 09:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767077, 532779, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely and slightly surreal feel to this image</td>', 'Lovely and slightly surreal feel to this image', '2007-06-11 09:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767081, 532357, 68035, '<td valign="top">photographing the photographers.  Nice composition but seems just a shade out on the focus</td>', 'photographing the photographers.  Nice composition but seems just a shade out on the focus', '2007-06-11 09:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767082, 533148, 68035, '<td valign="top">Excellent effect and the lack of colour really enhances this.</td>', 'Excellent effect and the lack of colour really enhances this.', '2007-06-11 09:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767083, 532554, 8522, '<td valign="top">Composition is too cluttered with too much negative space (ie on right of frame). Photo is wonky. Everything is too far away. The kid in the middle has a good expression, but the other two aren''t interesting.</td>', 'Composition is too cluttered with too much negative space (ie on right of frame). Photo is wonky. Everything is too far away. The kid in the middle has a good expression, but the other two aren''t interesting.', '2007-06-11 09:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767084, 532595, 70888, '<td valign="top">incredible location,nice shot too,where is this? has to be cold!7</td>', 'incredible location,nice shot too,where is this? has to be cold!7', '2007-06-11 09:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767086, 531511, 68035, '<td valign="top">Super image though imo does not quite do candid for me 100%</td>', 'Super image though imo does not quite do candid for me 100%', '2007-06-11 09:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767088, 528569, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, which even if it is posed does not really come across that way<br/> <br/>Good job</td>', 'Lovely image, which even if it is posed does not really come across that way Good job', '2007-06-11 09:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767091, 532353, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great candid, possibly could have done with a touch more contrast to add to the ''pop'' of the shot<br/> <br/>Nice job though</td>', 'Great candid, possibly could have done with a touch more contrast to add to the ''pop'' of the shot Nice job though', '2007-06-11 09:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767092, 533110, 8522, '<td valign="top">Photography is about capturing exceptional moments, the skill is in capturing the fleeting moment. This gentleman looks like you could have taken the same photograph within the space of several hours. The background doesn''t quite work... the shoreline meets his face and spoils his profile. What is the emotion that you want to evoke in the viewer?</td>', 'Photography is about capturing exceptional moments, the skill is in capturing the fleeting moment. This gentleman looks like you could have taken the same photograph within the space of several hours. The background doesn''t quite work... the shoreline meets his face and spoils his profile. What is the emotion that you want to evoke in the viewer?', '2007-06-11 09:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767096, 533170, 68035, '<td valign="top">Bizarrely I might like this a little more if I had not seen it in the candid challenge (where you cant help but wonder, ''is this actually posed'')<br/> <br/>Very nice moment in time though</td>', 'Bizarrely I might like this a little more if I had not seen it in the candid challenge (where you cant help but wonder, ''is this actually posed'') Very nice moment in time though', '2007-06-11 09:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767098, 533201, 68035, '<td valign="top">I struggle a bit with the idea of pets/animals as candids but no denying that you have captured a good image</td>', 'I struggle a bit with the idea of pets/animals as candids but no denying that you have captured a good image', '2007-06-11 09:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767099, 533095, 75898, '<td valign="top">This would be a wonderful candid if it weren''t so dark.</td>', 'This would be a wonderful candid if it weren''t so dark.', '2007-06-11 09:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767100, 531862, 68035, '<td valign="top">super dof and the B&amp;W works well</td>', 'super dof and the B&W works well', '2007-06-11 09:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767103, 530801, 8522, '<td valign="top">Old kindly wrinkly faces are always a winner with candids. This has been too overprocessed though, there''s a distinct halo around the face. I don''t tend to like photos where the crop runs through a joint such as the ankle. Could be cropped a little tighter on the right of the frame.</td>', 'Old kindly wrinkly faces are always a winner with candids. This has been too overprocessed though, there''s a distinct halo around the face. I don''t tend to like photos where the crop runs through a joint such as the ankle. Could be cropped a little tighter on the right of the frame.', '2007-06-11 09:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767105, 532954, 68035, '<td valign="top">Yep!!!! Lovely capture and the candid nature of the shot is superbly enhanced by the fact that the main subject is framed by passers by</td>', 'Yep!!!! Lovely capture and the candid nature of the shot is superbly enhanced by the fact that the main subject is framed by passers by', '2007-06-11 09:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767108, 530372, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely old world feel to this picture of a child completely oblivous to anything other than the beach</td>', 'Lovely old world feel to this picture of a child completely oblivous to anything other than the beach', '2007-06-11 09:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767110, 532146, 32754, '<td valign="top">this is very good...the advertisement in background absorbs him and makes him a part of it.</td>', 'this is very good...the advertisement in background absorbs him and makes him a part of it.', '2007-06-11 09:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767111, 531596, 8522, '<td valign="top">Okay, an exhibitionist can be an easy subject of a candid! Don''t just stick your subject in the middle of the shot though, think about composition. Have you come across rule of thirds?</td>', 'Okay, an exhibitionist can be an easy subject of a candid! Don''t just stick your subject in the middle of the shot though, think about composition. Have you come across rule of thirds?', '2007-06-11 09:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767112, 530007, 68035, '<td valign="top">I sooooooo hope that this was not set up<br/> <br/>Great candid of a moment in time</td>', 'I sooooooo hope that this was not set up Great candid of a moment in time', '2007-06-11 09:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767115, 532625, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice image and title although does feel a touch staged</td>', 'Nice image and title although does feel a touch staged', '2007-06-11 09:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767119, 532988, 8522, '<td valign="top">Composition feels too unbalanced. The baby on the left feels accidental rather than deliberate. Same with the person in the background. The light and table is nice though!</td>', 'Composition feels too unbalanced. The baby on the left feels accidental rather than deliberate. Same with the person in the background. The light and table is nice though!', '2007-06-11 09:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767120, 532120, 54228, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, for a mono/duo tone though, I think it needs a little more contrast. Otherwise, you''ve captured the way folk look at their phones well.</td>', 'I really like this shot, for a mono/duo tone though, I think it needs a little more contrast. Otherwise, you''ve captured the way folk look at their phones well.', '2007-06-11 09:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767121, 533106, 75898, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great candid.  The hilights and shadows really direct the eyes.  However, I get an uneasy feeling about what is being shown.  I doubt that everyone is watching the lady (something is probably behind her) but it certainly feels that way.  It kinda makes me uncomfortable.</td>', 'I think this is a great candid.  The hilights and shadows really direct the eyes.  However, I get an uneasy feeling about what is being shown.  I doubt that everyone is watching the lady (something is probably behind her) but it certainly feels that way.  It kinda makes me uncomfortable.', '2007-06-11 09:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767122, 532146, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  Like the way the busker almost merges into the poster behind him and of the counterpoint of his dress and that of the people in the poster<br/> <br/>Very good</td>', 'Lovely shot.  Like the way the busker almost merges into the poster behind him and of the counterpoint of his dress and that of the people in the poster Very good', '2007-06-11 09:24:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3767124, 532026, 70661, '<td valign="top">Nice rainbows.  :) Great candid capture too!</td>', 'Nice rainbows.  :) Great candid capture too!', '2007-06-11 09:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767127, 532208, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice image and colours although on my monitor there appears to be a touch of a sharpening halo in places (perhaps appropriate given where the photo was shot)</td>', 'Nice image and colours although on my monitor there appears to be a touch of a sharpening halo in places (perhaps appropriate given where the photo was shot)', '2007-06-11 09:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767129, 533197, 54228, '<td valign="top">I love the glow here, it represents some sort of bonding to me. Only one thing I''d like to see is the seemingly ''lost'' detail in the dog reclaimed.</td>', 'I love the glow here, it represents some sort of bonding to me. Only one thing I''d like to see is the seemingly ''lost'' detail in the dog reclaimed.', '2007-06-11 09:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767131, 533061, 68035, '<td valign="top">Super image and I love the colours but I do have to say for me this doesnt quite fully encapsulate the idea of a candid</td>', 'Super image and I love the colours but I do have to say for me this doesnt quite fully encapsulate the idea of a candid', '2007-06-11 09:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767132, 532959, 54228, '<td valign="top">This has some great emotion, well edited as well.</td>', 'This has some great emotion, well edited as well.', '2007-06-11 09:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767133, 532821, 8522, '<td valign="top">The problem with candids sometimes is to avoid the photo looking like it was taken by a private detective. You know what I mean, you see them in films when someone is stalking his subject. I think there''s a certain expression that people have that result in photos with this feel. Go for people with amazing expressions who are experiencing strong emotions.</td>', 'The problem with candids sometimes is to avoid the photo looking like it was taken by a private detective. You know what I mean, you see them in films when someone is stalking his subject. I think there''s a certain expression that people have that result in photos with this feel. Go for people with amazing expressions who are experiencing strong emotions.', '2007-06-11 09:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767135, 531953, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and image although the colours could maybe have done with a little boosting</td>', 'Nice focus and image although the colours could maybe have done with a little boosting', '2007-06-11 09:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767136, 532342, 54228, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail, wonderful DOF.</td>', 'Amazing detail, wonderful DOF.', '2007-06-11 09:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767137, 531207, 8522, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that someone performing really counts as a candid. He''s expecting attention and photos.</td>', 'I''m not sure that someone performing really counts as a candid. He''s expecting attention and photos.', '2007-06-11 09:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767139, 531581, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice candid image, I hope you bought those flowers...Excellent bokeh</td>', 'Nice candid image, I hope you bought those flowers...Excellent bokeh', '2007-06-11 09:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767140, 532210, 8522, '<td valign="top">A small child staring straight at the camera. Not a candid.</td>', 'A small child staring straight at the camera. Not a candid.', '2007-06-11 09:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
