(3767145, 532860, 8522, '<td valign="top">Would work better if we could see some faces. There''s very little emotion and character in this shot. A kid is tying a shoelace! That''s pretty mundane.</td>', 'Would work better if we could see some faces. There''s very little emotion and character in this shot. A kid is tying a shoelace! That''s pretty mundane.', '2007-06-11 09:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
