(3767151, 531857, 8522, '<td valign="top">Composition doesn''t quite work for me. The shot is wonky and the bottles right by the face takes away from her expression. The eye finds it hard to know where to settle and what to focus on. The shot needs more of a sense of story.</td>', 'Composition doesn''t quite work for me. The shot is wonky and the bottles right by the face takes away from her expression. The eye finds it hard to know where to settle and what to focus on. The shot needs more of a sense of story.', '2007-06-11 09:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767152, 532170, 68035, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, get the feeling that it may almost have been taken outside and aquarium looking in while someone cleaned it.  The ''noise'' is a shame but inevitable whether you were under the water or not</td>', 'Interesting image, get the feeling that it may almost have been taken outside and aquarium looking in while someone cleaned it.  The ''noise'' is a shame but inevitable whether you were under the water or not', '2007-06-11 09:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
