(3767155, 533091, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice image, feels maybe a touch overprocessed (for my taste), but thats a lovely smile youve caught there</td>', 'Nice image, feels maybe a touch overprocessed (for my taste), but thats a lovely smile youve caught there', '2007-06-11 09:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767157, 529886, 8522, '<td valign="top">Terrible light, avoid midday. Photo is wonky. A square crop can''t rescue a composition which is not strong. Not enough of a sense of story... the viewer needs more clues as to what they''re staring at. Hands can be one of the strongest and most expressive part of a person. Look at the hands of the kid in red... you''ve chopped them off!</td>', 'Terrible light, avoid midday. Photo is wonky. A square crop can''t rescue a composition which is not strong. Not enough of a sense of story... the viewer needs more clues as to what they''re staring at. Hands can be one of the strongest and most expressive part of a person. Look at the hands of the kid in red... you''ve chopped them off!', '2007-06-11 09:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767158, 533166, 54228, '<td valign="top">Definitely something different from the crowd. This has an almost old time feel that I like, and I personally don''t mind the white sky... although something dramatic like a storm would be nice, it is candid after all.</td>', 'Definitely something different from the crowd. This has an almost old time feel that I like, and I personally don''t mind the white sky... although something dramatic like a storm would be nice, it is candid after all.', '2007-06-11 09:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
