(3767167, 528429, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, I just wish you''d captured all of his left hand. Ugly watch, shame about that! Otherwise, it''s a nice, crisp capture of a tender moment. The light from the back is good. It could have done with a tighter crop at the top of the frame. However, this man and his dog aren''t exceptional enough to make this a really striking photo.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, I just wish you''d captured all of his left hand. Ugly watch, shame about that! Otherwise, it''s a nice, crisp capture of a tender moment. The light from the back is good. It could have done with a tighter crop at the top of the frame. However, this man and his dog aren''t exceptional enough to make this a really striking photo.', '2007-06-11 09:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767168, 529507, 54228, '<td valign="top">A great representation of this person. Have you tried a ''dragonizer'' on this to really bring out the aged feel? I think it may just work.</td>', 'A great representation of this person. Have you tried a ''dragonizer'' on this to really bring out the aged feel? I think it may just work.', '2007-06-11 09:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
