(3767180, 532683, 68035, '<td valign="top">What a weird shot!!! I like it  What lloks like water bubbles apparantly coming from the boys navel are very odd...how did they get there (looks like he should be actually underwater for that bit)<br/> <br/>I like it</td>', 'What a weird shot!!! I like it  What lloks like water bubbles apparantly coming from the boys navel are very odd...how did they get there (looks like he should be actually underwater for that bit) I like it', '2007-06-11 09:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767181, 533134, 8522, '<td valign="top">Selective desaturation should not be a remedy for a bad and cluttered composition. The photo doesn''t really tell any kind of story to me or interest me. Why on earth did you colour in the table?</td>', 'Selective desaturation should not be a remedy for a bad and cluttered composition. The photo doesn''t really tell any kind of story to me or interest me. Why on earth did you colour in the table?', '2007-06-11 09:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767183, 529832, 43774, '<td valign="top">I''m not liking the grain although I do like the photo. I am wondering why you added the grain.....my first thought is that you added it to cover up flaws and poor technicals in the photo. But that is my cynical side showing. Maybe you like the grain and feel it adds to the grittiness of a street shot, I don''t know. But normally I don''t like grain and this is no exception. It has to be really well done for me to like it. I would love to see this as a clear image, I know I would score that higher. So I will give this a 5.</td>', 'I''m not liking the grain although I do like the photo. I am wondering why you added the grain.....my first thought is that you added it to cover up flaws and poor technicals in the photo. But that is my cynical side showing. Maybe you like the grain and feel it adds to the grittiness of a street shot, I don''t know. But normally I don''t like grain and this is no exception. It has to be really well done for me to like it. I would love to see this as a clear image, I know I would score that higher. So I will give this a 5.', '2007-06-11 09:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767184, 530180, 54228, '<td valign="top">VERY well done, this has the feeling of one of the old shot''s my grandmother used to keep on the mantlepiece.</td>', 'VERY well done, this has the feeling of one of the old shot''s my grandmother used to keep on the mantlepiece.', '2007-06-11 09:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
