(3767308, 533016, 62787, '<td valign="top">What an amazing shot. I love the way he''s captured in mid-movement, the picture looks really alive. 10<br/> <br/>And, ok, this is more for my sake than yours: the post-processing looks gorgeous, I''d love to know exactly what you did. As far as I can tell, along with standard adjustments, you burnt the shadows and dodged the highlights to bring out the the texture of his skin, used Neat Image to make the skin look smoother, and had a soft light layer with black and white painted to shift the light (with slightly reduced opacity + Gaussian to make the lines less obvious?). <br/> <br/>But anyway, well done, that is very cool.</td>', 'What an amazing shot. I love the way he''s captured in mid-movement, the picture looks really alive. 10 And, ok, this is more for my sake than yours: the post-processing looks gorgeous, I''d love to know exactly what you did. As far as I can tell, along with standard adjustments, you burnt the shadows and dodged the highlights to bring out the the texture of his skin, used Neat Image to make the skin look smoother, and had a soft light layer with black and white painted to shift the light (with slightly reduced opacity + Gaussian to make the lines less obvious?).  But anyway, well done, that is very cool.', '2007-06-11 10:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
