(3767447, 532000, 75898, '<td valign="top">Love the DOF and post processing.  And the fact that he''s smoking while BBQ-ing makes for a funny photo.</td>', 'Love the DOF and post processing.  And the fact that he''s smoking while BBQ-ing makes for a funny photo.', '2007-06-11 10:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767449, 531867, 54228, '<td valign="top">The focus is very clear here and the detail in the man''s face is excellent. Well done with the edit here.</td>', 'The focus is very clear here and the detail in the man''s face is excellent. Well done with the edit here.', '2007-06-11 10:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767456, 531850, 74078, '<td valign="top">Talk about sucking it dry... Great capture of a great subject. Pity about the slightly blown out jacket, but being candid, and I discovered this myself, you dont really get all that much time to take a true candid, thus the lack of preparation in candid shots. 9 from me. Well done</td>', 'Talk about sucking it dry... Great capture of a great subject. Pity about the slightly blown out jacket, but being candid, and I discovered this myself, you dont really get all that much time to take a true candid, thus the lack of preparation in candid shots. 9 from me. Well done', '2007-06-11 10:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767457, 533058, 65858, '<td valign="top">Artistically a nice shot - good feel.  I wish it had more resolution/sharpness... 6</td>', 'Artistically a nice shot - good feel.  I wish it had more resolution/sharpness... 6', '2007-06-11 10:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767460, 532148, 54228, '<td valign="top">I''ve been trying to get a shot like this for so long, great job!</td>', 'I''ve been trying to get a shot like this for so long, great job!', '2007-06-11 10:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767461, 532381, 74078, '<td valign="top">Looks like a run down Danny Glover. Great capture</td>', 'Looks like a run down Danny Glover. Great capture', '2007-06-11 10:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767463, 532223, 47906, '<td valign="top">Nice Diagonals made by the sand and water, nice processing.</td>', 'Nice Diagonals made by the sand and water, nice processing.', '2007-06-11 10:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767472, 532228, 74078, '<td valign="top">There appears to be some slight halo effect around your main subjects. This was probably a result of burning out the remainder of the image to focus the attention on the 2 men busting a gut. The Halo is more prevelant around the torso of the guy on the left and the head of the guy on the right. Without this effect, I would have scored this image higher. A true candid though. Well done. 7</td>', 'There appears to be some slight halo effect around your main subjects. This was probably a result of burning out the remainder of the image to focus the attention on the 2 men busting a gut. The Halo is more prevelant around the torso of the guy on the left and the head of the guy on the right. Without this effect, I would have scored this image higher. A true candid though. Well done. 7', '2007-06-11 10:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767474, 532319, 54228, '<td valign="top">Love the processing, it has that early hollywood feel to it.</td>', 'Love the processing, it has that early hollywood feel to it.', '2007-06-11 10:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767481, 532462, 54228, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! You''ve really captured the essence of this place. 8</td>', 'Beautiful! You''ve really captured the essence of this place. 8', '2007-06-11 10:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767487, 533091, 74078, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured and processed image.</td>', 'Nicely captured and processed image.', '2007-06-11 10:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767490, 531085, 54228, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why, but this appeals to me...</td>', 'I''m not sure why, but this appeals to me...', '2007-06-11 10:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767494, 528828, 74078, '<td valign="top">I like the subject of this image, however there is too many distracting blown out areas that take my attention from the subject.</td>', 'I like the subject of this image, however there is too many distracting blown out areas that take my attention from the subject.', '2007-06-11 10:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767496, 532462, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s a powerful sense of Ennui here, and somehow your bonkers focus and composition is echoed nicely in that street sign - like those moments when the brain just refuses to fire up, and one just stands and stares, and everything seems like it ought to be meaningful if only one could bring some interpretation to it.</td>', 'There''s a powerful sense of Ennui here, and somehow your bonkers focus and composition is echoed nicely in that street sign - like those moments when the brain just refuses to fire up, and one just stands and stares, and everything seems like it ought to be meaningful if only one could bring some interpretation to it.', '2007-06-11 10:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767497, 532740, 74078, '<td valign="top">It is a great shot, but I cannot see the candid relevance in this.</td>', 'It is a great shot, but I cannot see the candid relevance in this.', '2007-06-11 10:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767499, 533188, 74078, '<td valign="top">Sharp neat image. Great subject, perfectly positioned within the frame, and what appears to be true candid. Well done on getting this shot. 8</td>', 'Sharp neat image. Great subject, perfectly positioned within the frame, and what appears to be true candid. Well done on getting this shot. 8', '2007-06-11 10:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767504, 530445, 74078, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this image and the toning used in your processing. Unfortunately the shadows over the gents head takes away from the great capture. 7</td>', 'I like the composition of this image and the toning used in your processing. Unfortunately the shadows over the gents head takes away from the great capture. 7', '2007-06-11 10:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767505, 532812, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strange. Having found such a scene, a moment, and then to undermine the entire faux-pictorial concept with that strange echo of the corpocratic world top right. Great job of pointing us one way only to deliver the solar-plexus blow with the hidden hand. It turns her from a pleasant looking girl having a giggle in a coffee shop into a victim, somehow.</td>', 'Strange. Having found such a scene, a moment, and then to undermine the entire faux-pictorial concept with that strange echo of the corpocratic world top right. Great job of pointing us one way only to deliver the solar-plexus blow with the hidden hand. It turns her from a pleasant looking girl having a giggle in a coffee shop into a victim, somehow.', '2007-06-11 10:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767511, 532979, 74078, '<td valign="top">Fantastic Capture. Great emotion captured in both of your subjects and I think that the BW processing in this helps to excentuate the the emotions. Well composed and the only thing that I can comment on the downside is a slight white halo around the gentleman on the left. 9 for me. Well done</td>', 'Fantastic Capture. Great emotion captured in both of your subjects and I think that the BW processing in this helps to excentuate the the emotions. Well composed and the only thing that I can comment on the downside is a slight white halo around the gentleman on the left. 9 for me. Well done', '2007-06-11 10:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767513, 532740, 75898, '<td valign="top">I just took some dragonfly candids yesterday.  They were nowhere near this good!  Did you use a flash?  Is this a drastic crop or were you pretty close?</td>', 'I just took some dragonfly candids yesterday.  They were nowhere near this good!  Did you use a flash?  Is this a drastic crop or were you pretty close?', '2007-06-11 10:52:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3767518, 531865, 43774, '<td valign="top">Your title doesn''t make sense, sorry. It should just be "Je t''aime". If you were to translate the title you have there now it would be "I love you you". And since "vous" is the form of "you" one uses when speaking in a formal sense or speaking to a person you don''t know, it is not grammatically correct to even use it with the word "aime" (love). There''s your French lesson for the day, LOL (I was a French teacher).<br/> <br/>7 for the photo.</td>', 'Your title doesn''t make sense, sorry. It should just be "Je t''aime". If you were to translate the title you have there now it would be "I love you you". And since "vous" is the form of "you" one uses when speaking in a formal sense or speaking to a person you don''t know, it is not grammatically correct to even use it with the word "aime" (love). There''s your French lesson for the day, LOL (I was a French teacher). 7 for the photo.', '2007-06-11 10:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767519, 532947, 75898, '<td valign="top">Great choice for a B&amp;W.</td>', 'Great choice for a B&W.', '2007-06-11 10:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767524, 532595, 75898, '<td valign="top">I''m curious about the lens you used for this.  It''s a very dramatic shot with the ship being so close to shore.  Did you use a split-field lens or something?</td>', 'I''m curious about the lens you used for this.  It''s a very dramatic shot with the ship being so close to shore.  Did you use a split-field lens or something?', '2007-06-11 10:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767531, 533098, 74078, '<td valign="top">In an advanced editing challenge this one appears to be a Point and Shoot image. Massive amounts of noise and blowouts in the skin in the two people on the right.</td>', 'In an advanced editing challenge this one appears to be a Point and Shoot image. Massive amounts of noise and blowouts in the skin in the two people on the right.', '2007-06-11 10:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3767539, 532882, 43774, '<td valign="top">I have to correct your title. Because you are speaking of a girl, you need to use the feminine form of the word "doux" which would be "douce". I used to be a French teacher, so there''s a French lesson for the day. Hope you don''t mind!</td>', 'I have to correct your title. Because you are speaking of a girl, you need to use the feminine form of the word "doux" which would be "douce". I used to be a French teacher, so there''s a French lesson for the day. Hope you don''t mind!', '2007-06-11 11:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
