(3767994, 530723, 36006, '<td valign="top">why must you use the word "candid"?<br/> <br/>The title sucks...<br/> <br/>Photographically speaking however, excellent comp, excellent light, great texture, excellent tonal value, does not convince me that this is truly a candid, it looks set up. As a photographer, it is your job to be convincing.<br/> <br/>Over all, I predict this picture to be in the top 20.</td>', 'why must you use the word "candid"? The title sucks... Photographically speaking however, excellent comp, excellent light, great texture, excellent tonal value, does not convince me that this is truly a candid, it looks set up. As a photographer, it is your job to be convincing. Over all, I predict this picture to be in the top 20.', '2007-06-11 13:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
