(3768022, 528225, 36006, '<td valign="top">OK, this could of been a really good image, but the thing is, my eye is drawn to the subject knees.<br/> <br/>I feel like I am a pedafile (sp) looking at this image.<br/> <br/>The face gives more impact than the knees do, showing here emotion.<br/> <br/>If you had waited just another second, and "anticipated" her swing, you would of been able to shoot her face, and not her knees.<br/> <br/>Poor comp, great color, nice light, interesting dof, good texture<br/> <br/>As for the title, I am not convinced of ''blissfulness''. Since you are forcing me to look at her knees, my thoughts are far from blissfulness.</td>', 'OK, this could of been a really good image, but the thing is, my eye is drawn to the subject knees. I feel like I am a pedafile (sp) looking at this image. The face gives more impact than the knees do, showing here emotion. If you had waited just another second, and "anticipated" her swing, you would of been able to shoot her face, and not her knees. Poor comp, great color, nice light, interesting dof, good texture As for the title, I am not convinced of ''blissfulness''. Since you are forcing me to look at her knees, my thoughts are far from blissfulness.', '2007-06-11 13:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3768023, 532596, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the composition - suits this well.</td>', 'I like the composition - suits this well.', '2007-06-11 13:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
