(3768881, 532308, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m very much into the whole windows/reflections thing - there''s so much to see, so many layers.  This one is quite enjoyable - I very much like the composition.  She''s wint someone, he''s with someone.  Maybe they''re both missing on on what''s right behind them.  Lots of story here.</td>', 'I''m very much into the whole windows/reflections thing - there''s so much to see, so many layers.  This one is quite enjoyable - I very much like the composition.  She''s wint someone, he''s with someone.  Maybe they''re both missing on on what''s right behind them.  Lots of story here.', '2007-06-11 16:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
