(3768928, 531846, 33352, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W a bit dark, but a good moment...</td>', 'B&W a bit dark, but a good moment...', '2007-06-11 17:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3768934, 531867, 33352, '<td valign="top">Very good moment with impact...</td>', 'Very good moment with impact...', '2007-06-11 17:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3768958, 531898, 772, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  I hope to see this one on the front page next week :)  It''s a  very dynamic action capture.  One of my favorite elements of candid/street type photography is having something interesting going on in the photo, and you have nailed that part :)  This photo also made a great black and white.. nice work :) 10</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  I hope to see this one on the front page next week :)  It''s a  very dynamic action capture.  One of my favorite elements of candid/street type photography is having something interesting going on in the photo, and you have nailed that part :)  This photo also made a great black and white.. nice work :) 10', '2007-06-11 17:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3768982, 532740, 70181, '<td valign="top">Great macro.  The detail in the wings is excellent.</td>', 'Great macro.  The detail in the wings is excellent.', '2007-06-11 17:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3768986, 531057, 70181, '<td valign="top">It''s sharp and well composed.</td>', 'It''s sharp and well composed.', '2007-06-11 17:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3768987, 530141, 70181, '<td valign="top">Good looking dog.</td>', 'Good looking dog.', '2007-06-11 17:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3768991, 532925, 70181, '<td valign="top">Nice street shot, but unfortunately I can''t score it high in a "candid" challenge where you expect to see people.</td>', 'Nice street shot, but unfortunately I can''t score it high in a "candid" challenge where you expect to see people.', '2007-06-11 17:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769008, 532680, 52285, '<td valign="top">this is one of the few really candid and interesting moments I have seen so far in the challenge; pity her face is partially covered by the flowers, but I guess you didn''t have much coiche than shooting from where you were</td>', 'this is one of the few really candid and interesting moments I have seen so far in the challenge; pity her face is partially covered by the flowers, but I guess you didn''t have much coiche than shooting from where you were', '2007-06-11 17:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769029, 530677, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and moment of dignity. 8.</td>', 'I like the subject and moment of dignity. 8.', '2007-06-11 17:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769030, 533124, 51538, '<td valign="top">I had to hit reverse gear and come back to see this again.  Flipping through these photos (far too many dull uninspired work in this challenge), one is apt to miss the subtle images.  Yours has a certain something - yet remains perfectly ordinary.  The headdress, the look, the door sign... all says something; lines in a story which the view can complete.  8.</td>', 'I had to hit reverse gear and come back to see this again.  Flipping through these photos (far too many dull uninspired work in this challenge), one is apt to miss the subtle images.  Yours has a certain something - yet remains perfectly ordinary.  The headdress, the look, the door sign... all says something; lines in a story which the view can complete.  8.', '2007-06-11 17:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769032, 533089, 51538, '<td valign="top">Elegant tones and composition. 7.</td>', 'Elegant tones and composition. 7.', '2007-06-11 17:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769035, 531228, 51538, '<td valign="top">Forms make this image excellent.  The story makes up for the lighting and all else that might be wrong. 8.</td>', 'Forms make this image excellent.  The story makes up for the lighting and all else that might be wrong. 8.', '2007-06-11 17:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769036, 532812, 51538, '<td valign="top">Charming moment and nice exposure. 8.</td>', 'Charming moment and nice exposure. 8.', '2007-06-11 17:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769039, 531782, 15711, '<td valign="top">The pop of red from the luggage makes the shot!!</td>', 'The pop of red from the luggage makes the shot!!', '2007-06-11 17:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769043, 533166, 43156, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, just a bit overprocessed for me. 6</td>', 'I like the shot, just a bit overprocessed for me. 6', '2007-06-11 17:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769044, 532208, 66201, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and hues...I like the processing.</td>', 'Lovely lighting and hues...I like the processing.', '2007-06-11 17:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
