(3769063, 531228, 75898, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of an equally cowboy-ish and sweet moment (which I don''t think is all that common).</td>', 'Excellent capture of an equally cowboy-ish and sweet moment (which I don''t think is all that common).', '2007-06-11 17:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
