(3769065, 532266, 64795, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!  Very creative.  I love it... A lot. :) 9</td>', 'This is awesome!  Very creative.  I love it... A lot. :) 9', '2007-06-11 17:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769069, 533091, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and showing a great close shot of her joyful expression.</td>', 'Nice lighting and showing a great close shot of her joyful expression.', '2007-06-11 17:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769070, 531983, 64795, '<td valign="top">This is definitely a great moment captured, but the noise is a little distracting.</td>', 'This is definitely a great moment captured, but the noise is a little distracting.', '2007-06-11 17:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769073, 529735, 64795, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get the title....</td>', 'I don''t really get the title....', '2007-06-11 17:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769078, 533100, 66201, '<td valign="top">Lovely character - the whites at the right are a bit hot, but it''s a good capture.</td>', 'Lovely character - the whites at the right are a bit hot, but it''s a good capture.', '2007-06-11 17:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769080, 531931, 23430, '<td valign="top">Looks dramatic. Nice light through the wave too. Composition is fairly good.</td>', 'Looks dramatic. Nice light through the wave too. Composition is fairly good.', '2007-06-11 17:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769081, 532148, 66201, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture - love the contextualising of them by including the street around them.</td>', 'Fantastic capture - love the contextualising of them by including the street around them.', '2007-06-11 17:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769083, 532089, 66201, '<td valign="top">Wish the light focus was on his face instead of his chest...bit too much sharpening which has resulted in the zinging strings. Great character.</td>', 'Wish the light focus was on his face instead of his chest...bit too much sharpening which has resulted in the zinging strings. Great character.', '2007-06-11 17:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769088, 530199, 31403, '<td valign="top">crop right down to her - the half man isn''t doing your composition any favors, and the headroom could go too.  Great shot that begs many a question.</td>', 'crop right down to her - the half man isn''t doing your composition any favors, and the headroom could go too.  Great shot that begs many a question.', '2007-06-11 17:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769090, 532938, 31403, '<td valign="top">wrong guy''s in focus - sorry</td>', 'wrong guy''s in focus - sorry', '2007-06-11 17:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769094, 532342, 27133, '<td valign="top">Good detail and reflection in the glasses.  The background makes his whiskers stand out.  Good texture to his face.</td>', 'Good detail and reflection in the glasses.  The background makes his whiskers stand out.  Good texture to his face.', '2007-06-11 17:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769096, 532740, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot. Good angle and nice and sharp. I can''t count it as candid though.</td>', 'Great macro shot. Good angle and nice and sharp. I can''t count it as candid though.', '2007-06-11 17:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769104, 532060, 27133, '<td valign="top">A little noisy but what a character.</td>', 'A little noisy but what a character.', '2007-06-11 17:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769109, 532951, 27133, '<td valign="top">Good angle and sharp details.</td>', 'Good angle and sharp details.', '2007-06-11 18:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769110, 532527, 31403, '<td valign="top">I''m giving you a 7 for a candid that is looking at the camera :-)</td>', 'I''m giving you a 7 for a candid that is looking at the camera :-)', '2007-06-11 18:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769111, 532939, 31403, '<td valign="top">low contrast hurts this - blacker blacks would be better IMO</td>', 'low contrast hurts this - blacker blacks would be better IMO', '2007-06-11 18:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769112, 531145, 31403, '<td valign="top">extra point for a candid that is looking at the camera - 8</td>', 'extra point for a candid that is looking at the camera - 8', '2007-06-11 18:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769118, 532119, 31403, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot 8 for now</td>', 'I like this a lot 8 for now', '2007-06-11 18:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769129, 532417, 31403, '<td valign="top">I know you are so pleased with the gap that you shot her through, but she''s so small with that big, visually heavy, bridge over her, really compositionally diminishes her.  I''d recommend a much tighter crop.  Her alone would negate your cool timing, no doubt, because they would be out of the frame, but would make me wonder what she was thinking, would involve me more in "her story".<br/> <br/>FWIW.  It''s great work, and fearless shooting standing in front of her.  :-)</td>', 'I know you are so pleased with the gap that you shot her through, but she''s so small with that big, visually heavy, bridge over her, really compositionally diminishes her.  I''d recommend a much tighter crop.  Her alone would negate your cool timing, no doubt, because they would be out of the frame, but would make me wonder what she was thinking, would involve me more in "her story". FWIW.  It''s great work, and fearless shooting standing in front of her.  :-)', '2007-06-11 18:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769136, 531030, 31403, '<td valign="top">wow!  if you have the resolution, I''d crop right down to them.  those faces and the fact they are so sharply in focus is a wonderful candid find!  Somewhat diluted by the smallness of it in frame.  Great candid photography in my book.  7</td>', 'wow!  if you have the resolution, I''d crop right down to them.  those faces and the fact they are so sharply in focus is a wonderful candid find!  Somewhat diluted by the smallness of it in frame.  Great candid photography in my book.  7', '2007-06-11 18:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769143, 533205, 77192, '<td valign="top">rofl, I like her "gesture". I think it''d have worked even better if you''d cropped tighter and possibly cloned out the wire above their heads.</td>', 'rofl, I like her "gesture". I think it''d have worked even better if you''d cropped tighter and possibly cloned out the wire above their heads.', '2007-06-11 18:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769148, 533034, 77192, '<td valign="top">Wow! nice strong colours and well frozen shot</td>', 'Wow! nice strong colours and well frozen shot', '2007-06-11 18:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769152, 531387, 31403, '<td valign="top">wow<br/>wow<br/>wow<br/> <br/>Look at what you did!!!  This is such a great essay on modern culture, on consumerism, on the overload of information, just amazing.  could that guy be any more perfect if you had cast this and scheduled a shoot?<br/> <br/>The processing on him is a little sloppy - the front of his face burned into the shelf behind it, the shorts and shirt feel like the burning bled into them too.  The face is the key point here, the puzzlement the message of the whole shot IMO, so I''m going 9 instead of the 10.  But what a great catch.  and if you staged it, way to stage a candid!</td>', 'wowwowwow Look at what you did!!!  This is such a great essay on modern culture, on consumerism, on the overload of information, just amazing.  could that guy be any more perfect if you had cast this and scheduled a shoot? The processing on him is a little sloppy - the front of his face burned into the shelf behind it, the shorts and shirt feel like the burning bled into them too.  The face is the key point here, the puzzlement the message of the whole shot IMO, so I''m going 9 instead of the 10.  But what a great catch.  and if you staged it, way to stage a candid!', '2007-06-11 18:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769154, 532459, 77192, '<td valign="top">rofl this reminds me of the Panasonic adverts on TV in the UK at the moment, where an elderly lady is sniggering at a nude male statue</td>', 'rofl this reminds me of the Panasonic adverts on TV in the UK at the moment, where an elderly lady is sniggering at a nude male statue', '2007-06-11 18:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769159, 533109, 77192, '<td valign="top">I like your title. It puts me in mind of her expression, which yoiu''ve captured very well.</td>', 'I like your title. It puts me in mind of her expression, which yoiu''ve captured very well.', '2007-06-11 18:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769165, 531837, 31403, '<td valign="top">stunning - almost looks posed, but I believe you shot candid.  Hope the other voters are giving you the benefit of the doubt.  Challenge descriptions seem to be more a club to beat people with anymore, so I''m afraid for you.  :-)<br/> <br/>Great great work, love the textures, I can feel her sweater from here.  9</td>', 'stunning - almost looks posed, but I believe you shot candid.  Hope the other voters are giving you the benefit of the doubt.  Challenge descriptions seem to be more a club to beat people with anymore, so I''m afraid for you.  :-) Great great work, love the textures, I can feel her sweater from here.  9', '2007-06-11 18:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769166, 531857, 77192, '<td valign="top">looks a bit overprocessed :-(</td>', 'looks a bit overprocessed :-(', '2007-06-11 18:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769169, 532184, 43156, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, good story. 9</td>', 'Nice pic, good story. 9', '2007-06-11 18:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769172, 533083, 31403, '<td valign="top">love the blur on the hand - nice work</td>', 'love the blur on the hand - nice work', '2007-06-11 18:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769173, 532961, 77192, '<td valign="top">I''ve have preferred to see either of their faces more clearly</td>', 'I''ve have preferred to see either of their faces more clearly', '2007-06-11 18:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769178, 531931, 77192, '<td valign="top">Well captured shot :-)</td>', 'Well captured shot :-)', '2007-06-11 18:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769179, 532130, 56672, '<td valign="top">Animals just aren''t candid, to me.  They are unaware of photography and they don''t modify their behavior when they think they''re being watched, especially from a distance.</td>', 'Animals just aren''t candid, to me.  They are unaware of photography and they don''t modify their behavior when they think they''re being watched, especially from a distance.', '2007-06-11 18:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769182, 532680, 31403, '<td valign="top">no way!!!  You caught THAT!  I''ll bet you were grinning from ear to ear.  It''s got it all - very candid, a story we can all see at once, and very nicely processed.  the strongest I''ve seen so far.  9 for now.</td>', 'no way!!!  You caught THAT!  I''ll bet you were grinning from ear to ear.  It''s got it all - very candid, a story we can all see at once, and very nicely processed.  the strongest I''ve seen so far.  9 for now.', '2007-06-11 18:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769186, 532724, 42100, '<td valign="top">The repetition of stripes is a strong theme for this photo and adds interest.  The scene in general though is awfully busy...background elements distract.</td>', 'The repetition of stripes is a strong theme for this photo and adds interest.  The scene in general though is awfully busy...background elements distract.', '2007-06-11 18:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769187, 532613, 31403, '<td valign="top">he seems oblivious - I hope I haven''t walked oblivious past something like that in my life! I''m sure my wife has that look everytime I walk by though.  :-)  Great catch</td>', 'he seems oblivious - I hope I haven''t walked oblivious past something like that in my life! I''m sure my wife has that look everytime I walk by though.  :-)  Great catch', '2007-06-11 18:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
