(3769260, 532353, 4411, '<td valign="top">Love the title. It aroused my curiosity enough to break out Google and track down its origin. Can''t say I''m a great Mary Poppins fan though!<br/> <br/>As for the photo, it is a good street scene, but the birdfeeder kind of gets lost amongst the rest of the scene. I guess I''m a fan of ''in tight'' crops.</td>', 'Love the title. It aroused my curiosity enough to break out Google and track down its origin. Can''t say I''m a great Mary Poppins fan though! As for the photo, it is a good street scene, but the birdfeeder kind of gets lost amongst the rest of the scene. I guess I''m a fan of ''in tight'' crops.', '2007-06-11 18:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769268, 532244, 9906, '<td valign="top">This looks to posed to do good in a Candid challenge...  You used the onboard flash.  This messed with your skin tones (too bluish) and makes the image very flat.  Next time you may want to play around with more natural lighting (like by a window) and diffuse the flash (or better yet just turn it off and use a reflector) to make sure you have the catch light in the eyes as you have here.<br/>TC</td>', 'This looks to posed to do good in a Candid challenge...  You used the onboard flash.  This messed with your skin tones (too bluish) and makes the image very flat.  Next time you may want to play around with more natural lighting (like by a window) and diffuse the flash (or better yet just turn it off and use a reflector) to make sure you have the catch light in the eyes as you have here.TC', '2007-06-11 18:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
