(3769551, 532381, 57378, '<td valign="top">Lots to look at - Maybe let down a little with technical issues such as sharpness etc.</td>', 'Lots to look at - Maybe let down a little with technical issues such as sharpness etc.', '2007-06-11 19:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
