(3769556, 533091, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - Like the simple pose and composition - Have the eyes been over sharpened as they look a little un-natural. Still sweet though.</td>', 'Nice capture - Like the simple pose and composition - Have the eyes been over sharpened as they look a little un-natural. Still sweet though.', '2007-06-11 19:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
