(3771992, 531898, 60614, '<td valign="top">Priceless.  Love the use of B/W tones.  The expressions are great.  This is a very nice well composed crisp photo.  You can definately feel the excitement.</td>', 'Priceless.  Love the use of B/W tones.  The expressions are great.  This is a very nice well composed crisp photo.  You can definately feel the excitement.', '2007-06-12 08:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
