(3773382, 533109, 79242, '<td valign="top">I think there is a little too much dead space on the left side of the picture</td>', 'I think there is a little too much dead space on the left side of the picture', '2007-06-12 15:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773387, 533145, 49865, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, especially with all the food still plastered to her face. Clean, crisp, well-lit, and incidentally I think you have the same tent my friend does.</td>', 'This is a great shot, especially with all the food still plastered to her face. Clean, crisp, well-lit, and incidentally I think you have the same tent my friend does.', '2007-06-12 15:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773393, 531871, 49865, '<td valign="top">This is an adorable role reversal - usually it''s the young explaining to the old how technology works. Something''s odd about the boy''s eyelids though - they seem to be reflecting too much light.</td>', 'This is an adorable role reversal - usually it''s the young explaining to the old how technology works. Something''s odd about the boy''s eyelids though - they seem to be reflecting too much light.', '2007-06-12 15:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773396, 533050, 49865, '<td valign="top">Took me a second to figure out what was going on here. This photo would be a little bit better I think if you were at an angle such that the wind wasn''t blowing the smoke straight into line of sight with the screw/spring in her mouth. Otherwise it''s good.</td>', 'Took me a second to figure out what was going on here. This photo would be a little bit better I think if you were at an angle such that the wind wasn''t blowing the smoke straight into line of sight with the screw/spring in her mouth. Otherwise it''s good.', '2007-06-12 15:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773400, 532026, 71958, '<td valign="top">don''t like this border that much</td>', 'don''t like this border that much', '2007-06-12 15:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773408, 531323, 70514, '<td valign="top">Great thinking!  Love this being SO different!</td>', 'Great thinking!  Love this being SO different!', '2007-06-12 15:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773413, 532445, 49865, '<td valign="top">Image is a little bit too dark to make the man out clearly - this probably would''ve been a bit better if there wasn''t a person directly behind his head - the black skirt creates a low-contrast buffer around his face so his expression doesn''t stand out as much as it should.</td>', 'Image is a little bit too dark to make the man out clearly - this probably would''ve been a bit better if there wasn''t a person directly behind his head - the black skirt creates a low-contrast buffer around his face so his expression doesn''t stand out as much as it should.', '2007-06-12 16:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773416, 532779, 49865, '<td valign="top">Great photo, strong colors, smooth crisp look.</td>', 'Great photo, strong colors, smooth crisp look.', '2007-06-12 16:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773418, 532269, 70514, '<td valign="top">This makes me want to sit down and have a bite!  What a fun little snippet of life, and great PP.</td>', 'This makes me want to sit down and have a bite!  What a fun little snippet of life, and great PP.', '2007-06-12 16:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773419, 529478, 49865, '<td valign="top">You''re probably going to get decked a bit for the camera angle and motion blur in this photo, but I think they lend something to the grit of the scene.</td>', 'You''re probably going to get decked a bit for the camera angle and motion blur in this photo, but I think they lend something to the grit of the scene.', '2007-06-12 16:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773421, 533205, 49865, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure this is the most appropriate or tasteful submission...</td>', 'I''m not really sure this is the most appropriate or tasteful submission...', '2007-06-12 16:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773422, 532603, 79242, '<td valign="top">I would like to be able to see a little more of the childs face...</td>', 'I would like to be able to see a little more of the childs face...', '2007-06-12 16:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773423, 531837, 70514, '<td valign="top">I love that she''s just got this little smirk... mid-motion.  Nice capture.  Reminds me of my mom.</td>', 'I love that she''s just got this little smirk... mid-motion.  Nice capture.  Reminds me of my mom.', '2007-06-12 16:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773426, 532462, 70514, '<td valign="top">I love the darkness, I think it adds to the dreary rainy day.</td>', 'I love the darkness, I think it adds to the dreary rainy day.', '2007-06-12 16:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773429, 532254, 49865, '<td valign="top">Oh great portrait, that expression is amazing, if not a bit upset looking. This is the kind of thing that''s nice to see in candids - raw emotion that''s not censored by the presence of a camera.</td>', 'Oh great portrait, that expression is amazing, if not a bit upset looking. This is the kind of thing that''s nice to see in candids - raw emotion that''s not censored by the presence of a camera.', '2007-06-12 16:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773431, 532922, 70514, '<td valign="top">I like the light reflecting off the water.  A sweet moment for the ladies.</td>', 'I like the light reflecting off the water.  A sweet moment for the ladies.', '2007-06-12 16:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773432, 532268, 49865, '<td valign="top">A lovely family portrait. I like that the focus is sharpest at the amulet itself.</td>', 'A lovely family portrait. I like that the focus is sharpest at the amulet itself.', '2007-06-12 16:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773437, 532865, 70514, '<td valign="top">But he''s wearing a shirt that says, "Let''s be bad"! LOL!  I love the irony!</td>', 'But he''s wearing a shirt that says, "Let''s be bad"! LOL!  I love the irony!', '2007-06-12 16:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773442, 529831, 70514, '<td valign="top">Great directing lines and nice to showcase a different subject.</td>', 'Great directing lines and nice to showcase a different subject.', '2007-06-12 16:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773445, 532979, 70514, '<td valign="top">They look like old friends.  What a wonderful life moment.</td>', 'They look like old friends.  What a wonderful life moment.', '2007-06-12 16:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773446, 532725, 79242, '<td valign="top">I like it, but there is a little too much dead space on the left, very good though</td>', 'I like it, but there is a little too much dead space on the left, very good though', '2007-06-12 16:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773449, 532417, 49865, '<td valign="top">Image is a little too dark overall, I feel, and the background is kind of distracting. Maybe a different angle would''ve helped give the image a bit more much needed constrast, say lining the girl up against one of those trees instead of the very dark building.</td>', 'Image is a little too dark overall, I feel, and the background is kind of distracting. Maybe a different angle would''ve helped give the image a bit more much needed constrast, say lining the girl up against one of those trees instead of the very dark building.', '2007-06-12 16:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773454, 533127, 79242, '<td valign="top">I think a candid cannot be of an animal......</td>', 'I think a candid cannot be of an animal......', '2007-06-12 16:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773456, 532377, 70514, '<td valign="top">Very funny... and leaves me wondering, "What''s that kid up to now?".  Gotta love his little swimmers peeking out as well.</td>', 'Very funny... and leaves me wondering, "What''s that kid up to now?".  Gotta love his little swimmers peeking out as well.', '2007-06-12 16:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773459, 528429, 49865, '<td valign="top">I have a soft spot for Westies. Lovely portrait of a man and his dog. The tight  (and sharp) focus does a lot for capturing both of their expressions.</td>', 'I have a soft spot for Westies. Lovely portrait of a man and his dog. The tight  (and sharp) focus does a lot for capturing both of their expressions.', '2007-06-12 16:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773468, 531323, 41357, '<td valign="top">Seems to me you forgot to rotate the pic- nice idea</td>', 'Seems to me you forgot to rotate the pic- nice idea', '2007-06-12 16:10:47.000000', NULL, 1);
