(3775131, 531867, 61651, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very nice shot, but I feel the vignette isn''t doing you any favors here, that it particularly hems your subject in too close on the left side.  I''m usually not adverse to use of vignette, but for this shot I think it''s too much.  I very much like what you''ve capture here, though, the look of concentration, the work with the hands, the detail in the attire.  B&amp;W suits it too. 8</td>', 'I think this is a very nice shot, but I feel the vignette isn''t doing you any favors here, that it particularly hems your subject in too close on the left side.  I''m usually not adverse to use of vignette, but for this shot I think it''s too much.  I very much like what you''ve capture here, though, the look of concentration, the work with the hands, the detail in the attire.  B&W suits it too. 8', '2007-06-12 23:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
