(3777213, 532982, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely genuine candid, thought the subject doesnt look overly enamoured with it.  Good capture of (grumpy) emotion</td>', 'Lovely genuine candid, thought the subject doesnt look overly enamoured with it.  Good capture of (grumpy) emotion', '2007-06-13 05:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777214, 533087, 68035, '<td valign="top">Intriguing image...Is the subject a down and out or a vendor?  Why has he got a chair?  Makes me want to know more about whats going on which I think is excellent in terms of the competition</td>', 'Intriguing image...Is the subject a down and out or a vendor?  Why has he got a chair?  Makes me want to know more about whats going on which I think is excellent in terms of the competition', '2007-06-13 05:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
