(3777217, 530801, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely example of a grizzled old man''.  There are plenty of these in this challenge, but the excellent sharpness and the lovely understated colouring makes this one of the better ones</td>', 'Lovely example of a grizzled old man''.  There are plenty of these in this challenge, but the excellent sharpness and the lovely understated colouring makes this one of the better ones', '2007-06-13 05:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
