(3777846, 531573, 74559, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot! Great looking bike nicely framed, pink flowers in the background create a nice contrast with bike but match bricks, best of all is the reflection of the city in his helmet.</td>', 'Very cool shot! Great looking bike nicely framed, pink flowers in the background create a nice contrast with bike but match bricks, best of all is the reflection of the city in his helmet.', '2007-06-13 09:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777856, 533016, 74559, '<td valign="top">Great color, nice shot!</td>', 'Great color, nice shot!', '2007-06-13 10:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777861, 532397, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice image although (on my monitor at least) the spotlights are causing a bit of blow out on the monumment</td>', 'Nice image although (on my monitor at least) the spotlights are causing a bit of blow out on the monumment', '2007-06-13 10:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777867, 532785, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely coffee house shot which captures well that friends dont have to always be speaking to be communicating and enjoying the comfort of each others company</td>', 'Lovely coffee house shot which captures well that friends dont have to always be speaking to be communicating and enjoying the comfort of each others company', '2007-06-13 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777871, 529886, 68035, '<td valign="top">Super image for the simple fact that it makes me want to know what has captured their attention.  A bit blown on (on my monitor) on some of the skin tones but an intriguing shot</td>', 'Super image for the simple fact that it makes me want to know what has captured their attention.  A bit blown on (on my monitor) on some of the skin tones but an intriguing shot', '2007-06-13 10:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777876, 531473, 68035, '<td valign="top">Candid or posed? (I will mark as the former)<br/> <br/>Believe it or not the things that first jumped into my head when I saw this were:<br/> <br/>1.  Gee she needs a smaller bikini bottom<br/>2.  Blimey that bum is white<br/>3.  I wonder how this photo was taken without getting and blow out (of the colour rather than the flatulant variety)</td>', 'Candid or posed? (I will mark as the former) Believe it or not the things that first jumped into my head when I saw this were: 1.  Gee she needs a smaller bikini bottom2.  Blimey that bum is white3.  I wonder how this photo was taken without getting and blow out (of the colour rather than the flatulant variety)', '2007-06-13 10:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777880, 532121, 68035, '<td valign="top">Interesting B&amp;W although possibly could do with some greater tonal contrasts and being a touch sharper to really bring it out<br/> <br/>Good candid though... Police Force meets the Village People!!!</td>', 'Interesting B&W although possibly could do with some greater tonal contrasts and being a touch sharper to really bring it out Good candid though... Police Force meets the Village People!!!', '2007-06-13 10:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777884, 532754, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice melancholic look, could possbly have done with a touch more contrast as the face does not really pop from the material in the background</td>', 'Nice melancholic look, could possbly have done with a touch more contrast as the face does not really pop from the material in the background', '2007-06-13 10:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777886, 533132, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely captured moment.  On a day when I bet there were hundreds of posed shots this kind of candid image has a unique beauty</td>', 'Lovely captured moment.  On a day when I bet there were hundreds of posed shots this kind of candid image has a unique beauty', '2007-06-13 10:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777890, 532566, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice expression (and equipement...sigh) but the shot does not really scream candid at me.  Technically very nice</td>', 'Nice expression (and equipement...sigh) but the shot does not really scream candid at me.  Technically very nice', '2007-06-13 10:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777893, 531854, 68035, '<td valign="top">Beuatiful and wistful, kind of reminds me of Bubbles on the old pears soap adverts, love the soft focus</td>', 'Beuatiful and wistful, kind of reminds me of Bubbles on the old pears soap adverts, love the soft focus', '2007-06-13 10:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777897, 532223, 68035, '<td valign="top">Has a very desolate feel and image sizing makes it feel as if it would be just right for a coffee shop wall (thats not a bad thing btw)</td>', 'Has a very desolate feel and image sizing makes it feel as if it would be just right for a coffee shop wall (thats not a bad thing btw)', '2007-06-13 10:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777900, 531393, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very well executed and a lovely B&amp;W conversion.  Strange image but nevertheless very appealing visually</td>', 'Very well executed and a lovely B&W conversion.  Strange image but nevertheless very appealing visually', '2007-06-13 10:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777909, 531768, 68035, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure whether this is a ''pure'' candid, as i kind get teh feeling that he must have been aware of your presence, but still a very good image.  I would love to know how you pp''d it as the colours have a wonderful muted surrealness to them, which suits the image subject completely</td>', 'Not quite sure whether this is a ''pure'' candid, as i kind get teh feeling that he must have been aware of your presence, but still a very good image.  I would love to know how you pp''d it as the colours have a wonderful muted surrealness to them, which suits the image subject completely', '2007-06-13 10:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777912, 532319, 68035, '<td valign="top">Super lighting and lovely desat work, combines a crispness and a softness simultaneously</td>', 'Super lighting and lovely desat work, combines a crispness and a softness simultaneously', '2007-06-13 10:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777915, 531471, 68035, '<td valign="top">An interesting image, but seems a little washed out on my monitor</td>', 'An interesting image, but seems a little washed out on my monitor', '2007-06-13 10:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777918, 531865, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot of a father and daughter caught in a moment together.  Really top notch B&amp;W conversion with a great range of tones and contrasts</td>', 'Lovely shot of a father and daughter caught in a moment together.  Really top notch B&W conversion with a great range of tones and contrasts', '2007-06-13 10:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777922, 532089, 68035, '<td valign="top">Intriguing shot which at once both makes complete sense and at the same time seems to be made of somewhat disassociated elements.  Overall the effect is good although possibly a touch more brightness required</td>', 'Intriguing shot which at once both makes complete sense and at the same time seems to be made of somewhat disassociated elements.  Overall the effect is good although possibly a touch more brightness required', '2007-06-13 10:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777924, 533004, 68035, '<td valign="top">Hey a yellow duck shot that I like!!!!! Kudos!!!!  Nice capture of simple unbridled childhood joy</td>', 'Hey a yellow duck shot that I like!!!!! Kudos!!!!  Nice capture of simple unbridled childhood joy', '2007-06-13 10:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777927, 529747, 68035, '<td valign="top">Good image and very well executed, super bokeh.  You seem to have captured a wisdom of years in the subjects eyes</td>', 'Good image and very well executed, super bokeh.  You seem to have captured a wisdom of years in the subjects eyes', '2007-06-13 10:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777932, 533166, 68035, '<td valign="top">No doubt a lot of people will be telling you that this is not really a candid but I quite like it as something different..  Seem to be some strange noise artifacts on the picture, was there any minor smudges on the lens?</td>', 'No doubt a lot of people will be telling you that this is not really a candid but I quite like it as something different..  Seem to be some strange noise artifacts on the picture, was there any minor smudges on the lens?', '2007-06-13 10:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777937, 532055, 68035, '<td valign="top">LOL that dog looks as if it has some serious doubts that any sharing is going to take place.  Nice B&amp;W conversion</td>', 'LOL that dog looks as if it has some serious doubts that any sharing is going to take place.  Nice B&W conversion', '2007-06-13 10:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777944, 532466, 68035, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure that I would classify this a a ''pure'' candid...Did the clobe twirler know you were there?  Assuming for marking purposes that the answer was no.  Certainly like the motion blur effect but possibly would have preferred to see it slightly more centred</td>', 'Not quite sure that I would classify this a a ''pure'' candid...Did the clobe twirler know you were there?  Assuming for marking purposes that the answer was no.  Certainly like the motion blur effect but possibly would have preferred to see it slightly more centred', '2007-06-13 10:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777951, 532513, 68035, '<td valign="top">Goodness I know how this feels on occasion.  Nice capture although imo a little more contrast in the B&amp;W conversion may have helped bring the subject out more<br/> <br/>Good shot for the challenge</td>', 'Goodness I know how this feels on occasion.  Nice capture although imo a little more contrast in the B&W conversion may have helped bring the subject out more Good shot for the challenge', '2007-06-13 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3777961, 532514, 68035, '<td valign="top">Not 100% sure if you could actually take this shot without the subject being aware, however that being said I would say its a very interesting pov and I like the diagonal line of the shoulders</td>', 'Not 100% sure if you could actually take this shot without the subject being aware, however that being said I would say its a very interesting pov and I like the diagonal line of the shoulders', '2007-06-13 10:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777968, 533033, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great that this flamboyant character appears to be being ignored by the crowd of people (goodness I bet thats hard on the ego!)<br/> <br/>Strange shot and just right for this challenge<br/> <br/>Nice composition</td>', 'Great that this flamboyant character appears to be being ignored by the crowd of people (goodness I bet thats hard on the ego!) Strange shot and just right for this challenge Nice composition', '2007-06-13 10:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777971, 532598, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great thing about this shot is it just begs the question what the heck are they doing (and is that beer one of them is drinking?)<br/> <br/>Good shot for the challenge</td>', 'Great thing about this shot is it just begs the question what the heck are they doing (and is that beer one of them is drinking?) Good shot for the challenge', '2007-06-13 10:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777974, 531788, 68035, '<td valign="top">I like the angle on this.  In my heart I am sure that she must have known you were taking this picture but yet theres something about it that makes me think you may have just whipped out your camera and caught her unawares<br/> <br/>Strange image as when I first saw it I really did not like it and scored it 4 but on revisiting it it has just grown and grown on me....Bump to 6, nice shot</td>', 'I like the angle on this.  In my heart I am sure that she must have known you were taking this picture but yet theres something about it that makes me think you may have just whipped out your camera and caught her unawares Strange image as when I first saw it I really did not like it and scored it 4 but on revisiting it it has just grown and grown on me....Bump to 6, nice shot', '2007-06-13 10:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777978, 532205, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot of a child apparent getting up to some form of mischief great dof on the temple bells which lead you very gently to the main subject</td>', 'Lovely shot of a child apparent getting up to some form of mischief great dof on the temple bells which lead you very gently to the main subject', '2007-06-13 10:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777982, 531464, 68035, '<td valign="top">I so hope this was a genuine accident that you caught on film...Great image and expression although possibly could have done with a fraction tighter focus</td>', 'I so hope this was a genuine accident that you caught on film...Great image and expression although possibly could have done with a fraction tighter focus', '2007-06-13 10:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777984, 531671, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very strange and off the wall although that works well for this challenge</td>', 'Very strange and off the wall although that works well for this challenge', '2007-06-13 10:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777989, 533058, 74559, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colors and textures!</td>', 'Fantastic colors and textures!', '2007-06-13 10:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777991, 532623, 68035, '<td valign="top">And who could blame him!   Very good image in terms on concept for the challenge and nicely executed</td>', 'And who could blame him!   Very good image in terms on concept for the challenge and nicely executed', '2007-06-13 10:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3777995, 531181, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of a parent and (unseen child) lovely expression in the dads eyes although possibly contrast could be slightly higher to bring him out more</td>', 'Nice shot of a parent and (unseen child) lovely expression in the dads eyes although possibly contrast could be slightly higher to bring him out more', '2007-06-13 10:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778000, 532459, 68035, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this I thought set up but as I looked at it more I began to feel much more at ease with the shot.  Interesting concept and a lovely range of expressions on those looking at the sculpture</td>', 'When I first saw this I thought set up but as I looked at it more I began to feel much more at ease with the shot.  Interesting concept and a lovely range of expressions on those looking at the sculpture', '2007-06-13 10:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778006, 532554, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of kids immersed in the moment of a game (football with an old plastic bottle)  Lots of odd things to like about this shot asides from the obvious...The machinery in the background which seems out of place.  The kids attire (I feel like I have wnadered into an Italian Wedding and now the ceremony is over the kids are of the leash having fun<br/> <br/>Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot of kids immersed in the moment of a game (football with an old plastic bottle)  Lots of odd things to like about this shot asides from the obvious...The machinery in the background which seems out of place.  The kids attire (I feel like I have wnadered into an Italian Wedding and now the ceremony is over the kids are of the leash having fun Nice shot', '2007-06-13 10:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778015, 531931, 74559, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture, I can almost hear the waves crashing!</td>', 'Fantastic capture, I can almost hear the waves crashing!', '2007-06-13 10:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778016, 531867, 74559, '<td valign="top">Great looking shot, love the processing!</td>', 'Great looking shot, love the processing!', '2007-06-13 10:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778032, 531505, 68035, '<td valign="top">Beautiful expressive feature of a ladt who seems to carry her past in her eye<br/> <br/>Nice B&amp;W conversion</td>', 'Beautiful expressive feature of a ladt who seems to carry her past in her eye Nice B&W conversion', '2007-06-13 10:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778035, 528273, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice lunchtime hustle and bustle shot.  Good candid without there necessarily being any huge wow factor to it</td>', 'Nice lunchtime hustle and bustle shot.  Good candid without there necessarily being any huge wow factor to it', '2007-06-13 10:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778038, 532734, 68035, '<td valign="top">Good candid shot that captures the solitude and tranquility of angling</td>', 'Good candid shot that captures the solitude and tranquility of angling', '2007-06-13 10:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778042, 532618, 68035, '<td valign="top">Simple yet nicely effective, you convey the emotions that both people are probably feeling very well I can sense the nervous expectation of the boy and the care love and attention of a father who wants his son to do well<br/> <br/>Evocative</td>', 'Simple yet nicely effective, you convey the emotions that both people are probably feeling very well I can sense the nervous expectation of the boy and the care love and attention of a father who wants his son to do well Evocative', '2007-06-13 10:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778045, 530723, 68035, '<td valign="top">I tell you any man that works out like this would adore a photograph of this quality to hang on their wall so they could admmire themselves some more.  Fantastic tones and contrast on the conversion and an excellent 3d feel about it bump to 7</td>', 'I tell you any man that works out like this would adore a photograph of this quality to hang on their wall so they could admmire themselves some more.  Fantastic tones and contrast on the conversion and an excellent 3d feel about it bump to 7', '2007-06-13 10:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778048, 532599, 68035, '<td valign="top">For me a lovely shot but one which the title almost seems to detract from (Rest assured I mark on image not title).  I love the fact that this girl is doing something but I dont quite know what, she is in her own world and - as with the mark of many good candids - I feel that by looking at this image I am almost invading here privacy</td>', 'For me a lovely shot but one which the title almost seems to detract from (Rest assured I mark on image not title).  I love the fact that this girl is doing something but I dont quite know what, she is in her own world and - as with the mark of many good candids - I feel that by looking at this image I am almost invading here privacy', '2007-06-13 10:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778051, 532006, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice construction work candid and I love the dof on the wall.  Very well executed, I can almost taste the dust and plaster in my mouth</td>', 'Nice construction work candid and I love the dof on the wall.  Very well executed, I can almost taste the dust and plaster in my mouth', '2007-06-13 10:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778080, 532764, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of a bunch of kids enjoying each others company.  Interesting range of shirts, not sure if this mighht have even been a touch more impactful in colour.<br/> <br/>Good candid</td>', 'Nice shot of a bunch of kids enjoying each others company.  Interesting range of shirts, not sure if this mighht have even been a touch more impactful in colour. Good candid', '2007-06-13 11:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778083, 530549, 68035, '<td valign="top">Interesting image...photographing the photgrapher...lovely backdrop although possibly could have done with a touch more contrast to bring her out even more</td>', 'Interesting image...photographing the photgrapher...lovely backdrop although possibly could have done with a touch more contrast to bring her out even more', '2007-06-13 11:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778085, 530677, 68035, '<td valign="top">A very haunting image of a face that has seen the ages.  Beautiful convesion and you can almost feel the texture of her skin.  Such a look of sadness in her eyes</td>', 'A very haunting image of a face that has seen the ages.  Beautiful convesion and you can almost feel the texture of her skin.  Such a look of sadness in her eyes', '2007-06-13 11:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778093, 532619, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice candid shot of what I should imagine to be partners totally at ease in each others presence.  A little dark for my taste though the fact that there is only the merest hint of colour in the image (the girls t shirt and the sky) gives a very nice slightly oppressive efect</td>', 'Nice candid shot of what I should imagine to be partners totally at ease in each others presence.  A little dark for my taste though the fact that there is only the merest hint of colour in the image (the girls t shirt and the sky) gives a very nice slightly oppressive efect', '2007-06-13 11:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778098, 532268, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely mother and child shot, the slight softness of the focus brings the sharpness of the childs hand out on the pendant wonderfully</td>', 'Lovely mother and child shot, the slight softness of the focus brings the sharpness of the childs hand out on the pendant wonderfully', '2007-06-13 11:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778116, 531829, 68035, '<td valign="top">Interesting angling shot and its unfortunate that there are quite a few similar enteries in this challenge.  possibly a touch tigher focus on the fisherman required</td>', 'Interesting angling shot and its unfortunate that there are quite a few similar enteries in this challenge.  possibly a touch tigher focus on the fisherman required', '2007-06-13 11:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778119, 531294, 68035, '<td valign="top">This has a very nice european cafe feel to it (although judging from the paper it was taken in the US).  Like the fact that without utilisng desat there is limited colour in the shot which really draws the eye to the main subject</td>', 'This has a very nice european cafe feel to it (although judging from the paper it was taken in the US).  Like the fact that without utilisng desat there is limited colour in the shot which really draws the eye to the main subject', '2007-06-13 11:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778121, 531484, 68035, '<td valign="top">Good image of a moment of shared intimacy.  I like the ''reverse'' angle though possibly could have done with a touch more contrast in the b&amp;W conversion</td>', 'Good image of a moment of shared intimacy.  I like the ''reverse'' angle though possibly could have done with a touch more contrast in the b&W conversion', '2007-06-13 11:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
