(3778689, 532973, 62787, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot! It took me about a minute to figure out what was happening. There''s just so many points of interest in the photo, and I like how you managed to bring in perfect use of the rule of thirds so subtly too... I also find it interesting how the picture naturally forms a colour gradient - the top third is very light, the middle is gray, and the bottom is very dark. All very cool. 10, and going into my faves.</td>', 'Fantastic shot! It took me about a minute to figure out what was happening. There''s just so many points of interest in the photo, and I like how you managed to bring in perfect use of the rule of thirds so subtly too... I also find it interesting how the picture naturally forms a colour gradient - the top third is very light, the middle is gray, and the bottom is very dark. All very cool. 10, and going into my faves.', '2007-06-13 13:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778707, 533091, 62787, '<td valign="top">Possessed looking eyes - how scary. :)</td>', 'Possessed looking eyes - how scary. :)', '2007-06-13 14:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
