(3778716, 532954, 62787, '<td valign="top">Heh, I take it you read that article about <a href="//www.washingtonpost.com/wp-dyn/content/article/2007/04/04/AR2007040401721.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Joshua Bell</a>?<br/> <br/>Very good shot - I love how you managed to capture the entranced musician''s expression, but also the crowds just passing by...</td>', 'Heh, I take it you read that article about Joshua Bell? Very good shot - I love how you managed to capture the entranced musician''s expression, but also the crowds just passing by...', '2007-06-13 14:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
