(3778763, 533199, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nicely caught moment - a very good expression on her face and interesting light. This will be  alovely shot to look back at when she''s grown up - and it''s not indulgently sentimental either.<br/> <br/>One thing: it looks a little too smooth for my taste. Let some grain in and show some of the textures of reality. DPC can be a noise-negative place, but some shots need it!</td>', 'Nicely caught moment - a very good expression on her face and interesting light. This will be  alovely shot to look back at when she''s grown up - and it''s not indulgently sentimental either. One thing: it looks a little too smooth for my taste. Let some grain in and show some of the textures of reality. DPC can be a noise-negative place, but some shots need it!', '2007-06-13 14:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3778764, 533185, 8860, '<td valign="top">I like this for no particular definable reason. So that''s that!</td>', 'I like this for no particular definable reason. So that''s that!', '2007-06-13 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
