(3779113, 529832, 811, '<td valign="top">Actually, I think I like the grain in this, and the bw works well too, but the crop feels really tight to me -- maybe if there was less on the right, the left side wouldn''t feel quite so tight.</td>', 'Actually, I think I like the grain in this, and the bw works well too, but the crop feels really tight to me -- maybe if there was less on the right, the left side wouldn''t feel quite so tight.', '2007-06-13 16:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
