(3779122, 533180, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this, but the shot itself looks almost like a candid taken between posed shots, if that makes sense.  It *is* a candid, but it doesn''t really "tell" anything about her or her surroundings.</td>', 'I like the colors in this, but the shot itself looks almost like a candid taken between posed shots, if that makes sense.  It *is* a candid, but it doesn''t really "tell" anything about her or her surroundings.', '2007-06-13 16:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3779127, 531540, 811, '<td valign="top">Good capture, and the title is hilarious.  It isn''t a "posed" shot, as is, but it doesn''t really scream "candid" to me, either.</td>', 'Good capture, and the title is hilarious.  It isn''t a "posed" shot, as is, but it doesn''t really scream "candid" to me, either.', '2007-06-13 16:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
