(3779140, 532398, 811, '<td valign="top">Good candid, but the focus is just a touch off, (maybe?) and it looks a little grainy, like you had to really pull the brightness up in post-processing, or you had to crop it a lot.</td>', 'Good candid, but the focus is just a touch off, (maybe?) and it looks a little grainy, like you had to really pull the brightness up in post-processing, or you had to crop it a lot.', '2007-06-13 16:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
