(3779143, 532130, 811, '<td valign="top">Good capture and composition, and while I know that these aren''t "posed," it doesn''t really feel like a candid, either.</td>', 'Good capture and composition, and while I know that these aren''t "posed," it doesn''t really feel like a candid, either.', '2007-06-13 16:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
