(3779151, 530700, 75898, '<td valign="top">The contrast immediately caught my attention when this came up.  You''ve also caught a moment very familiar to most of us.</td>', 'The contrast immediately caught my attention when this came up.  You''ve also caught a moment very familiar to most of us.', '2007-06-13 16:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
