(3779174, 533127, 811, '<td valign="top">Obviously, not posed, but doesn''t seem much like a "candid" to me, either.  It took me a second to see the little critter.  At first, I thought you meant the statue was your visitor, and I was wondering why you wanted it out of focus.</td>', 'Obviously, not posed, but doesn''t seem much like a "candid" to me, either.  It took me a second to see the little critter.  At first, I thought you meant the statue was your visitor, and I was wondering why you wanted it out of focus.', '2007-06-13 16:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
