(3779198, 530978, 811, '<td valign="top">This shot isn''t very interesting to me, sorry.  It is a guy getting plants out of bucket of sorts, but other than that, there is nothing to tell me the context, or to captivate my eye and make me think it is a neat story that needs retelling.  Perhaps if his face were visible, or we could see him actually planting the stuff, it would be more interesting.</td>', 'This shot isn''t very interesting to me, sorry.  It is a guy getting plants out of bucket of sorts, but other than that, there is nothing to tell me the context, or to captivate my eye and make me think it is a neat story that needs retelling.  Perhaps if his face were visible, or we could see him actually planting the stuff, it would be more interesting.', '2007-06-13 16:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3779199, 532504, 57519, '<td valign="top">I''m really wondering what they do with the kid when that happens...Oh...Great shot! I kinda like the desaturation to bring out your subjects.</td>', 'I''m really wondering what they do with the kid when that happens...Oh...Great shot! I kinda like the desaturation to bring out your subjects.', '2007-06-13 16:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3779202, 533095, 811, '<td valign="top">Funny shot.  The gray background is a bit drab, though.</td>', 'Funny shot.  The gray background is a bit drab, though.', '2007-06-13 16:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3779204, 532772, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the bw -- I think it works well here.  The composition feels a bit narrow and tight to me, though.</td>', 'I like the bw -- I think it works well here.  The composition feels a bit narrow and tight to me, though.', '2007-06-13 16:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3779206, 532308, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the juxtaposition of their "positions" and how that matches their activity.</td>', 'I like the juxtaposition of their "positions" and how that matches their activity.', '2007-06-13 16:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3779210, 531898, 75898, '<td valign="top">This would''ve made an awesome double take entry!  It makes a good candid one too.  I just think its funny how they look almost identical.</td>', 'This would''ve made an awesome double take entry!  It makes a good candid one too.  I just think its funny how they look almost identical.', '2007-06-13 16:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3779214, 532608, 811, '<td valign="top">The greenish/yellow cast doesn''t help this picture, I don''t think.  I do like the composition though the saw seems more of the subject than the man operating it.</td>', 'The greenish/yellow cast doesn''t help this picture, I don''t think.  I do like the composition though the saw seems more of the subject than the man operating it.', '2007-06-13 16:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3779215, 531846, 75898, '<td valign="top">She looks like she''s having fun, but she looks a little scared too :)</td>', 'She looks like she''s having fun, but she looks a little scared too :)', '2007-06-13 16:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
