(3779220, 532925, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but I am having difficulty how an inanimate object can''t help but be posed, and thus not candid.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but I am having difficulty how an inanimate object can''t help but be posed, and thus not candid.', '2007-06-13 16:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
