(3779226, 532162, 811, '<td valign="top">This one of those shots that you will treasure for years to come.  Good composition, but all of the colors are distracting to me.  Did you try it in black and white?</td>', 'This one of those shots that you will treasure for years to come.  Good composition, but all of the colors are distracting to me.  Did you try it in black and white?', '2007-06-13 16:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3779228, 531207, 811, '<td valign="top">A sharper focus on his face would have helped this shot, I think.  Great expression captured.</td>', 'A sharper focus on his face would have helped this shot, I think.  Great expression captured.', '2007-06-13 16:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3779233, 532653, 75898, '<td valign="top">Excellent PP.  The right eye (his left) looks a little too white, but I didn''t notice the first time around so...maybe I''m wrong.</td>', 'Excellent PP.  The right eye (his left) looks a little too white, but I didn''t notice the first time around so...maybe I''m wrong.', '2007-06-13 16:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3779236, 532868, 811, '<td valign="top">Having the subject centered doesn''t help this shot, I don''t think.  Either a vertical crop or a tighter crop on the right and top would help make this composition strong.  Also the focus seems a bit off, and it appears to be a touch over-exposed.</td>', 'Having the subject centered doesn''t help this shot, I don''t think.  Either a vertical crop or a tighter crop on the right and top would help make this composition strong.  Also the focus seems a bit off, and it appears to be a touch over-exposed.', '2007-06-13 16:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3779243, 530984, 811, '<td valign="top">While I like how the light highlights his hair, the lack of distinguishable details in the shadowed part of his face is distracting, and the fact that only part of the ball is showing proves to be more of a distraction, I think, than interesting.</td>', 'While I like how the light highlights his hair, the lack of distinguishable details in the shadowed part of his face is distracting, and the fact that only part of the ball is showing proves to be more of a distraction, I think, than interesting.', '2007-06-13 16:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3779244, 532276, 811, '<td valign="top">not a terribly interesting shot</td>', 'not a terribly interesting shot', '2007-06-13 16:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3779262, 531768, 75898, '<td valign="top">Very unique image.  I like the fact that he''s sitting on the ledge for two reasons.  The bricks are a nice backdrop for grungy pictures.  Also, the ledge''s (perceived?) height combined with his position and the fact that he''s playing a little flute gives him a mystical, fairytale-like feeling.  Why is he up there?  I don''t know, but it looks like he belongs up there :)</td>', 'Very unique image.  I like the fact that he''s sitting on the ledge for two reasons.  The bricks are a nice backdrop for grungy pictures.  Also, the ledge''s (perceived?) height combined with his position and the fact that he''s playing a little flute gives him a mystical, fairytale-like feeling.  Why is he up there?  I don''t know, but it looks like he belongs up there :)', '2007-06-13 16:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
