st time you receive a VCE comment, randomly choose five (5) images from this challenge (or another challenge) and leave quality, useful comments/critiques like this one.  Make sure to mention good things as well as bad things.  Then, see how many you receive in return over the next few weeks.  Make sure you copy this VCE notice at the end of each comment.  [Obligatory chain letter threat]  If you do not make five quality comments within 24 hours, your hard drive will crash and your camera''s shutter will fail at an inopportune moment.', '2007-06-13 17:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
