(3780723, 533187, 811, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you wouldn''t have entered this in a candid challenge if it were not a candid, but except for the fact that he is not looking at the camera makes it seem posed.  The lighting is excellent, and screams "studio," and his smile looks a bit canned, but probably the biggest thing is that there is not background of any kind to give the shot "context," so it is difficult to tell if it is a true candid or a posed portrait shot.</td>', 'I''m sure you wouldn''t have entered this in a candid challenge if it were not a candid, but except for the fact that he is not looking at the camera makes it seem posed.  The lighting is excellent, and screams "studio," and his smile looks a bit canned, but probably the biggest thing is that there is not background of any kind to give the shot "context," so it is difficult to tell if it is a true candid or a posed portrait shot.', '2007-06-13 23:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
