(3780731, 531676, 811, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, and I think the square crop works okay.  Since the boy is the only one really visible, it might have been more effective to crop closer so he is more visible.  Otherwise, I think you either need to rotate to the left and straighten it up, or more to the right and make it really skewed.  It feels as if the buggy is getting ready to turn over.</td>', 'Not a bad shot, and I think the square crop works okay.  Since the boy is the only one really visible, it might have been more effective to crop closer so he is more visible.  Otherwise, I think you either need to rotate to the left and straighten it up, or more to the right and make it really skewed.  It feels as if the buggy is getting ready to turn over.', '2007-06-13 23:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
