(3782243, 533166, 57060, '<td valign="top">almost seems like a scene rather than a candid as you are so far away from the people on either boat. the composition is  ok except for the competing boats on the R, and the processing takes some getting use to<br/>5<br/>Jack</td>', 'almost seems like a scene rather than a candid as you are so far away from the people on either boat. the composition is  ok except for the competing boats on the R, and the processing takes some getting use to5Jack', '2007-06-14 07:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782256, 529607, 65468, '<td valign="top">To dark to see any detail of the main subject</td>', 'To dark to see any detail of the main subject', '2007-06-14 07:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782309, 532913, 65468, '<td valign="top">Great expressive face good comp and tone control, soft background draws you the the main subject</td>', 'Great expressive face good comp and tone control, soft background draws you the the main subject', '2007-06-14 07:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782315, 530470, 65468, '<td valign="top">Nice shot looks to posed for candid</td>', 'Nice shot looks to posed for candid', '2007-06-14 07:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782411, 531387, 45115, '<td valign="top">one of the best in the challenge!</td>', 'one of the best in the challenge!', '2007-06-14 08:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782665, 532853, 20941, '<td valign="top">The strong shadows especially across his face makes it hard to see any expression</td>', 'The strong shadows especially across his face makes it hard to see any expression', '2007-06-14 09:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782676, 532724, 20941, '<td valign="top">the idea of capturing the stripes in the shirt against the stripes of the shadows is a good one, but not easy to capture in a candid situation against a cluttered background. Your subject got a little lost</td>', 'the idea of capturing the stripes in the shirt against the stripes of the shadows is a good one, but not easy to capture in a candid situation against a cluttered background. Your subject got a little lost', '2007-06-14 09:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782683, 533040, 66201, '<td valign="top">The highlights are a bit too hot - but a lovely moment caught!!</td>', 'The highlights are a bit too hot - but a lovely moment caught!!', '2007-06-14 09:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782694, 532988, 20941, '<td valign="top">a good candidate for b/w but I personally don''t see the point of leaving the partial woman and child in the shot</td>', 'a good candidate for b/w but I personally don''t see the point of leaving the partial woman and child in the shot', '2007-06-14 10:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782695, 532117, 66201, '<td valign="top">This is such a lovely composition: the motion blur in the background is terrific and she is mostly sharp. I just find the highlights too hot. The whole image had been underexposed by 1, you could have used some dodge on her face... she might have seemed like a little fairy in the trees.</td>', 'This is such a lovely composition: the motion blur in the background is terrific and she is mostly sharp. I just find the highlights too hot. The whole image had been underexposed by 1, you could have used some dodge on her face... she might have seemed like a little fairy in the trees.', '2007-06-14 10:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782701, 531782, 66201, '<td valign="top">Simply Stunning - I''m at 18% now and this is my favourite image so far. The truck is very white and dominant, but it''s not blown out. Just love the redness of the bags in the composition.</td>', 'Simply Stunning - I''m at 18% now and this is my favourite image so far. The truck is very white and dominant, but it''s not blown out. Just love the redness of the bags in the composition.', '2007-06-14 10:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782707, 531303, 66201, '<td valign="top">great angle and Movement in the composition. Whites are a bit hot in this, but the general grey palette is great.</td>', 'great angle and Movement in the composition. Whites are a bit hot in this, but the general grey palette is great.', '2007-06-14 10:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782709, 530372, 66201, '<td valign="top">Awwww - what a poppet. Whites in the dress a bit hot, but I love the sepia tones.</td>', 'Awwww - what a poppet. Whites in the dress a bit hot, but I love the sepia tones.', '2007-06-14 10:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782717, 532000, 65234, '<td valign="top">Anyone for a litttle cigarette ash spicing up their food.  YUCK!  And he looks like he''s really zoned out ... makes me wonder what''s in that cigarette?!  Love the perspective which makes his um, largish, gut more obvious and the line of his hand and the tongs leading out of the picture and towards whatever he''s looking at.  Colors are harmonious and not oversaturated (thank you!).  Nice job on capturing the details in an ordinary moment.</td>', 'Anyone for a litttle cigarette ash spicing up their food.  YUCK!  And he looks like he''s really zoned out ... makes me wonder what''s in that cigarette?!  Love the perspective which makes his um, largish, gut more obvious and the line of his hand and the tongs leading out of the picture and towards whatever he''s looking at.  Colors are harmonious and not oversaturated (thank you!).  Nice job on capturing the details in an ordinary moment.', '2007-06-14 10:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782720, 533092, 66201, '<td valign="top">Something weird is happening in her left eye: too much neat image or sharpening? Detail has been lost in her hair and her skin looks a bit plastic. However I like the brown vs green/blues - the colours are delicate and soft.</td>', 'Something weird is happening in her left eye: too much neat image or sharpening? Detail has been lost in her hair and her skin looks a bit plastic. However I like the brown vs green/blues - the colours are delicate and soft.', '2007-06-14 10:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782725, 530492, 65234, '<td valign="top">Is someone about to get in trouble?  I can''t quite make out if his expression is angry or just contemplative.  Wish the edhe of the railing weren''t right infront of him, but it is a candid, after all.</td>', 'Is someone about to get in trouble?  I can''t quite make out if his expression is angry or just contemplative.  Wish the edhe of the railing weren''t right infront of him, but it is a candid, after all.', '2007-06-14 10:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782726, 533038, 66201, '<td valign="top">Oh yes - there it is again: they always come in threes - old men on public benches. Delightful capture. great conversion to black and white too.</td>', 'Oh yes - there it is again: they always come in threes - old men on public benches. Delightful capture. great conversion to black and white too.', '2007-06-14 10:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782736, 531871, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, that''s sweet!  I love their expressions and their heads so close together.  B&amp;W is a great choice with all the patterns.  Obligatory nitpick:  the catchlights in his eyes look odd to me ... square, actually, and a little too bright.</td>', 'Oh, that''s sweet!  I love their expressions and their heads so close together.  B&W is a great choice with all the patterns.  Obligatory nitpick:  the catchlights in his eyes look odd to me ... square, actually, and a little too bright.', '2007-06-14 10:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782745, 530898, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice detail; his head and facial hair looks rough and bristly and his vest looks soft.  He appears to be listening quite intently to a question.</td>', 'Nice detail; his head and facial hair looks rough and bristly and his vest looks soft.  He appears to be listening quite intently to a question.', '2007-06-14 10:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782751, 531338, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s certainly an unusual cheerleading outfit!  And her team is imaginary, but at her age people don''t find that odd ;-)</td>', 'That''s certainly an unusual cheerleading outfit!  And her team is imaginary, but at her age people don''t find that odd ;-)', '2007-06-14 10:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782757, 532371, 65234, '<td valign="top">Rough life, that.  Looks like he''s multitasking pretty well and maintaining his patience despite the busyness.</td>', 'Rough life, that.  Looks like he''s multitasking pretty well and maintaining his patience despite the busyness.', '2007-06-14 10:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782767, 531192, 65234, '<td valign="top">The reflection of the car in the car door is interesting, and you captured enough context to identify him as a mechanic.  However, this appears OOF to me, especially the woman with her back to us.  I would have just cropped her out and left the viewer wondering what he was looking at.</td>', 'The reflection of the car in the car door is interesting, and you captured enough context to identify him as a mechanic.  However, this appears OOF to me, especially the woman with her back to us.  I would have just cropped her out and left the viewer wondering what he was looking at.', '2007-06-14 10:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782770, 531745, 65234, '<td valign="top">Funny capture :-)  I like how the bride is the only one who noticed whatever she noticed.  The crowd is off in their own conversations and the groom just looks besotted and happy.</td>', 'Funny capture :-)  I like how the bride is the only one who noticed whatever she noticed.  The crowd is off in their own conversations and the groom just looks besotted and happy.', '2007-06-14 10:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782777, 532297, 65234, '<td valign="top">Feels like a vacation Sunday near the beach.</td>', 'Feels like a vacation Sunday near the beach.', '2007-06-14 10:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782783, 532921, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love her hat!  Wonder what has their attention?</td>', 'Love her hat!  Wonder what has their attention?', '2007-06-14 10:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782797, 532590, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Lighting looks like bright midday so a bit harsh.  I might have moved a couple of steps to the right so the lady on the left wasn''t blocking any of the giraffe.</td>', 'Great idea.  Lighting looks like bright midday so a bit harsh.  I might have moved a couple of steps to the right so the lady on the left wasn''t blocking any of the giraffe.', '2007-06-14 10:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782800, 533145, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aww, adorable face, and with crumbs on it, too :-)</td>', 'Aww, adorable face, and with crumbs on it, too :-)', '2007-06-14 10:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782826, 532779, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and DOF.  Wish I could see a bit more detail on the calf''s face but it looks like the midday sun exaggerated the black adn white contrasts.</td>', 'Nice colors and DOF.  Wish I could see a bit more detail on the calf''s face but it looks like the midday sun exaggerated the black adn white contrasts.', '2007-06-14 10:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782827, 532266, 79657, '<td valign="top">Lovely perspective. Great color and composition too ^.^</td>', 'Lovely perspective. Great color and composition too ^.^', '2007-06-14 10:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782828, 533201, 69556, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, lighting is a little harsh.  Considering the time of day I probably couldn''t have done better myself.</td>', 'Nice shot, lighting is a little harsh.  Considering the time of day I probably couldn''t have done better myself.', '2007-06-14 10:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782830, 531857, 20941, '<td valign="top">VERY Nice!</td>', 'VERY Nice!', '2007-06-14 10:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782834, 532621, 69556, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot</td>', 'Lovely shot', '2007-06-14 10:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782840, 533057, 65234, '<td valign="top">No helmet?  Overall the tones are pretty nice, even though much of the shirt is pure black.  Nice expression and cowlick ;-)</td>', 'No helmet?  Overall the tones are pretty nice, even though much of the shirt is pure black.  Nice expression and cowlick ;-)', '2007-06-14 10:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782841, 532588, 69556, '<td valign="top">Is this what you guys do for fun?  Nice colors!</td>', 'Is this what you guys do for fun?  Nice colors!', '2007-06-14 10:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782848, 533172, 69556, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Mama Mia.  Great capture!</td>', 'WOW!  Mama Mia.  Great capture!', '2007-06-14 10:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782857, 532680, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s sweet.  I''m guessing from the hand position he just took the flowers out from behind his back, and she appears happily surprised.  Nice candid.</td>', 'That''s sweet.  I''m guessing from the hand position he just took the flowers out from behind his back, and she appears happily surprised.  Nice candid.', '2007-06-14 10:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782859, 532874, 69556, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Wish we could see the frontside of the girl.</td>', 'Cute.  Wish we could see the frontside of the girl.', '2007-06-14 10:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782861, 533146, 69556, '<td valign="top">Excelent shot!  Looks straight out of the 60s.</td>', 'Excelent shot!  Looks straight out of the 60s.', '2007-06-14 10:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782871, 532572, 69556, '<td valign="top">This guy looks like he''s gona turn and punch you in the face.</td>', 'This guy looks like he''s gona turn and punch you in the face.', '2007-06-14 10:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782874, 532375, 69556, '<td valign="top">Great Capture!</td>', 'Great Capture!', '2007-06-14 10:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782880, 531518, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the title; image is very dark and grainy (I assume that''s intentional) and I feel like it overdramatizes what appears to be a pretty ordinary place with not much happening.</td>', 'Like the title; image is very dark and grainy (I assume that''s intentional) and I feel like it overdramatizes what appears to be a pretty ordinary place with not much happening.', '2007-06-14 10:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782883, 531296, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the selective desat processing you did on this and it''s a cute capture.</td>', 'Like the selective desat processing you did on this and it''s a cute capture.', '2007-06-14 10:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782927, 533038, 65234, '<td valign="top">That guy should NOT be wearing a crop top!!  He looks kinda'' like Wilford Brimley.  The guy in the middle looks like he could break into a song and dance routine at any moment.  Haven''t figured out a story for the 3rd guy yet.  Interesting capture!  A little dark, but fun.</td>', 'That guy should NOT be wearing a crop top!!  He looks kinda'' like Wilford Brimley.  The guy in the middle looks like he could break into a song and dance routine at any moment.  Haven''t figured out a story for the 3rd guy yet.  Interesting capture!  A little dark, but fun.', '2007-06-14 10:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782930, 531898, 20941, '<td valign="top">very cool capture!</td>', 'very cool capture!', '2007-06-14 10:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782940, 531871, 20941, '<td valign="top">sweet shot, well presented in b/w</td>', 'sweet shot, well presented in b/w', '2007-06-14 10:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782941, 532921, 20941, '<td valign="top">adorable shot showing a sweet moment</td>', 'adorable shot showing a sweet moment', '2007-06-14 10:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782945, 528795, 20941, '<td valign="top">like the contrasty b/w, adds a depth to the story cool work</td>', 'like the contrasty b/w, adds a depth to the story cool work', '2007-06-14 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782947, 532183, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wow, she has model-perfect teeth!  Wonderfully colorful outfit and your capture and processing do the lady justice.</td>', 'Wow, she has model-perfect teeth!  Wonderfully colorful outfit and your capture and processing do the lady justice.', '2007-06-14 10:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782948, 532139, 20941, '<td valign="top">priceless expression on the toddlers face! Cool capture</td>', 'priceless expression on the toddlers face! Cool capture', '2007-06-14 10:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782954, 530911, 65234, '<td valign="top">Sweet moment.  I like how he''s toally focussed on the baby.</td>', 'Sweet moment.  I like how he''s toally focussed on the baby.', '2007-06-14 10:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782960, 532504, 20941, '<td valign="top">good use of de-sat to emphasize your subjects in this unfortunate story</td>', 'good use of de-sat to emphasize your subjects in this unfortunate story', '2007-06-14 10:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782968, 531085, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the simplicity of composition and the contrast between the peeling paint and the shiny leather shoes and jacket.  Lighting is a bit harsh so highlights and shadows look a little extreme to me.</td>', 'Like the simplicity of composition and the contrast between the peeling paint and the shiny leather shoes and jacket.  Lighting is a bit harsh so highlights and shadows look a little extreme to me.', '2007-06-14 10:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782977, 532227, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like a scene from a movie.  If you have the resolution you could try a much closer crop on the couple.  The field doesn''t appear to have any flowers or anything to look at besides lots of grass.</td>', 'Looks like a scene from a movie.  If you have the resolution you could try a much closer crop on the couple.  The field doesn''t appear to have any flowers or anything to look at besides lots of grass.', '2007-06-14 10:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782979, 532982, 20941, '<td valign="top">nice capture, making the viewer empathise with her thoughts</td>', 'nice capture, making the viewer empathise with her thoughts', '2007-06-14 10:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782982, 529892, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice composition; angle and reflected portrait are interesting.  Looks like your subject was napping.</td>', 'Nice composition; angle and reflected portrait are interesting.  Looks like your subject was napping.', '2007-06-14 10:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782983, 529832, 20941, '<td valign="top">very cool candid capture the contrast and grain work well here</td>', 'very cool candid capture the contrast and grain work well here', '2007-06-14 10:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783002, 532646, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice moment to capture; great angle with the slide.  There''s a lot of red in the grass behind him which is grabbing my attention because of the red in the swim trunks.  I might have color-shifted that background grass to something greener.</td>', 'Nice moment to capture; great angle with the slide.  There''s a lot of red in the grass behind him which is grabbing my attention because of the red in the swim trunks.  I might have color-shifted that background grass to something greener.', '2007-06-14 10:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783006, 532233, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and lighting in this one.</td>', 'Nice detail and lighting in this one.', '2007-06-14 10:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783017, 532868, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great place to find candids.  Looks like a watercolor filter or something similar was used; doesn''t quite work for me from a processing standpoint.</td>', 'Great place to find candids.  Looks like a watercolor filter or something similar was used; doesn''t quite work for me from a processing standpoint.', '2007-06-14 11:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783023, 533197, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very sweet moment to capture.  The dog looks very pixelated, which detracts from the beauty of the scene.</td>', 'Very sweet moment to capture.  The dog looks very pixelated, which detracts from the beauty of the scene.', '2007-06-14 11:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783036, 532807, 65234, '<td valign="top">How very odd!  Very interesting capture, indeed.</td>', 'How very odd!  Very interesting capture, indeed.', '2007-06-14 11:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783160, 533098, 69556, '<td valign="top">Exciting moment.  Lots of noise in the shot too much red.</td>', 'Exciting moment.  Lots of noise in the shot too much red.', '2007-06-14 11:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783162, 532956, 69556, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot.  Nice BW tents.</td>', 'Very cute shot.  Nice BW tents.', '2007-06-14 11:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783173, 532940, 69556, '<td valign="top">I get a lot out of this photo.  Perfect, nice story!  I would like to see a BW version.  Mind if I experiment?</td>', 'I get a lot out of this photo.  Perfect, nice story!  I would like to see a BW version.  Mind if I experiment?', '2007-06-14 11:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783175, 533096, 51538, '<td valign="top">Heck, that''s one way to dry your washing.  I like the angle.</td>', 'Heck, that''s one way to dry your washing.  I like the angle.', '2007-06-14 11:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783176, 532996, 69556, '<td valign="top">Bueatiful shot.  Seems like the shutter speed might be a littl slow.</td>', 'Bueatiful shot.  Seems like the shutter speed might be a littl slow.', '2007-06-14 11:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783178, 532767, 79832, '<td valign="top">A vertical crop may have worked better to isolate more of the muted background and therefore focus on her. In this case with the closed eyes it works well</td>', 'A vertical crop may have worked better to isolate more of the muted background and therefore focus on her. In this case with the closed eyes it works well', '2007-06-14 11:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783201, 529833, 79832, '<td valign="top">While it is a good documentary scene I find that with a tighter cropping on either the colourful person or the other 2 would help to add more interest. Face contact also helps</td>', 'While it is a good documentary scene I find that with a tighter cropping on either the colourful person or the other 2 would help to add more interest. Face contact also helps', '2007-06-14 11:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783211, 531857, 79832, '<td valign="top">Good shot of what appears as a person day dreaming at the job. The white labels on the bottles at her cheek are a little distracting</td>', 'Good shot of what appears as a person day dreaming at the job. The white labels on the bottles at her cheek are a little distracting', '2007-06-14 11:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783217, 533062, 79832, '<td valign="top">If that red pole wasn''t there it sure would to help keep you focused in scene. Good strong colours. Good lighting and DOF.</td>', 'If that red pole wasn''t there it sure would to help keep you focused in scene. Good strong colours. Good lighting and DOF.', '2007-06-14 11:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783225, 532006, 79832, '<td valign="top">I like this shot with the texture and the framing with construction  materials.<br/>Nice tones</td>', 'I like this shot with the texture and the framing with construction  materials.Nice tones', '2007-06-14 11:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783239, 531192, 79832, '<td valign="top">interesting subject. I find the vividness of the reelection to strong and that it is where my eyes go first not to the people. The lady is a little out of focus which helps to re-enforce that the reflection might be the main subject</td>', 'interesting subject. I find the vividness of the reelection to strong and that it is where my eyes go first not to the people. The lady is a little out of focus which helps to re-enforce that the reflection might be the main subject', '2007-06-14 12:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783254, 533142, 79832, '<td valign="top">Great moment captured here. I like the expression. Good cropping, DOF and lighting. Maybe just a bit more of here right arm as the bend line leads out of scene and the rest of arm does not bring you back in.</td>', 'Great moment captured here. I like the expression. Good cropping, DOF and lighting. Maybe just a bit more of here right arm as the bend line leads out of scene and the rest of arm does not bring you back in.', '2007-06-14 12:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783264, 531485, 79832, '<td valign="top">Great moment and wonderful lighting. Nicely framed  and the background texture works well. Maybe just a tad dark in details of pant legs</td>', 'Great moment and wonderful lighting. Nicely framed  and the background texture works well. Maybe just a tad dark in details of pant legs', '2007-06-14 12:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3783273, 532788, 79832, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop to focus better on the 3 people would help to make them more prominent.</td>', 'A tighter crop to focus better on the 3 people would help to make them more prominent.', '2007-06-14 12:06:30.000000', NULL, 1);
