(3785684, 529478, 63218, '<td valign="top">this looks like a still from a movie to me,  I like it like that 10</td>', 'this looks like a still from a movie to me,  I like it like that 10', '2007-06-14 20:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3785693, 530700, 63218, '<td valign="top">lovely candid moment, perfectly captured</td>', 'lovely candid moment, perfectly captured', '2007-06-14 20:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3785746, 532645, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition in this one.</td>', 'I like the composition in this one.', '2007-06-14 21:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3785751, 531671, 811, '<td valign="top">It''s kinda uncanny how much that guy looks like my husband''s cousin (well, what you can see of him &lt;grin&gt;).  Humorous capture</td>', 'It''s kinda uncanny how much that guy looks like my husband''s cousin (well, what you can see of him <grin>).  Humorous capture', '2007-06-14 21:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3785757, 530007, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  I do think the vignette/border detracts from the shot, though, rather than adding to it.  It seems to have become a separate element rather than helping to emphasize the shot.</td>', 'I like the composition.  I do think the vignette/border detracts from the shot, though, rather than adding to it.  It seems to have become a separate element rather than helping to emphasize the shot.', '2007-06-14 21:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3785761, 532590, 811, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a lot in this shot and it is difficult to discern exactly what you wanted as your subject.  I assume the lady in the middle and the kid in the stroller and the giraffe.  If so, maybe a vertical crop could have eliminated some of the distracting elements.</td>', 'There seems to be a lot in this shot and it is difficult to discern exactly what you wanted as your subject.  I assume the lady in the middle and the kid in the stroller and the giraffe.  If so, maybe a vertical crop could have eliminated some of the distracting elements.', '2007-06-14 21:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3785764, 532895, 811, '<td valign="top">Good capture.  The car is distracting, so unless you just really, really, really needed the boy on the right, I think a crop of just the three on the left would be more effective.</td>', 'Good capture.  The car is distracting, so unless you just really, really, really needed the boy on the right, I think a crop of just the three on the left would be more effective.', '2007-06-14 21:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3785772, 531865, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white shot.</td>', 'Nice black and white shot.', '2007-06-14 21:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3785773, 532462, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the tilt in this.  I think it adds to the feeling of a walk in the rain.</td>', 'I like the tilt in this.  I think it adds to the feeling of a walk in the rain.', '2007-06-14 21:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3785835, 533058, 74979, '<td valign="top">this is great; I like the post processing with the enhancement of the textures around him</td>', 'this is great; I like the post processing with the enhancement of the textures around him', '2007-06-14 21:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
