(3786865, 532459, 39429, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling the women think they''ve seen a "naughty."  Great expression caught on their faces.  Technically, the bright white buildings put my eye out of the shot.</td>', 'I get the feeling the women think they''ve seen a "naughty."  Great expression caught on their faces.  Technically, the bright white buildings put my eye out of the shot.', '2007-06-15 01:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3786868, 532645, 39429, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and mood.  Love the use of the leading lines to bring the focus on the woman and finally the dog.  I don''t feel the section before the bridge adds to the image.  I''d have cropped it.  IMHO.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and mood.  Love the use of the leading lines to bring the focus on the woman and finally the dog.  I don''t feel the section before the bridge adds to the image.  I''d have cropped it.  IMHO.', '2007-06-15 01:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3786872, 532865, 39429, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.  Love the emotion and tenderness you''ve caught here.  Nice toning.  I wish there were a tad more separation between the tops of the heads and the bg.  Still lovely.</td>', 'Wonderful shot.  Love the emotion and tenderness you''ve caught here.  Nice toning.  I wish there were a tad more separation between the tops of the heads and the bg.  Still lovely.', '2007-06-15 01:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3786878, 533146, 39429, '<td valign="top">What a stately gentleman.  I love the tones and compostion in this shot.  The sharp lines are coming out a bit jaggy which distracts, however, it''s hard to keep those out of these small images on the diagnol.  Well done.</td>', 'What a stately gentleman.  I love the tones and compostion in this shot.  The sharp lines are coming out a bit jaggy which distracts, however, it''s hard to keep those out of these small images on the diagnol.  Well done.', '2007-06-15 01:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3786882, 533105, 39429, '<td valign="top">The building aspect of this image is very strong.  I don''t feel like the person is nearly as interesting as the scene.  Catch an interesting moment with this bg and you''d have a winner.</td>', 'The building aspect of this image is very strong.  I don''t feel like the person is nearly as interesting as the scene.  Catch an interesting moment with this bg and you''d have a winner.', '2007-06-15 01:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
