(3786890, 532939, 39429, '<td valign="top">Obviously it is a common occurance for this man to have a monkey on his neck.  Such, blase in his expression.  The separation from the crowd in both color and DOF could be strengthened, yet still interesting.</td>', 'Obviously it is a common occurance for this man to have a monkey on his neck.  Such, blase in his expression.  The separation from the crowd in both color and DOF could be strengthened, yet still interesting.', '2007-06-15 01:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
