(3786910, 532898, 39429, '<td valign="top">You have me yearning to see his mount.  The red background works well as a bg.  I don''t see a lot of use for the store front and would love to see it cropped.  IMHO.</td>', 'You have me yearning to see his mount.  The red background works well as a bg.  I don''t see a lot of use for the store front and would love to see it cropped.  IMHO.', '2007-06-15 01:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
