(3787282, 533201, 30982, '<td valign="top">Most folks probably will not consider animal shots as candids, though this is a pretty interesting snap of the critter!  I like the shadows on the wall, and the composition is well balanced.</td>', 'Most folks probably will not consider animal shots as candids, though this is a pretty interesting snap of the critter!  I like the shadows on the wall, and the composition is well balanced.', '2007-06-15 06:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
