(3790266, 531294, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this.  very well done.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this.  very well done.', '2007-06-15 23:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790279, 531596, 811, '<td valign="top">What a character.  and what a convenient way to carry your water bottle. :)</td>', 'What a character.  and what a convenient way to carry your water bottle. :)', '2007-06-15 23:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790281, 533185, 811, '<td valign="top">this is so subtle and simple.  i like it.  You have good dof, and while it is colorful, your subject still manages to stand out.  Good job.</td>', 'this is so subtle and simple.  i like it.  You have good dof, and while it is colorful, your subject still manages to stand out.  Good job.', '2007-06-15 23:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790321, 532527, 811, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  I love the colors, the simplicity and his expression.  The towel over his head really makes it classic, I think</td>', 'Great capture.  I love the colors, the simplicity and his expression.  The towel over his head really makes it classic, I think', '2007-06-16 00:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790324, 532003, 811, '<td valign="top">Simply precious.  Very good photograph -- good composition and focus, etc.</td>', 'Simply precious.  Very good photograph -- good composition and focus, etc.', '2007-06-16 00:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790329, 533205, 811, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture of emotion there. :)  I think a bit more off of the right would make this feel more balanced, or if you wanted to keep it consistent with the young gal''s message, you could crop it on the left and having them walk "out" of the frame.</td>', 'Awesome capture of emotion there. :)  I think a bit more off of the right would make this feel more balanced, or if you wanted to keep it consistent with the young gal''s message, you could crop it on the left and having them walk "out" of the frame.', '2007-06-16 00:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790333, 531528, 811, '<td valign="top">I think cropping more off of the top would have helped this feel like a stronger image, BUT it is awesome just the way it is, as well.  Nice capture!</td>', 'I think cropping more off of the top would have helped this feel like a stronger image, BUT it is awesome just the way it is, as well.  Nice capture!', '2007-06-16 00:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790334, 531898, 811, '<td valign="top">Looks like fun.  Great capture, at just the right moment!  BW works very well here.</td>', 'Looks like fun.  Great capture, at just the right moment!  BW works very well here.', '2007-06-16 00:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790350, 531378, 811, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful and serene.  I like the use of black and white here.</td>', 'Very peaceful and serene.  I like the use of black and white here.', '2007-06-16 00:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790356, 532148, 811, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  A missionary I know that goes to the jungles in Indonesia frequently said that on many of the mud huts are satellite dishes and he has seen natives in loin clothes hunting with blowguns and spears, while texting their friends in other areas.  Amazing the reaches of technology.</td>', 'Great composition.  A missionary I know that goes to the jungles in Indonesia frequently said that on many of the mud huts are satellite dishes and he has seen natives in loin clothes hunting with blowguns and spears, while texting their friends in other areas.  Amazing the reaches of technology.', '2007-06-16 00:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790360, 532388, 811, '<td valign="top">I think this is a truly awesome picture.  I like the absurdly tight crop, because it seems to say that she is running out of the composition and you can''t catch her.  I also think the shallow dof and perspective works really well.</td>', 'I think this is a truly awesome picture.  I like the absurdly tight crop, because it seems to say that she is running out of the composition and you can''t catch her.  I also think the shallow dof and perspective works really well.', '2007-06-16 00:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790362, 531485, 811, '<td valign="top">Great composition and capture.  To me, the background bricks look like those you would find in an expensive highrise, and that just emphasizes his position even more.</td>', 'Great composition and capture.  To me, the background bricks look like those you would find in an expensive highrise, and that just emphasizes his position even more.', '2007-06-16 00:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790367, 531846, 811, '<td valign="top">She looks like Hilary Clinton.  Great capture and composition.  The black and white works very well here.  Nice job.</td>', 'She looks like Hilary Clinton.  Great capture and composition.  The black and white works very well here.  Nice job.', '2007-06-16 00:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790368, 533188, 811, '<td valign="top">simple profile, but well done.</td>', 'simple profile, but well done.', '2007-06-16 00:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790373, 533132, 811, '<td valign="top">Since the bride is "cut off", it may seem more balanced if the crop was tighter and "cut off" part of the little girl, or was a bit wider and included more of the bride.  Otherwise, a tremendous shot that I know they loved!</td>', 'Since the bride is "cut off", it may seem more balanced if the crop was tighter and "cut off" part of the little girl, or was a bit wider and included more of the bride.  Otherwise, a tremendous shot that I know they loved!', '2007-06-16 00:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790374, 532630, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the desaturation in this one.  It allowed for some color without totally assaulting the senses with a bunch of different colors.  Very natural capture.</td>', 'I like the desaturation in this one.  It allowed for some color without totally assaulting the senses with a bunch of different colors.  Very natural capture.', '2007-06-16 00:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790375, 532154, 811, '<td valign="top">They look very natural and amused.  Good work.</td>', 'They look very natural and amused.  Good work.', '2007-06-16 00:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790376, 532193, 811, '<td valign="top">This just looks like fun!</td>', 'This just looks like fun!', '2007-06-16 00:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790378, 532357, 811, '<td valign="top">Technically, the picture seems a bit flat, and the colors do, too, BUT it is so freaking funny, it has to be considered a "good" picture.</td>', 'Technically, the picture seems a bit flat, and the colors do, too, BUT it is so freaking funny, it has to be considered a "good" picture.', '2007-06-16 00:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790421, 532973, 811, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to figure out how this was done.  I think using black and white tied it together well, and better gives the effect of two separate pictures.</td>', 'Took me a minute to figure out how this was done.  I think using black and white tied it together well, and better gives the effect of two separate pictures.', '2007-06-16 00:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790425, 533206, 811, '<td valign="top">He just looks like he is having fun. :)</td>', 'He just looks like he is having fun. :)', '2007-06-16 00:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790427, 533167, 811, '<td valign="top">Good focus. It''s a little disjointing that he is going out of the frame, but otherwise, very nicely done.</td>', 'Good focus. It''s a little disjointing that he is going out of the frame, but otherwise, very nicely done.', '2007-06-16 00:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790429, 532598, 811, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  They look rather comfy, don''t they. :)</td>', 'Great capture.  They look rather comfy, don''t they. :)', '2007-06-16 00:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790432, 531223, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the bright colors in this one and the nice contrast between the blue and the red.</td>', 'I really like the bright colors in this one and the nice contrast between the blue and the red.', '2007-06-16 00:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790435, 533114, 811, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  I like the balance created between the green foliage and the brick steps.</td>', 'Great composition.  I like the balance created between the green foliage and the brick steps.', '2007-06-16 00:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790466, 532913, 811, '<td valign="top">This guy looks like someone who wouldn''t mind messing with your kneecaps if you owed him money.  Great personality capture!</td>', 'This guy looks like someone who wouldn''t mind messing with your kneecaps if you owed him money.  Great personality capture!', '2007-06-16 00:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790467, 531857, 69776, '<td valign="top">Wow she looks so bored :) nice tones thou</td>', 'Wow she looks so bored :) nice tones thou', '2007-06-16 01:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790470, 533134, 69776, '<td valign="top">Intresting character, but I''m not keen on the selective desat</td>', 'Intresting character, but I''m not keen on the selective desat', '2007-06-16 01:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790472, 531906, 69776, '<td valign="top">nice capture, intresting face experssions</td>', 'nice capture, intresting face experssions', '2007-06-16 01:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790474, 532170, 69776, '<td valign="top">Intresting shot, not one we see often here, nice work</td>', 'Intresting shot, not one we see often here, nice work', '2007-06-16 01:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
