(3790479, 532865, 69776, '<td valign="top">Nice moment &amp; well captured, the yellow tone is intresting but perhaps a bit too strong.  Good Luck</td>', 'Nice moment & well captured, the yellow tone is intresting but perhaps a bit too strong.  Good Luck', '2007-06-16 01:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790481, 531914, 69776, '<td valign="top">Intresting colours and tones, Perhaps it would have been a better composition with outthe man on the right.  Good Luck</td>', 'Intresting colours and tones, Perhaps it would have been a better composition with outthe man on the right.  Good Luck', '2007-06-16 01:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790482, 532341, 69776, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, a bit too high key for me thou, Good Luck</td>', 'Nice shot, a bit too high key for me thou, Good Luck', '2007-06-16 01:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790485, 532227, 811, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  I like how they look so small when compared to the rest of the field.</td>', 'Great composition.  I like how they look so small when compared to the rest of the field.', '2007-06-16 01:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790486, 533094, 69776, '<td valign="top">Im not keen on the ''cartoon'' look of the shot, Nice idea thou</td>', 'Im not keen on the ''cartoon'' look of the shot, Nice idea thou', '2007-06-16 01:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790489, 532272, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white, because it makes the two figures stand out so clearly against the background</td>', 'I like the black and white, because it makes the two figures stand out so clearly against the background', '2007-06-16 01:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790494, 532353, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition in this, and the balance between the people and the birds.  Also, I think black and white works well, because the background isn''t "blurred out" so it could be fairly distracting, I would think</td>', 'I like the composition in this, and the balance between the people and the birds.  Also, I think black and white works well, because the background isn''t "blurred out" so it could be fairly distracting, I would think', '2007-06-16 01:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790495, 533198, 811, '<td valign="top">I think the better picture would be about 5 seconds after this. :)</td>', 'I think the better picture would be about 5 seconds after this. :)', '2007-06-16 01:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790498, 533016, 811, '<td valign="top">good capture, and I like that the background only has colored tones and no details.  Seems to fit the picture</td>', 'good capture, and I like that the background only has colored tones and no details.  Seems to fit the picture', '2007-06-16 01:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790500, 530700, 811, '<td valign="top">Looks introspective</td>', 'Looks introspective', '2007-06-16 01:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790510, 532249, 69776, '<td valign="top">Like the desaturation to highlight the kid but I think its too much perhaps just dialing it down a bit would have been better, + the eyes just looks a bit too freeky for me.  Good Luck</td>', 'Like the desaturation to highlight the kid but I think its too much perhaps just dialing it down a bit would have been better, + the eyes just looks a bit too freeky for me.  Good Luck', '2007-06-16 01:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790519, 533034, 78255, '<td valign="top">Nice catch!</td>', 'Nice catch!', '2007-06-16 01:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790525, 532139, 78255, '<td valign="top">Perfect title. Made me laugh out loud. Great shot!</td>', 'Perfect title. Made me laugh out loud. Great shot!', '2007-06-16 01:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790650, 531865, 10867, '<td valign="top">This is a charming photo, but I wish the baby''s hand hadn''t been cut off by the top of the frame.  J''aurais aimer voir toute la main de l''enfant.</td>', 'This is a charming photo, but I wish the baby''s hand hadn''t been cut off by the top of the frame.  J''aurais aimer voir toute la main de l''enfant.', '2007-06-16 02:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790822, 530007, 77838, '<td valign="top">Yeah, WOW, this one does have the wow grab to it! I love it</td>', 'Yeah, WOW, this one does have the wow grab to it! I love it', '2007-06-16 05:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790823, 532781, 77838, '<td valign="top">Mountain climbing?! That''s crazy awesome.  It looks like short sleeves though.  Does this photo have any selective desaturation or is it full color.  I assume it''s full color due to the orange rope? Very nice.</td>', 'Mountain climbing?! That''s crazy awesome.  It looks like short sleeves though.  Does this photo have any selective desaturation or is it full color.  I assume it''s full color due to the orange rope? Very nice.', '2007-06-16 05:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790829, 532353, 77838, '<td valign="top">cool poem</td>', 'cool poem', '2007-06-16 05:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790831, 531768, 77838, '<td valign="top">I like the effect you have on this photo. Your colors are there but are lightened from their original color. nice</td>', 'I like the effect you have on this photo. Your colors are there but are lightened from their original color. nice', '2007-06-16 05:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790839, 531223, 69776, '<td valign="top">intresting shot, very vibrant blues. wish we could see more of his face.</td>', 'intresting shot, very vibrant blues. wish we could see more of his face.', '2007-06-16 05:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790841, 532089, 69776, '<td valign="top">its a bit dark but very intresting subject, the violin looks rather out of place</td>', 'its a bit dark but very intresting subject, the violin looks rather out of place', '2007-06-16 05:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790842, 530141, 69776, '<td valign="top">thats one small dog :) Good DOF but Im not sure this is a candid shot</td>', 'thats one small dog :) Good DOF but Im not sure this is a candid shot', '2007-06-16 05:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3790880, 532144, 23478, '<td valign="top">great photo.</td>', 'great photo.', '2007-06-16 07:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791015, 532791, 24389, '<td valign="top">oh noo!!!!!!!! i give this a one! lol. j/k</td>', 'oh noo!!!!!!!! i give this a one! lol. j/k', '2007-06-16 09:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791036, 530238, 63360, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have framed your subject.  The green colors are also striking.  This would be more effective if the window were in sharp focus.</td>', 'I like the way you have framed your subject.  The green colors are also striking.  This would be more effective if the window were in sharp focus.', '2007-06-16 10:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791048, 532643, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but I don''t particularly care for the pink tone.</td>', 'Nice capture, but I don''t particularly care for the pink tone.', '2007-06-16 10:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791050, 532973, 63360, '<td valign="top">Both the view ahead AND the view in the mirror have visual interest.  I also like your choice of desaturation, but I think the images are competing too much with each other.</td>', 'Both the view ahead AND the view in the mirror have visual interest.  I also like your choice of desaturation, but I think the images are competing too much with each other.', '2007-06-16 10:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791053, 532973, 35545, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, but I''d crop quite a bit off the top.  The sky isn''t particularly interesting, and you have to scroll down too much to find the person on the horse.</td>', 'Interesting concept, but I''d crop quite a bit off the top.  The sky isn''t particularly interesting, and you have to scroll down too much to find the person on the horse.', '2007-06-16 10:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791055, 531871, 63360, '<td valign="top">Nice interaction between the grandmother (?) and little boy.</td>', 'Nice interaction between the grandmother (?) and little boy.', '2007-06-16 10:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791062, 533192, 35545, '<td valign="top">The man looks a little OOF.  IMNSHO, this could do with a tighter crop -- I''d suggest that you shave some off the top so that the top of the main support ends in the upper left corner.  That would also emphasize the diagonal leading the eye to the conductor.</td>', 'The man looks a little OOF.  IMNSHO, this could do with a tighter crop -- I''d suggest that you shave some off the top so that the top of the main support ends in the upper left corner.  That would also emphasize the diagonal leading the eye to the conductor.', '2007-06-16 10:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791067, 532387, 35545, '<td valign="top">I''d like this better if you were closer to the subject.  IMNSHO this is more like a landscape than a candid.</td>', 'I''d like this better if you were closer to the subject.  IMNSHO this is more like a landscape than a candid.', '2007-06-16 10:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791069, 529534, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice candid, but it looks over-processed and the colors are over-saturated -- the man''s face has too much yellow, at least on my monitor.  I''d try this in b&amp;w.</td>', 'Nice candid, but it looks over-processed and the colors are over-saturated -- the man''s face has too much yellow, at least on my monitor.  I''d try this in b&w.', '2007-06-16 10:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791072, 532895, 35545, '<td valign="top">Need more light on their faces.</td>', 'Need more light on their faces.', '2007-06-16 10:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791074, 533105, 63360, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have cropped this - the dark windows make me wonder who is inside.  Love the colors of the building.  This would be better if the lighting weren''t so harsh, especially the white door.</td>', 'I like the way you have cropped this - the dark windows make me wonder who is inside.  Love the colors of the building.  This would be better if the lighting weren''t so harsh, especially the white door.', '2007-06-16 10:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791076, 532506, 35545, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture.  Nice b&amp;w processing.</td>', 'Excellent capture.  Nice b&w processing.', '2007-06-16 10:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791083, 531846, 63360, '<td valign="top">Great expression!  Your use of desaturation makes this a photo feel like it came from the 60s.  I like the way this has been cropped.</td>', 'Great expression!  Your use of desaturation makes this a photo feel like it came from the 60s.  I like the way this has been cropped.', '2007-06-16 10:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791087, 530238, 35545, '<td valign="top">Normally, I like blur, but I don''t think it adds much to this shot.</td>', 'Normally, I like blur, but I don''t think it adds much to this shot.', '2007-06-16 10:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791090, 529736, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I wouldn''t really call it a candid since the children are obviously in a performance of some sort.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I wouldn''t really call it a candid since the children are obviously in a performance of some sort.', '2007-06-16 10:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791091, 531228, 63360, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you have captured this moment.  I think the lights detract from this wonderful shot, and would be better if they were cropped out.</td>', 'I really like the way you have captured this moment.  I think the lights detract from this wonderful shot, and would be better if they were cropped out.', '2007-06-16 10:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791092, 532540, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but it looks over-processed.</td>', 'Nice composition, but it looks over-processed.', '2007-06-16 10:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791095, 532899, 63360, '<td valign="top">The background in this is amazing!  Really lovely colors.  I know this is supposed to be candid, but wish he were doing something different.</td>', 'The background in this is amazing!  Really lovely colors.  I know this is supposed to be candid, but wish he were doing something different.', '2007-06-16 10:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791100, 532921, 63360, '<td valign="top">The elderly man and the little girl are the main subjects here, so this would be much better to zoom in on them and crop out much of the background and the bench.  Also, it would have been nice to see them interacting with each other more.</td>', 'The elderly man and the little girl are the main subjects here, so this would be much better to zoom in on them and crop out much of the background and the bench.  Also, it would have been nice to see them interacting with each other more.', '2007-06-16 10:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791102, 532187, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good colors and processing.  I''d like to see it cropped right above the door handles.</td>', 'Good colors and processing.  I''d like to see it cropped right above the door handles.', '2007-06-16 10:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791103, 532596, 63360, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more of their attire - maybe a full body shot.  The word GRIP is distracting.</td>', 'I would like to see more of their attire - maybe a full body shot.  The word GRIP is distracting.', '2007-06-16 10:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791106, 532000, 35545, '<td valign="top">Over-processed.</td>', 'Over-processed.', '2007-06-16 10:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791107, 532089, 35545, '<td valign="top">Could use more light on his face.</td>', 'Could use more light on his face.', '2007-06-16 10:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
