(3791393, 531223, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like this. He seems to be keeping calm in a rather intimidating situation. either that, or humbly determined in the midst of his own sprawling creation. 8</td>', 'I like this. He seems to be keeping calm in a rather intimidating situation. either that, or humbly determined in the midst of his own sprawling creation. 8', '2007-06-16 13:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791395, 531857, 50695, '<td valign="top">reminds me of Manet. maybe that''s neat image? you perhaps went too far with it, though I do kinda dig the painting effect. 7 You know, I was worried about neat image on the face, but now I''m starting to think she just looks like that. bump to 9</td>', 'reminds me of Manet. maybe that''s neat image? you perhaps went too far with it, though I do kinda dig the painting effect. 7 You know, I was worried about neat image on the face, but now I''m starting to think she just looks like that. bump to 9', '2007-06-16 13:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791396, 528225, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love that we cannot see her face because she is dissolved into bliss. 8</td>', 'I love that we cannot see her face because she is dissolved into bliss. 8', '2007-06-16 13:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791400, 533097, 50695, '<td valign="top">fascinating interaction. I feel like I can see all of it with great precision, and yet still have almost no understanding of it. Nice diagonal from bottom left to upper right. 9</td>', 'fascinating interaction. I feel like I can see all of it with great precision, and yet still have almost no understanding of it. Nice diagonal from bottom left to upper right. 9', '2007-06-16 13:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791403, 531030, 50695, '<td valign="top">not a genre that I get very excited about, but I do like the "CRAZY" in the background and the fact that those two girls are focusing all their extreme emotion into that tiny object... a camera? 7</td>', 'not a genre that I get very excited about, but I do like the "CRAZY" in the background and the fact that those two girls are focusing all their extreme emotion into that tiny object... a camera? 7', '2007-06-16 13:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791405, 532378, 50695, '<td valign="top">It looks as though the woman on the left is trying to make sure that her point was understood. The woman on the right doesn''t want to think about it. What''s behind them is more focused than they are. I take that as a visual metaphor for getting old. 9</td>', 'It looks as though the woman on the left is trying to make sure that her point was understood. The woman on the right doesn''t want to think about it. What''s behind them is more focused than they are. I take that as a visual metaphor for getting old. 9', '2007-06-16 13:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
