(3791416, 532342, 50695, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t feel like a candid. In other words, I don''t feel like I''m peeking in on some slice of reality. In spite of your title, it feels more like a portrait. But it''s an interesting composition with nice textures, and I can certainly imagine that it is in fact candid, so 7.</td>', 'This doesn''t feel like a candid. In other words, I don''t feel like I''m peeking in on some slice of reality. In spite of your title, it feels more like a portrait. But it''s an interesting composition with nice textures, and I can certainly imagine that it is in fact candid, so 7.', '2007-06-16 13:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791418, 531392, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how the reflections act like rain, obscuring my vision. 7</td>', 'I like how the reflections act like rain, obscuring my vision. 7', '2007-06-16 13:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791419, 528828, 50695, '<td valign="top">funny, and I really feel like I''m peeking at something candid. 7</td>', 'funny, and I really feel like I''m peeking at something candid. 7', '2007-06-16 13:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791422, 532144, 50695, '<td valign="top">this photo rewards repeated viewings. such an odd composition, it reminds me of when they show a detail of a painting. That one girl in the upper right is in such a classical pose. Perhaps you could blur the woman on the far right a bit? 8</td>', 'this photo rewards repeated viewings. such an odd composition, it reminds me of when they show a detail of a painting. That one girl in the upper right is in such a classical pose. Perhaps you could blur the woman on the far right a bit? 8', '2007-06-16 13:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3791424, 532266, 50695, '<td valign="top">interesting how the blurred people arrange themselves like painted animals. and the old man observes them all. 8</td>', 'interesting how the blurred people arrange themselves like painted animals. and the old man observes them all. 8', '2007-06-16 13:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
