(3791457, 532960, 50695, '<td valign="top">love the intensity of the interaction, and all those great lines and reflections. did you add vignetting to this? I don''t see the need. 8</td>', 'love the intensity of the interaction, and all those great lines and reflections. did you add vignetting to this? I don''t see the need. 8', '2007-06-16 13:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
