(3791472, 531030, 44877, '<td valign="top">Two things jumped out at me when seeing this. 1. the "CRAZY" is cut off. 2. The cart''s (or whatever it''s called) face is chopped off, too. <br/> <br/>But then I took a closer look - for one, the colors are extremely appealing in this photo, making it visually very interesting. Though it''s busy, there are leading lines that keep it from looking cluttered. <br/> <br/>Initially, I only saw people on a wild ride, but then upon closer inspection I saw the two girls who are taking a photo of themselves. Now that is really priceless and ups the photo''s quality in my opinion. <br/> <br/>I can see where you would have gone with this shot and not waited for another  "cart" - or maybe you got a bunch of shots, I don''t know. In any case, this is awesome - great capture. 8<br/> <br/>*****************************************<br/> <br/>This comment courtesy the Viral Comment Experiment (VCE). The VCE is an experiment to see if a large number of quality comments can be generated in a fashion similar to chain letters. The first time you receive a VCE comment, randomly choose five (5) images from this challenge (or another challenge) and leave quality, useful comments/critiques like this one. Make sure to mention good things as well as bad things. Then, see how many you receive in return over the next few weeks. Make sure you copy this VCE notice at the end of each comment. [Obligatory chain letter threat] If you do not make five quality comments within 24 hours, your hard drive will crash and your camera''s shutter will fail at an inopportune moment.</td>', 'Two things jumped out at me when seeing this. 1. the "CRAZY" is cut off. 2. The cart''s (or whatever it''s called) face is chopped off, too.  But then I took a closer look - for one, the colors are extremely appealing in this photo, making it visually very interesting. Though it''s busy, there are leading lines that keep it from looking cluttered.  Initially, I only saw people on a wild ride, but then upon closer inspection I saw the two girls who are taking a photo of themselves. Now that is really priceless and ups the photo''s quality in my opinion.  I can see where you would have gone with this shot and not waited for another  "cart" - or maybe you got a bunch of shots, I don''t know. In any case, this is awesome - great capture. 8 ***************************************** This comment courtesy the Viral Comment Experiment (VCE). The VCE is an experiment to see if a large number of quality comments can be generated in a fashion similar to chain letters. The first time you receive a VCE comment, randomly choose five (5) images from this challenge (or another challenge) and leave quality, useful comments/critiques like this one. Make sure to mention good things as well as bad things. Then, see how many you receive in return over the next few weeks. Make sure you copy this VCE notice at the end of each comment. [Obligatory chain letter threat] If you do not make five quality comments within 24 hours, your hard drive will crash and your camera''s shutter will fail at an inopportune moment.', '2007-06-16 13:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
