(3795544, 533186, 39880, '<td valign="top">This looks like a nice spot for a picture.  However, she really needs to be in focus.</td>', 'This looks like a nice spot for a picture.  However, she really needs to be in focus.', '2007-06-17 23:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
