(3795562, 532619, 44877, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting, composition, colors - just amazing. Good title too - which is worth an extra point, especially in the face of myriads of bad, bad titles. 9</td>', 'Wonderful lighting, composition, colors - just amazing. Good title too - which is worth an extra point, especially in the face of myriads of bad, bad titles. 9', '2007-06-17 23:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
