(3795583, 532526, 811, '<td valign="top">I like how this is sit on an angle.  It is a little flat, though.  Maybe if it just had a touch of a contrast boost</td>', 'I like how this is sit on an angle.  It is a little flat, though.  Maybe if it just had a touch of a contrast boost', '2007-06-18 00:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795585, 532065, 80100, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.</td>', 'Fantastic.', '2007-06-18 00:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795586, 530238, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is obviously very bizarre and yet it has interesting points - for one what seems to be the selective desaturation and then the repetition of greens. The out of focus thing - I can''t quite get with that. And I''m not sure if it''s intentional or one of those stupid tries for brown ribbon - though I don''t think so, since it''s too interesting for that... So I suppose I have to decide how *I* like it and vote accordingly. 5</td>', 'This is obviously very bizarre and yet it has interesting points - for one what seems to be the selective desaturation and then the repetition of greens. The out of focus thing - I can''t quite get with that. And I''m not sure if it''s intentional or one of those stupid tries for brown ribbon - though I don''t think so, since it''s too interesting for that... So I suppose I have to decide how *I* like it and vote accordingly. 5', '2007-06-18 00:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795587, 533208, 811, '<td valign="top">good capture, excellent exposure -- the details and focus look very good</td>', 'good capture, excellent exposure -- the details and focus look very good', '2007-06-18 00:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795588, 532387, 56672, '<td valign="top">The distance of the subject removes most of the candid aspect, for me.</td>', 'The distance of the subject removes most of the candid aspect, for me.', '2007-06-18 00:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795589, 531145, 811, '<td valign="top">great composition</td>', 'great composition', '2007-06-18 00:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795592, 532308, 44877, '<td valign="top">Very nice catch. A bit grainy for my taste. Reflections are awesome.</td>', 'Very nice catch. A bit grainy for my taste. Reflections are awesome.', '2007-06-18 00:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795593, 532089, 811, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  Seems a bit dark/flat, but i can''t tell if it is the picture or my monitor.</td>', 'Very interesting.  Seems a bit dark/flat, but i can''t tell if it is the picture or my monitor.', '2007-06-18 00:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795594, 530445, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition</td>', 'Good composition', '2007-06-18 00:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795595, 532208, 811, '<td valign="top">I like this -- very well done</td>', 'I like this -- very well done', '2007-06-18 00:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795597, 531748, 811, '<td valign="top">Very casual looking, but pretty good.  Did you try one in bw?</td>', 'Very casual looking, but pretty good.  Did you try one in bw?', '2007-06-18 00:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795600, 531393, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the bw, but I think it would feel better balanced if the tire wasn''t cropped off.</td>', 'I like the bw, but I think it would feel better balanced if the tire wasn''t cropped off.', '2007-06-18 00:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795601, 532960, 56672, '<td valign="top">I really like this, however I find the some of the bright/near blown highlights a little distracting.  Particularly the statue''s face near hers.</td>', 'I really like this, however I find the some of the bright/near blown highlights a little distracting.  Particularly the statue''s face near hers.', '2007-06-18 00:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795603, 532268, 811, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The square crop works well here, I think</td>', 'Very nice.  The square crop works well here, I think', '2007-06-18 00:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795605, 531467, 811, '<td valign="top">good capture</td>', 'good capture', '2007-06-18 00:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795606, 532868, 44877, '<td valign="top">It appears you might have lightened this too much, which produced the strange effects with the colors. Good composition.</td>', 'It appears you might have lightened this too much, which produced the strange effects with the colors. Good composition.', '2007-06-18 00:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795608, 532402, 56672, '<td valign="top">The color seems a little too warm overall.  I think this could have done with a lower color temp.</td>', 'The color seems a little too warm overall.  I think this could have done with a lower color temp.', '2007-06-18 00:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795609, 530801, 811, '<td valign="top">nice composition.  I like how the yellow jacket stands out from the rest of the picture</td>', 'nice composition.  I like how the yellow jacket stands out from the rest of the picture', '2007-06-18 00:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795612, 531369, 811, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but it is almost too busy, I think.  If you could have chosen just one or two to include in the shot, it may have had more impact</td>', 'Good shot, but it is almost too busy, I think.  If you could have chosen just one or two to include in the shot, it may have had more impact', '2007-06-18 00:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795614, 533088, 811, '<td valign="top">Great expression and capture.</td>', 'Great expression and capture.', '2007-06-18 00:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795615, 532788, 56672, '<td valign="top">The distance from the subjects really removes almost all of the candid aspect from this photo, in my opinion.  If you had cropped in closer around the two men in the trench you probably could have gotten a better result.</td>', 'The distance from the subjects really removes almost all of the candid aspect from this photo, in my opinion.  If you had cropped in closer around the two men in the trench you probably could have gotten a better result.', '2007-06-18 00:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795617, 530141, 56672, '<td valign="top">I just can''t see a dog, who is effectively posed for the camera, as candid.  Sorry.</td>', 'I just can''t see a dog, who is effectively posed for the camera, as candid.  Sorry.', '2007-06-18 00:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795618, 532954, 44877, '<td valign="top">Oh - my kinda photo. I like it all - the dress repeating color in the violin case. The glimpse - and very clear at that - of the street musician. Perfect motion blur in the passers-by. Great catch on the left here with the advertisement. Don''t know what the thing on the right is and don''t care - awesome photo. 10</td>', 'Oh - my kinda photo. I like it all - the dress repeating color in the violin case. The glimpse - and very clear at that - of the street musician. Perfect motion blur in the passers-by. Great catch on the left here with the advertisement. Don''t know what the thing on the right is and don''t care - awesome photo. 10', '2007-06-18 00:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795624, 532312, 70, '<td valign="top">They look like they did something that should stay in the tunnel, too... ;)</td>', 'They look like they did something that should stay in the tunnel, too... ;)', '2007-06-18 00:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795626, 531967, 56672, '<td valign="top">This is essentially just a landscape, to me.  The subjects are too far removed to have any candid effect.</td>', 'This is essentially just a landscape, to me.  The subjects are too far removed to have any candid effect.', '2007-06-18 00:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795629, 532765, 56672, '<td valign="top">Bugs just don''t know the difference between when they''re being photographed and when they''re not.  It''s a nice shot, but it''s just not candid, to me.</td>', 'Bugs just don''t know the difference between when they''re being photographed and when they''re not.  It''s a nice shot, but it''s just not candid, to me.', '2007-06-18 00:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795631, 533186, 70, '<td valign="top">This is out of focus. And needs more HDR.</td>', 'This is out of focus. And needs more HDR.', '2007-06-18 00:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795636, 532271, 56672, '<td valign="top">Too far removed with no clear subject.  The fisheye and extreme vignetting are distracting.</td>', 'Too far removed with no clear subject.  The fisheye and extreme vignetting are distracting.', '2007-06-18 00:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795640, 531932, 56672, '<td valign="top">I like this.  I think it could have done with a touch of brightening overall, however.</td>', 'I like this.  I think it could have done with a touch of brightening overall, however.', '2007-06-18 00:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795654, 529736, 56672, '<td valign="top">Cute, but performers (even, and almost especially little kids) are all too aware of being watched closely when they''re on stage.</td>', 'Cute, but performers (even, and almost especially little kids) are all too aware of being watched closely when they''re on stage.', '2007-06-18 00:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795700, 532319, 56672, '<td valign="top">She reminds of of <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amanda_Palmer" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Amanda Palmer</a>...</td>', 'She reminds of of Amanda Palmer...', '2007-06-18 00:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795716, 532947, 811, '<td valign="top">Good capture and I like the contrast between the blacks and whites</td>', 'Good capture and I like the contrast between the blacks and whites', '2007-06-18 00:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795719, 532371, 811, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I like that it has the setting and you can sort of tell what is going on</td>', 'Good shot.  I like that it has the setting and you can sort of tell what is going on', '2007-06-18 00:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795725, 532342, 811, '<td valign="top">Compositionally, I really like this.  It is balanced and doesn''t feel too "tight."  Also, it is technically well done with good details visible.  I think the bw works well to set the mood.  I think it would feel more "candid" and less "portraity" if there was something, anything, to give the context of what he was thinking or doing.</td>', 'Compositionally, I really like this.  It is balanced and doesn''t feel too "tight."  Also, it is technically well done with good details visible.  I think the bw works well to set the mood.  I think it would feel more "candid" and less "portraity" if there was something, anything, to give the context of what he was thinking or doing.', '2007-06-18 00:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795728, 532838, 66041, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W.   Great use of selective desaturation...</td>', 'Nice B&W.   Great use of selective desaturation...', '2007-06-18 00:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795747, 532680, 67697, '<td valign="top">Lucky girl!  Great DOF</td>', 'Lucky girl!  Great DOF', '2007-06-18 00:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795749, 532003, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the soulful look on her face.</td>', 'I love the soulful look on her face.', '2007-06-18 00:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795756, 532785, 66041, '<td valign="top">Nice.   sharp, good composition, nice overall tone.   very nice.</td>', 'Nice.   sharp, good composition, nice overall tone.   very nice.', '2007-06-18 00:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3795758, 533062, 37252, '<td valign="top">love the lines and angles here</td>', 'love the lines and angles here', '2007-06-18 00:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
