(3796467, 533091, 70369, '<td valign="top">I loved the eyes &amp; it''s ridiculous to compare this to that creepy doll site.. I mean, that''s just obsured.. I was one of your 10''s and I thought it was a choice to make the eyes processed this way and I liked it a lot..</td>', 'I loved the eyes & it''s ridiculous to compare this to that creepy doll site.. I mean, that''s just obsured.. I was one of your 10''s and I thought it was a choice to make the eyes processed this way and I liked it a lot..', '2007-06-18 02:44:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3796472, 533175, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dahkota:</b></div><hr/><i> First impressions: glad that you kept this in color.  I like the composition except for the chair in the second boy''s face - he has a moustache.  Sharp but with a few blown spots.  Interesting, but not much of a story. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yes, the moustache is the entire point of the composition and the title.<br/> <br/>For those who don''t know, The Mario Brothers are extraordinarily well-known characters from kid''s video games -- <i>Mario Teaches Typing</i> is a popular piece of educational software found in many elementary schools.<br/> <br/>The Mario Brothers are readily identified by their luxuriant black moustaches ...</td>', 'Originally posted by dahkota: First impressions: glad that you kept this in color.  I like the composition except for the chair in the second boy''s face - he has a moustache.  Sharp but with a few blown spots.  Interesting, but not much of a story.  Yes, the moustache is the entire point of the composition and the title. For those who don''t know, The Mario Brothers are extraordinarily well-known characters from kid''s video games -- Mario Teaches Typing is a popular piece of educational software found in many elementary schools. The Mario Brothers are readily identified by their luxuriant black moustaches ...', '2007-06-18 02:46:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3796489, 531473, 41337, '<td valign="top">LOL. So you used the colors form Mona Lisa eh? That seems fitting. Do you just cause these events when you''re nearby?</td>', 'LOL. So you used the colors form Mona Lisa eh? That seems fitting. Do you just cause these events when you''re nearby?', '2007-06-18 02:54:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3796495, 531782, 60915, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> Fantastic. This looks like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=35669" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">boysetsfire</a>! That hubcap alone is worth a 10. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Don! ...but <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=35669" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">boysetsfire</a> has more hair! ha! :D<br/> <br/>Thanks for that comment, mate, that is a great compliment! :)</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: Fantastic. This looks like  boysetsfire! That hubcap alone is worth a 10.   Thanks Don! ...but  boysetsfire has more hair! ha! :D Thanks for that comment, mate, that is a great compliment! :)', '2007-06-18 02:56:40.000000', NULL, 0),
