(3797250, 532988, 57060, '<td valign="top">Great image Sevil, one of my favorites in the challenge - not only because it''s a great image but also generates *alot* of opinion - from a photographic standpoint. I really like the lighting here - makes the shot really (amazing what the old D70 and a kit lens can do :). I also really like the cup - makes me think the viewer just stood up from their beer and took the photo, really clever for helping bring us into the shot. Finally, the most discussed part - the people exiting stage L. I''m not really liking them in the shot too much - looking at your coments it seems half and half. I personally feel the image would have been better without them, but the great thing is you really bring us interesting images to look at and think about - thanks again for that.<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Great image Sevil, one of my favorites in the challenge - not only because it''s a great image but also generates *alot* of opinion - from a photographic standpoint. I really like the lighting here - makes the shot really (amazing what the old D70 and a kit lens can do :). I also really like the cup - makes me think the viewer just stood up from their beer and took the photo, really clever for helping bring us into the shot. Finally, the most discussed part - the people exiting stage L. I''m not really liking them in the shot too much - looking at your coments it seems half and half. I personally feel the image would have been better without them, but the great thing is you really bring us interesting images to look at and think about - thanks again for that. Jack', '2007-06-18 10:15:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797302, 531932, 57060, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, just seems a bit too busy, too contrasty - not really any place for the eye to rest and take it in. I woul have loved to see a variation that makes the woman in the hut the main subject, tough to do in a candid shot though :)<br/> <br/>Nice job, Jack</td>', 'interesting shot, just seems a bit too busy, too contrasty - not really any place for the eye to rest and take it in. I woul have loved to see a variation that makes the woman in the hut the main subject, tough to do in a candid shot though :) Nice job, Jack', '2007-06-18 10:24:08.000000', NULL, 0),
