(3797389, 531378, 71951, '<td valign="top">Great photo, I thought this would have done much higher in the scoring. Don''t you just love those looks posed comments. If that were the case, I think over 1/2 of the photo''s in the challenge looks posed, and most of the previous Candid challenge winners also.</td>', 'Great photo, I thought this would have done much higher in the scoring. Don''t you just love those looks posed comments. If that were the case, I think over 1/2 of the photo''s in the challenge looks posed, and most of the previous Candid challenge winners also.', '2007-06-18 10:41:49.000000', NULL, 0),
