(3797477, 530907, 66384, '<td valign="top">Jeff, this is a wonderful shot. I can''t imagine why anyone would rate it 1 or 3 unless they were mixed up about the rating scale -- thinking 1 it top. The focus on the needle is dead on. Perhaps some people wanted the focus on her eyes. Something about the hands doesn''t look quite right, maybe too much noise reduction and sharpening. Anyway, I really like the concentration in her face, and the eyes crossed trying so hard to see the eye of the needle.</td>', 'Jeff, this is a wonderful shot. I can''t imagine why anyone would rate it 1 or 3 unless they were mixed up about the rating scale -- thinking 1 it top. The focus on the needle is dead on. Perhaps some people wanted the focus on her eyes. Something about the hands doesn''t look quite right, maybe too much noise reduction and sharpening. Anyway, I really like the concentration in her face, and the eyes crossed trying so hard to see the eye of the needle.', '2007-06-18 11:07:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797486, 533118, 66384, '<td valign="top">He''s adorable. His face and posture are so expressive. Nice capture.</td>', 'He''s adorable. His face and posture are so expressive. Nice capture.', '2007-06-18 11:10:13.000000', NULL, 0),
