(3797773, 532266, 79242, '<td valign="top">I also thought this was a great photo. In the Free Study, I would have easily given it an 8 or a 9 (Which is very high for me). As it was in candid challenge I gave it a 7, still pretty high. In a candid photo, I usually want to be able to see a face (or at least something that gives me a sense of feeling). This photo does that, but not in the same way I want a candid photo to do it. I feel a sort of loneliness here. To me it says that this man is alone and he wants nothing more than to do a simple crossword , but he wants people to be around him while he does it. Who knows though, maybe he is just waiting for his wife in the shoe store..... but that is not how it makes me feel. I guess I am rambling, which is a good thing cause I would not take the time to ramble over a picture i did not like. Do not be discouraged by the votes here, they mean nothing unless you are trying to appeal to the widest audience possible, which I do not think you are. As far as this competition though, I do feel the score was about right. Maybe a better photo than most, but not a better candid. Just my honest thoughts.</td>', 'I also thought this was a great photo. In the Free Study, I would have easily given it an 8 or a 9 (Which is very high for me). As it was in candid challenge I gave it a 7, still pretty high. In a candid photo, I usually want to be able to see a face (or at least something that gives me a sense of feeling). This photo does that, but not in the same way I want a candid photo to do it. I feel a sort of loneliness here. To me it says that this man is alone and he wants nothing more than to do a simple crossword , but he wants people to be around him while he does it. Who knows though, maybe he is just waiting for his wife in the shoe store..... but that is not how it makes me feel. I guess I am rambling, which is a good thing cause I would not take the time to ramble over a picture i did not like. Do not be discouraged by the votes here, they mean nothing unless you are trying to appeal to the widest audience possible, which I do not think you are. As far as this competition though, I do feel the score was about right. Maybe a better photo than most, but not a better candid. Just my honest thoughts.', '2007-06-18 12:25:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797775, 532388, 24454, '<td valign="top">Hey. . . .I know that cuter than cute little girl!!!   And I know how hard it is to get pictures of her too!  What a great candid photo!<br/> <br/>I think this should have the score of your commenters. . . not 5.6! :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hey. . . .I know that cuter than cute little girl!!!   And I know how hard it is to get pictures of her too!  What a great candid photo! I think this should have the score of your commenters. . . not 5.6! :) ', '2007-06-18 12:25:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797781, 532193, 19708, '<td valign="top">While this is a great photograph, I kind of struggle accepting this as a candid in the true sense. Sports &amp; performances such as musicians, though  can be candids, are often more decisive moments and as such, the people in them are in a way, performing, thus in a way, know they are being watched and often photographed. Not necessarily the case here, but is on that fine edge for me. Congrats on a high finish in this challenge, and certainly applaud your timing on this.</td>', 'While this is a great photograph, I kind of struggle accepting this as a candid in the true sense. Sports & performances such as musicians, though  can be candids, are often more decisive moments and as such, the people in them are in a way, performing, thus in a way, know they are being watched and often photographed. Not necessarily the case here, but is on that fine edge for me. Congrats on a high finish in this challenge, and certainly applaud your timing on this.', '2007-06-18 12:29:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797784, 529884, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this Charmayne!   Can''t for the life of me figure out why it is in 182nd place.   It is a powerful candid!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love this Charmayne!   Can''t for the life of me figure out why it is in 182nd place.   It is a powerful candid! ', '2007-06-18 12:29:43.000000', NULL, 0),
