(3797791, 532543, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, but I DO like it!  What a refreshing slice of childhood.  I think you captured a great moment here.   I''m disappointed that the voters didn''t see this<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh, but I DO like it!  What a refreshing slice of childhood.  I think you captured a great moment here.   I''m disappointed that the voters didn''t see this ', '2007-06-18 12:30:49.000000', NULL, 0),
