(3797809, 531931, 19708, '<td valign="top">What a decisive moment here! Your timing of this couldn''t be better.<br/>I am having a bit of a struggle accepting this as a true candid, as it really is more about the moment, than the people.<br/>Congrats on a top making top 20 on this - it''s one heck of a photograph!</td>', 'What a decisive moment here! Your timing of this couldn''t be better.I am having a bit of a struggle accepting this as a true candid, as it really is more about the moment, than the people.Congrats on a top making top 20 on this - it''s one heck of a photograph!', '2007-06-18 12:36:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797839, 532342, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely portrait of a man (and yes, I consider it a candid).  I''m even more impressed after seeing the original - you really do a great job mastering a photograph from a picture.  The more important aspect of all of this is the printing and giving of the picture to the gentleman.  To me, that''s what it''s all about in the first place.  Ain''t nothing to this picture taking thing if people don''t enjoy the end result, you know?  Nice work here.</td>', 'A lovely portrait of a man (and yes, I consider it a candid).  I''m even more impressed after seeing the original - you really do a great job mastering a photograph from a picture.  The more important aspect of all of this is the printing and giving of the picture to the gentleman.  To me, that''s what it''s all about in the first place.  Ain''t nothing to this picture taking thing if people don''t enjoy the end result, you know?  Nice work here.', '2007-06-18 12:44:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797843, 533146, 30982, '<td valign="top">He really does seem to be from another time and place, doesn''t he?  The reflection in the glasses emphasizes this for me - as though he''s even looking somewhere entirely different from where he is.  Lovely conversion, by the way.</td>', 'He really does seem to be from another time and place, doesn''t he?  The reflection in the glasses emphasizes this for me - as though he''s even looking somewhere entirely different from where he is.  Lovely conversion, by the way.', '2007-06-18 12:46:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797851, 531937, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the distortion and the bright orange on the tires - to me those two things work together to create the world you allude to in the title.  The orange adds the "life" to the young man''s world as the buildings bend away from him, giving him his own space.  Nicely and creative use of the fisheye!</td>', 'I love the distortion and the bright orange on the tires - to me those two things work together to create the world you allude to in the title.  The orange adds the "life" to the young man''s world as the buildings bend away from him, giving him his own space.  Nicely and creative use of the fisheye!', '2007-06-18 12:49:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797865, 533146, 24454, '<td valign="top">Rae-Ann, this is awesome!  What an amazing old-timey feel!   I''m disappointed that it didn''t score better  :(<br/> <br/></td>', 'Rae-Ann, this is awesome!  What an amazing old-timey feel!   I''m disappointed that it didn''t score better  :( ', '2007-06-18 12:52:54.000000', NULL, 0),
