(3797886, 532973, 74605, '<td valign="top">What a great creative idea!  You do some fun things with your photography!</td>', 'What a great creative idea!  You do some fun things with your photography!', '2007-06-18 12:58:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797888, 531937, 42100, '<td valign="top">Really like this one a lot...very fun &amp; upbeat!  Great composition as well.  This really should of scored better IMO.</td>', 'Really like this one a lot...very fun & upbeat!  Great composition as well.  This really should of scored better IMO.', '2007-06-18 12:58:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797892, 529886, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cool iguana!  I know it probably wasn''t possible, but it would have been neat to get him (the iguana) in the shot, too.  No doubt it wouldn''t have been a tight enough picture for DPC purposes, but a cool picture for the boys.  I like the way their heads are tilted towards each other - the front one seems especially engrossed.  The sun here is a bit of your enemy, but I figure candids are something over which you don''t usually have great control of the light - expressions are more the emphasis.</td>', 'Cool iguana!  I know it probably wasn''t possible, but it would have been neat to get him (the iguana) in the shot, too.  No doubt it wouldn''t have been a tight enough picture for DPC purposes, but a cool picture for the boys.  I like the way their heads are tilted towards each other - the front one seems especially engrossed.  The sun here is a bit of your enemy, but I figure candids are something over which you don''t usually have great control of the light - expressions are more the emphasis.', '2007-06-18 12:59:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797894, 532713, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh what a GREAT candid photo set in such an amazingly beautiful scene!   Wow!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh what a GREAT candid photo set in such an amazingly beautiful scene!   Wow! ', '2007-06-18 13:00:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797897, 530199, 30982, '<td valign="top">What fascinates me about this is the reflected world in the ball, and she is indeed quite focused in her own space it seems.  Nicely seen.</td>', 'What fascinates me about this is the reflected world in the ball, and she is indeed quite focused in her own space it seems.  Nicely seen.', '2007-06-18 13:01:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797898, 532713, 41047, '<td valign="top">this is an amazing scene for candid. i love how she is giving a scale to the picture.</td>', 'this is an amazing scene for candid. i love how she is giving a scale to the picture.', '2007-06-18 13:01:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797902, 531846, 66193, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Deb!  An excellent placing for an excellent candid!  the B&amp;W conversion is spot-on.</td>', 'Congrats, Deb!  An excellent placing for an excellent candid!  the B&W conversion is spot-on.', '2007-06-18 13:02:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797911, 532929, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like the pasty white guy, and really like the fact it''s a sunbathing shot without babes.  :-)  Great compositional elements, too, from the descending line of palms to the ascending building lines.</td>', 'I quite like the pasty white guy, and really like the fact it''s a sunbathing shot without babes.  :-)  Great compositional elements, too, from the descending line of palms to the ascending building lines.', '2007-06-18 13:03:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797917, 531962, 30982, '<td valign="top">He strikes me by his pose as being somewhat confused and perhaps a bit overwhelmed - so much is done, yet so much more to do!</td>', 'He strikes me by his pose as being somewhat confused and perhaps a bit overwhelmed - so much is done, yet so much more to do!', '2007-06-18 13:05:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797928, 531518, 30982, '<td valign="top">Thanks for not cropping the guy on the left of the shot.  While your title does give a scenario for this, I see more of a sad meeting of relatives, going over the books of the family business that''s not faring well.</td>', 'Thanks for not cropping the guy on the left of the shot.  While your title does give a scenario for this, I see more of a sad meeting of relatives, going over the books of the family business that''s not faring well.', '2007-06-18 13:07:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797932, 533118, 30982, '<td valign="top">Rob, I liked this one when voting and didn''t at all mind the fence there.  To me, candids are about the humanity captured and his face and body language reflect some serious uncertainty.  In fact, I quite liked the railing there.  His proximity to the edge adds to that uncertainty feeling, that he''s not sure he wants to move beyond it''s protection.  Your explanation in your notes confirms this.</td>', 'Rob, I liked this one when voting and didn''t at all mind the fence there.  To me, candids are about the humanity captured and his face and body language reflect some serious uncertainty.  In fact, I quite liked the railing there.  His proximity to the edge adds to that uncertainty feeling, that he''s not sure he wants to move beyond it''s protection.  Your explanation in your notes confirms this.', '2007-06-18 13:10:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797935, 531192, 30982, '<td valign="top">Dale looks like a delightful and kind young man, and I love the reflections!  A bit soft, yes, but it kinda adds a warmth to it.</td>', 'Dale looks like a delightful and kind young man, and I love the reflections!  A bit soft, yes, but it kinda adds a warmth to it.', '2007-06-18 13:11:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797940, 533173, 30982, '<td valign="top">The neat thing about this is how the world inside the glass seems so removed from that on the outside.</td>', 'The neat thing about this is how the world inside the glass seems so removed from that on the outside.', '2007-06-18 13:13:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797944, 532724, 30982, '<td valign="top">VERY well seen and a very interesting and intriguing shot!</td>', 'VERY well seen and a very interesting and intriguing shot!', '2007-06-18 13:14:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797949, 532806, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... I see I didn''t comment on this during the challenge, which is odd as it''s one of my top shots.  In addition to the young lady''s expression, I love the blurred and still hands in the foreground.  Puts you there!</td>', 'Hmmm... I see I didn''t comment on this during the challenge, which is odd as it''s one of my top shots.  In addition to the young lady''s expression, I love the blurred and still hands in the foreground.  Puts you there!', '2007-06-18 13:16:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797951, 531953, 30982, '<td valign="top">From their expressions, I think they''re not entirely overjoyed with the potential of the bargain.  I''d suspect they passed that by and kept looking.  Good crisp capture!</td>', 'From their expressions, I think they''re not entirely overjoyed with the potential of the bargain.  I''d suspect they passed that by and kept looking.  Good crisp capture!', '2007-06-18 13:18:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797955, 530228, 30982, '<td valign="top">The shirt AND the expression make this priceless!</td>', 'The shirt AND the expression make this priceless!', '2007-06-18 13:18:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797974, 532437, 30982, '<td valign="top">Indeed a nice quiet moment and makes you wonder what he''s holding.  He seems quite unaware of the others around him.</td>', 'Indeed a nice quiet moment and makes you wonder what he''s holding.  He seems quite unaware of the others around him.', '2007-06-18 13:25:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797977, 533050, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s when she tries to screw in the cigarette and drag on the screw that she''ll have problems!</td>', 'It''s when she tries to screw in the cigarette and drag on the screw that she''ll have problems!', '2007-06-18 13:27:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797982, 531145, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s simple things that I like sometimes - here the light and the curves are compelling to me.</td>', 'It''s simple things that I like sometimes - here the light and the curves are compelling to me.', '2007-06-18 13:29:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3797992, 527867, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good family candid - a very relaxed feeling to this.</td>', 'A good family candid - a very relaxed feeling to this.', '2007-06-18 13:32:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798002, 533084, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m a little too uneducated and shall look up Eurydice - I thought it was her name.  Or a pet name for the mower, perhaps.  Or a code word of some kind.  What I did like, though, was that she''s a remarkably pretty girl slightly mis-dressed to be mowing the lawn - like she HAD to do this before dad would let her go out for the evening, so it''s a rush job and she''ll be on her way as soon as she''s done.</td>', 'I''m a little too uneducated and shall look up Eurydice - I thought it was her name.  Or a pet name for the mower, perhaps.  Or a code word of some kind.  What I did like, though, was that she''s a remarkably pretty girl slightly mis-dressed to be mowing the lawn - like she HAD to do this before dad would let her go out for the evening, so it''s a rush job and she''ll be on her way as soon as she''s done.', '2007-06-18 13:35:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798004, 531846, 66384, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Deb, on your star. This is such a wonderful photo that I''m not surprised it came so close to a ribbon. I love the processing and the composition. It really looks like you were having as much fun as the lady in the swing.</td>', 'Congratulations, Deb, on your star. This is such a wonderful photo that I''m not surprised it came so close to a ribbon. I love the processing and the composition. It really looks like you were having as much fun as the lady in the swing.', '2007-06-18 13:36:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798006, 531467, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent, and woefully underrated.  I suspect (without reading the comments) that voters either thought it "posed" or too bright.  To me it is neither - it''s a sweet moment very well captured.</td>', 'Excellent, and woefully underrated.  I suspect (without reading the comments) that voters either thought it "posed" or too bright.  To me it is neither - it''s a sweet moment very well captured.', '2007-06-18 13:36:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798008, 531473, 5885, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yanko:</b></div><hr/><i> Do you just cause these events when you''re nearby? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I may or may not have asked the other girl to yank down her pants :-)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=538521" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5885/thumb/538521.jpg?1'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5885/thumb/538521.jpg?1'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5885/thumb/538521.jpg?1"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-18 12:42:38.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by yanko: Do you just cause these events when you''re nearby?   I may or may not have asked the other girl to yank down her pants :-) ', '2007-06-18 13:37:27.000000', '2007-06-18 13:42:38.000000', 0),
(3798036, 532271, 72317, '<td valign="top">Have I seen this somewhere before?</td>', 'Have I seen this somewhere before?', '2007-06-18 13:50:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798039, 532800, 63495, '<td valign="top">I know what you mean. Good capture, I like shooting in Founders park too, In fact i went there looking to shoot some skate boarders and there were any the afternoon i went.</td>', 'I know what you mean. Good capture, I like shooting in Founders park too, In fact i went there looking to shoot some skate boarders and there were any the afternoon i went.', '2007-06-18 13:51:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798041, 533205, 72317, '<td valign="top">LOL.. Nice..</td>', 'LOL.. Nice..', '2007-06-18 13:52:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798044, 531473, 72317, '<td valign="top">Holy moly. I see you got an eyeful at the beach. Nice.. XD</td>', 'Holy moly. I see you got an eyeful at the beach. Nice.. XD', '2007-06-18 13:53:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798050, 531846, 50695, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. The only reason I didn''t go higher than 7 is that it''s such a cliche genre, but your shot is *much* less cliched than the blue ribbon winner. That''s the kind of shot that the attendant hands you after your ride and asks for 5 bucks. Your shot, however, has a certain Hitchcockian drama to it, and nice oof background adding to the dizziness.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. The only reason I didn''t go higher than 7 is that it''s such a cliche genre, but your shot is *much* less cliched than the blue ribbon winner. That''s the kind of shot that the attendant hands you after your ride and asks for 5 bucks. Your shot, however, has a certain Hitchcockian drama to it, and nice oof background adding to the dizziness.', '2007-06-18 13:55:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798071, 532913, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is amazing-what a character!  Congratulations!</td>', 'This is amazing-what a character!  Congratulations!', '2007-06-18 14:00:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798073, 530895, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent image and (IMO) extremely underrated. Great work, Robin.</td>', 'This is an excellent image and (IMO) extremely underrated. Great work, Robin.', '2007-06-18 14:00:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798077, 531228, 4162, '<td valign="top">A very worthy winner-Congrats!! This is the kind of picture that really sticks in the mind...</td>', 'A very worthy winner-Congrats!! This is the kind of picture that really sticks in the mind...', '2007-06-18 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798080, 532342, 52549, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture. Great work, Brad.</td>', 'Beautiful capture. Great work, Brad.', '2007-06-18 14:02:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798113, 531467, 74605, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge.  You daughter is absolutely beautiful.  You captured this wonderful moment beautifully!  Surely should have scored lots higher!</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge.  You daughter is absolutely beautiful.  You captured this wonderful moment beautifully!  Surely should have scored lots higher!', '2007-06-18 14:13:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798131, 533089, 45524, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo, and congrats on the top 20 finish.</td>', 'Fantastic photo, and congrats on the top 20 finish.', '2007-06-18 14:20:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798166, 532913, 60495, '<td valign="top">Great job, really nice tones and sharpness, so natural and candid and its nice to see an image do well where the person has not been plastisized! Really nice!</td>', 'Great job, really nice tones and sharpness, so natural and candid and its nice to see an image do well where the person has not been plastisized! Really nice!', '2007-06-18 14:34:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798201, 530677, 51538, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my Green and Pleasant Land, in many ways.  Time flies.  Very moving (for me at least) photo.</td>', 'Reminds me of my Green and Pleasant Land, in many ways.  Time flies.  Very moving (for me at least) photo.', '2007-06-18 14:48:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798226, 532543, 30982, '<td valign="top">Why do you not like this?  I quite like it.  It has an exuberance to it.  In fact, I''ve sat for a time and shot young folks like this one throwing water on each other in much the same way that''s happening here.  I think I get as much enjoyment out of shooting them as they do just being kids.  I also like (from a photographic perspective) the fact the colors are not hyped, and in fact seem just a bit subdued, letting the young man''s expression take center stage.</td>', 'Why do you not like this?  I quite like it.  It has an exuberance to it.  In fact, I''ve sat for a time and shot young folks like this one throwing water on each other in much the same way that''s happening here.  I think I get as much enjoyment out of shooting them as they do just being kids.  I also like (from a photographic perspective) the fact the colors are not hyped, and in fact seem just a bit subdued, letting the young man''s expression take center stage.', '2007-06-18 14:57:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798231, 532621, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant color, nice composition, and most importantly, makes me want to go wading with her - it looks delightful!</td>', 'Very vibrant color, nice composition, and most importantly, makes me want to go wading with her - it looks delightful!', '2007-06-18 14:58:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798236, 532228, 30982, '<td valign="top">That guy on the right is gonna get a hernia if he''s not careful.  :-)  Very nice processing on this - I like it.</td>', 'That guy on the right is gonna get a hernia if he''s not careful.  :-)  Very nice processing on this - I like it.', '2007-06-18 14:59:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798245, 532819, 30982, '<td valign="top">Harsh sunlight isn''t always a good thing to shoot in, but I like the way it worked out here with the sparklies.  And I highly encourage your daughter to go into geology - downright fascinating stuff!  (Can Ollie See Down My Pants Pocket?  Tom Jones Can.  Tom''s Queer.  A mnemonic to remember the geologic ages, starting with Cambrian, Ordivician... through Triasic, Jurrasic, Cretacious; Tertiary, Quaternary - spelling optional on most of those.)</td>', 'Harsh sunlight isn''t always a good thing to shoot in, but I like the way it worked out here with the sparklies.  And I highly encourage your daughter to go into geology - downright fascinating stuff!  (Can Ollie See Down My Pants Pocket?  Tom Jones Can.  Tom''s Queer.  A mnemonic to remember the geologic ages, starting with Cambrian, Ordivician... through Triasic, Jurrasic, Cretacious; Tertiary, Quaternary - spelling optional on most of those.)', '2007-06-18 15:02:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798247, 531885, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing, nice strong contrast, and I just plain like it!</td>', 'Perfect timing, nice strong contrast, and I just plain like it!', '2007-06-18 15:03:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798249, 532542, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very good shot of the team with its cart and driver.  Nice setting for them, too!</td>', 'A very good shot of the team with its cart and driver.  Nice setting for them, too!', '2007-06-18 15:04:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798254, 533205, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I take it they weren''t fond of you snapping their picture?  I like the color combos - the orange of the wall that matches her hair, and the blue-gray of the door that matches their jeans.  Very well seen.</td>', 'LOL!  I take it they weren''t fond of you snapping their picture?  I like the color combos - the orange of the wall that matches her hair, and the blue-gray of the door that matches their jeans.  Very well seen.', '2007-06-18 15:05:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798258, 531754, 30982, '<td valign="top">I didn''t see this as being posed at all - I thought it a wonderfully warm moment captured.  It''s very apparent she''s quite taken with the gentleman!  Beautiful light - very well processed to bring out the essence of the shot.</td>', 'I didn''t see this as being posed at all - I thought it a wonderfully warm moment captured.  It''s very apparent she''s quite taken with the gentleman!  Beautiful light - very well processed to bring out the essence of the shot.', '2007-06-18 15:07:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798267, 530492, 30982, '<td valign="top">You picked a great subject for the challenge - he does indeed have character and seems very intent on what he''s watching.  Backgrounds with candids can be a problem but it seems to me you did a pretty good job keeping it as simple as possible given the location.</td>', 'You picked a great subject for the challenge - he does indeed have character and seems very intent on what he''s watching.  Backgrounds with candids can be a problem but it seems to me you did a pretty good job keeping it as simple as possible given the location.', '2007-06-18 15:10:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798491, 533092, 31606, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Although I think I would have liked to have seen the rule of thirds used here.  Even if there is stuff in the background sometimes it can add to a shot.  Lovely bright colors as well.  I like it.</td>', 'Very nice image.  Although I think I would have liked to have seen the rule of thirds used here.  Even if there is stuff in the background sometimes it can add to a shot.  Lovely bright colors as well.  I like it.', '2007-06-18 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798575, 531846, 67697, '<td valign="top">Wow you really did a great job with the processing! I really did love this image and the expression you caught.  Congrats on the top 10!!!</td>', 'Wow you really did a great job with the processing! I really did love this image and the expression you caught.  Congrats on the top 10!!!', '2007-06-18 16:33:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798581, 533205, 67697, '<td valign="top">I tell ya - kids these days - no respect for their elders hehe.  Lots of vibrant reds in the pic!  Like we talked about, I think a little cropping and some desat would have made the subjects stand out a tad more.  And given center stage to the bird hehe.  Fun pic!</td>', 'I tell ya - kids these days - no respect for their elders hehe.  Lots of vibrant reds in the pic!  Like we talked about, I think a little cropping and some desat would have made the subjects stand out a tad more.  And given center stage to the bird hehe.  Fun pic!', '2007-06-18 16:35:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798588, 532895, 67697, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame deb because this really did deserve a higher score.  And look - 6 people thought it was better than a 6!!!  So cherish that and ignore the 51 people who love to use the 4 and below buttons.<br/> <br/>I think with just a big of lightning up on their faces (to counteract the brightness of the background), you would have put a little more focus on the boys.<br/> <br/>Does not look posed to me!<br/> <br/>Keep on shooting!</td>', 'It''s a shame deb because this really did deserve a higher score.  And look - 6 people thought it was better than a 6!!!  So cherish that and ignore the 51 people who love to use the 4 and below buttons. I think with just a big of lightning up on their faces (to counteract the brightness of the background), you would have put a little more focus on the boys. Does not look posed to me! Keep on shooting!', '2007-06-18 16:38:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798599, 532542, 67697, '<td valign="top">Before voting, I did not have a chance to ask you how this looks in black and white.  Hey, no 1''s or 2''s for you!  That is good!  Great centered comp and the horses do a nice job of pulling you into the pic.<br/> <br/>Go Team MC! hehe</td>', 'Before voting, I did not have a chance to ask you how this looks in black and white.  Hey, no 1''s or 2''s for you!  That is good!  Great centered comp and the horses do a nice job of pulling you into the pic. Go Team MC! hehe', '2007-06-18 16:40:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798625, 532590, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love your picture description lol.  To the point, nice and simple.  Giraffe vs. people staredown.  I like how you captured all the people looking up - good timing!</td>', 'I love your picture description lol.  To the point, nice and simple.  Giraffe vs. people staredown.  I like how you captured all the people looking up - good timing!', '2007-06-18 16:45:47.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3798674, 532526, 67697, '<td valign="top">I remember the "maths" in the title and thought - oh someone not from the US lol.<br/> <br/>Smart girl, doing her work outside!  I liked the black and white treatment but the angle threw me off. However, I am sure that most of my math students would tell me that they always feel a little off balance when doing math lol.<br/> <br/>Interesting candid!</td>', 'I remember the "maths" in the title and thought - oh someone not from the US lol. Smart girl, doing her work outside!  I liked the black and white treatment but the angle threw me off. However, I am sure that most of my math students would tell me that they always feel a little off balance when doing math lol. Interesting candid!', '2007-06-18 17:00:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798692, 532319, 67145, '<td valign="top">hey tashy ... a fantastic photograph, a great score and some excellent comments ... you did good!!! ..:):)xx</td>', 'hey tashy ... a fantastic photograph, a great score and some excellent comments ... you did good!!! ..:):)xx', '2007-06-18 17:07:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798697, 532940, 62318, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I like the other onlooker in the window, it really adds another dimension to the shot. A polarizer might have helped in this shot, but a good take at a slice of life!</td>', 'Interesting shot. I like the other onlooker in the window, it really adds another dimension to the shot. A polarizer might have helped in this shot, but a good take at a slice of life!', '2007-06-18 17:07:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798709, 531846, 4411, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> Wonderful shot. The only reason I didn''t go higher than 7 is that it''s such a cliche genre, but your shot is *much* less cliched than the blue ribbon winner. That''s the kind of shot that the attendant hands you after your ride and asks for 5 bucks.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Damn I knew I forgot something!<br/> <br/>Didn''t get to this in voting but I love how you''ve picked your subject out from the rest of the scene. You just forgot to add some DPC standard water drops :P</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: Wonderful shot. The only reason I didn''t go higher than 7 is that it''s such a cliche genre, but your shot is *much* less cliched than the blue ribbon winner. That''s the kind of shot that the attendant hands you after your ride and asks for 5 bucks. Damn I knew I forgot something! Didn''t get to this in voting but I love how you''ve picked your subject out from the rest of the scene. You just forgot to add some DPC standard water drops :P', '2007-06-18 17:11:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3798725, 531867, 35357, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> weird processing and heavyhanded vignetting do not a candid make. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Congrats on the 4.9 you got in this challenge. :-P  (I was trying for a DPC-friendly shot for the DPL, but ya. :-/)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-28 09:49:09.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: weird processing and heavyhanded vignetting do not a candid make.  Congrats on the 4.9 you got in this challenge. :-P  (I was trying for a DPC-friendly shot for the DPL, but ya. :-/)', '2007-06-18 17:16:30.000000', '2007-12-28 09:49:09.000000', 0),
