(3798761, 532526, 51538, '<td valign="top">IMO, a charming image.  Snap-like.  But charming.  If only the girl was in sharper focus.  Tilt is good for me, BTW.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-18 16:25:50.</i></td>', 'IMO, a charming image.  Snap-like.  But charming.  If only the girl was in sharper focus.  Tilt is good for me, BTW.', '2007-06-18 17:25:31.000000', '2007-06-18 17:25:50.000000', 0),
