(3798772, 531518, 62318, '<td valign="top">I think this is a wonderful shot. I like how the guy on the left frames the shot, but gives enough to give context to the shot. Same goes with the arm. Feels like the guy is getting beat down by the critics. Love it. Lighting is a bit rough and is probably what hurt you. This is the type of photo that one can''t enjoy on a quick vote once over. Shame. Good stuff.<br/> <br/>I "might" have left this one as "Untitled" as there is a lot of intpretation in the scene.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-18 16:31:20.</i></td>', 'I think this is a wonderful shot. I like how the guy on the left frames the shot, but gives enough to give context to the shot. Same goes with the arm. Feels like the guy is getting beat down by the critics. Love it. Lighting is a bit rough and is probably what hurt you. This is the type of photo that one can''t enjoy on a quick vote once over. Shame. Good stuff. I "might" have left this one as "Untitled" as there is a lot of intpretation in the scene.', '2007-06-18 17:30:36.000000', '2007-06-18 17:31:20.000000', 0),
(3798828, 531782, 44877, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe you got under 6 on this. I saw this in my last voting stages and was in a hurry or I would have left a comment. This is an exceptional photograph and clearly very misunderstood and very underrated. The atmosphere you captured is wonderful and moving. The image quality is fantastic. Colors, composition - all are superb. Stupid Voters.<br/> <br/>Edit - in fact - to underscore my point, I''m adding this to my favs. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-18 16:51:19.</i></td>', 'I can''t believe you got under 6 on this. I saw this in my last voting stages and was in a hurry or I would have left a comment. This is an exceptional photograph and clearly very misunderstood and very underrated. The atmosphere you captured is wonderful and moving. The image quality is fantastic. Colors, composition - all are superb. Stupid Voters. Edit - in fact - to underscore my point, I''m adding this to my favs. ', '2007-06-18 17:46:08.000000', '2007-06-18 17:51:19.000000', 0),
