(3801369, 532543, 62318, '<td valign="top">Read you detail comments, funny how people differ. I just take pictures to help me remember my life. That''s the great thing about photography, people do it for some many different reasons. This is a lot different from most of your work and I can see why you don''t like it though it is a well captured photo. Cheers and keep shooting. I always enjoy going through your portfolio.</td>', 'Read you detail comments, funny how people differ. I just take pictures to help me remember my life. That''s the great thing about photography, people do it for some many different reasons. This is a lot different from most of your work and I can see why you don''t like it though it is a well captured photo. Cheers and keep shooting. I always enjoy going through your portfolio.', '2007-06-19 11:47:10.000000', NULL, 0),
