(3802239, 532740, 74979, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bdenny:</b></div><hr/><i> I just took some dragonfly candids yesterday.  They were nowhere near this good!  Did you use a flash?  Is this a drastic crop or were you pretty close? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>THANKS!!  no flash, focal length of 243mm, and then cropped.  I was lucky and got some other really great ones too, different perspectives &amp; backgrounds, I''ll post them maybe...just not ever again in the "Candid" challenge!  :)<br/> <br/>Anni</td>', 'Originally posted by bdenny: I just took some dragonfly candids yesterday.  They were nowhere near this good!  Did you use a flash?  Is this a drastic crop or were you pretty close?   THANKS!!  no flash, focal length of 243mm, and then cropped.  I was lucky and got some other really great ones too, different perspectives & backgrounds, I''ll post them maybe...just not ever again in the "Candid" challenge!  :) Anni', '2007-06-19 16:10:21.000000', NULL, 0),
