(3810394, 533038, 15291, '<td valign="top">Hi Sean,<br/>       Nice image, Hope we have more to look forward to in are old age :). I like your compo &amp; framing here, although I think your toneal range is a bit off. You are correct in the concreate coming out in an odd color, and the are a few spots that are hot mainly the gent far lefts watch, the middle gents sneaker, and third gents paper or hanky in the shirt pocket. Also the gent far right we seem to have lost all detail and can not really see what he is resting his arm on. I did enjoy the viewing image seems to fit right in with th song this is our country...nice effort.</td>', 'Hi Sean,       Nice image, Hope we have more to look forward to in are old age :). I like your compo & framing here, although I think your toneal range is a bit off. You are correct in the concreate coming out in an odd color, and the are a few spots that are hot mainly the gent far lefts watch, the middle gents sneaker, and third gents paper or hanky in the shirt pocket. Also the gent far right we seem to have lost all detail and can not really see what he is resting his arm on. I did enjoy the viewing image seems to fit right in with th song this is our country...nice effort.', '2007-06-20 18:56:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3810563, 531862, 15291, '<td valign="top">Hi Mark,<br/>      Nice relaxing image here. Very much agree withthe placement of your subject couldn''t have been better. The tonality is great and the exposure is dead on. The image is sharp,crisp and the details splended. The two things here that caught my eye 1) The pole, not sure if it was to close or it''s angle in relation to her but it kept catching my eye. 2) This is  more of a title thing then anything else, " riverside relaxation" don''t get me wrong your dof works very well here but we can''t see nor get the feeling she is at the riverside.</td>', 'Hi Mark,      Nice relaxing image here. Very much agree withthe placement of your subject couldn''t have been better. The tonality is great and the exposure is dead on. The image is sharp,crisp and the details splended. The two things here that caught my eye 1) The pole, not sure if it was to close or it''s angle in relation to her but it kept catching my eye. 2) This is  more of a title thing then anything else, " riverside relaxation" don''t get me wrong your dof works very well here but we can''t see nor get the feeling she is at the riverside.', '2007-06-20 19:23:13.000000', NULL, 0),
