(3810860, 532420, 66494, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by TooCool:</b></div><hr/><i> I love these kind of candid portraits.  Too bad for the wrist band.  Take that away and this would be a awesome shot (it''s still a great shot) but what can ya do...<br/>TC </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>To the contrary, I think the armband really real life details to this shot. Love the texture of the skin, the scar, the hair, the wrinkles ... fantastic.</td>', 'Originally posted by TooCool: I love these kind of candid portraits.  Too bad for the wrist band.  Take that away and this would be a awesome shot (it''s still a great shot) but what can ya do...TC   To the contrary, I think the armband really real life details to this shot. Love the texture of the skin, the scar, the hair, the wrinkles ... fantastic.', '2007-06-20 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
