(3815288, 532927, 49865, '<td valign="top">Haha, nice find. I especially like how he''s been sipping at a cold drink on the stairs. Would''ve been wonderful to get a picture of him trying to shove a straw through his helmet.</td>', 'Haha, nice find. I especially like how he''s been sipping at a cold drink on the stairs. Would''ve been wonderful to get a picture of him trying to shove a straw through his helmet.', '2007-06-21 13:30:05.000000', NULL, 0),
