(3826099, 532725, 32997, '<td valign="top">I look at this and start feeling dizzy as though I have had too much to drink...I think that''s great, it has the feel of a very cool indie film, blurry and shakey at all the right moments...<br/>you know I am not sure why people would want to provide you with technical criticism on this..to me this is a gut reaction shot, it either hits you or it doesn''t...it hitsme, I would like to see you getting out there and producing a whole late night series, and laugh at you struggling to find a shot that isn''t too blurry...<br/>maybe you should just pretend to get really drunk and hang with everyone, while you are only kinda drunk...and get a gorilla pod it should be cool enough to draw the right kind of attention/discussion...<br/>ok I''ll back off, just thinking..:)</td>', 'I look at this and start feeling dizzy as though I have had too much to drink...I think that''s great, it has the feel of a very cool indie film, blurry and shakey at all the right moments...you know I am not sure why people would want to provide you with technical criticism on this..to me this is a gut reaction shot, it either hits you or it doesn''t...it hitsme, I would like to see you getting out there and producing a whole late night series, and laugh at you struggling to find a shot that isn''t too blurry...maybe you should just pretend to get really drunk and hang with everyone, while you are only kinda drunk...and get a gorilla pod it should be cool enough to draw the right kind of attention/discussion...ok I''ll back off, just thinking..:)', '2007-06-24 00:07:20.000000', NULL, 0),
