(3827506, 531378, 75034, '<td valign="top">I agree with your post challenge comments.  I too received comments about my candid looking posed, I think that people tend to forget that as humans we do the most interesting things when we figure no one''s watching.  Isn''t that the idea of a candid.  That being said, I always show my subject, the photos that I''ve taken and ask if I can use them.<br/> <br/>Since this particular subject was the subject of your photo shoot, I doubt obtaining permission was difficult.<br/> <br/>Beautiful capture, great depth of field and deserved a far greater place than 109.  You have ever right to be happy with this photo.  Keep up the good work.<br/> <br/>Continued success and happy shooting, Max!</td>', 'I agree with your post challenge comments.  I too received comments about my candid looking posed, I think that people tend to forget that as humans we do the most interesting things when we figure no one''s watching.  Isn''t that the idea of a candid.  That being said, I always show my subject, the photos that I''ve taken and ask if I can use them. Since this particular subject was the subject of your photo shoot, I doubt obtaining permission was difficult. Beautiful capture, great depth of field and deserved a far greater place than 109.  You have ever right to be happy with this photo.  Keep up the good work. Continued success and happy shooting, Max!', '2007-06-24 14:27:36.000000', NULL, 0),
