(3833159, 532342, 30214, '<td valign="top">Great (candid) portrait, Brad. And what a fantastic processing from a seemingly ordinary original (kudos for posting it!). sometimes I have the feeling that a great image can be discovered in almost any photograph, it''s just I often don''t have enough talent and vision to find it! Good lesson here.</td>', 'Great (candid) portrait, Brad. And what a fantastic processing from a seemingly ordinary original (kudos for posting it!). sometimes I have the feeling that a great image can be discovered in almost any photograph, it''s just I often don''t have enough talent and vision to find it! Good lesson here.', '2007-06-25 19:14:46.000000', NULL, 0),
