(3838188, 533106, 45475, '<td valign="top">Almost like an impromptu airport seminar! But yes, isn''t it odd that most everyone is staring at this woman. I bet not one of them doing it consciously either. In a way, a horrifying look at ourselves and our tendency to single out oddities in a more restrained form of ''pointing''.<br/> <br/>Great capture.</td>', 'Almost like an impromptu airport seminar! But yes, isn''t it odd that most everyone is staring at this woman. I bet not one of them doing it consciously either. In a way, a horrifying look at ourselves and our tendency to single out oddities in a more restrained form of ''pointing''. Great capture.', '2007-06-26 20:35:38.000000', NULL, 0),
