(4653153, 531485, 59577, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JaimeVinas:</b></div><hr/><i> Hey Owean, I have shot of this homeless guy too<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=571430" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/80904/120/571430.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/80904/120/571430.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/80904/120/571430.jpg"/></a> <br/>Its the one who roams downtown right? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That''s where I spotted him.</td>', 'Originally posted by JaimeVinas: Hey Owean, I have shot of this homeless guy too Its the one who roams downtown right?   That''s where I spotted him.', '2008-04-22 11:46:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4815716, 531485, 30807, '<td valign="top">This is a classic mix of beauty and sad situation. How can people be in a situation like this, and we take such a beautiful shot of them?<br/> <br/>Makes me want to get him out of there, haircut, off the cigarettes, help get a job, a wife, a life, a bright outlook, and happiness. It takes time and commitment to do that though, and I have always been too selfish to do it. <br/> <br/>This photo makes me want to be a better neighbour, person, and friend<br/>Congratulations - that is not an easy thing to do! You look like you care about this man. I guess you may not have been kidding about the Ghetto comment on the reflecting flower shot!</td>', 'This is a classic mix of beauty and sad situation. How can people be in a situation like this, and we take such a beautiful shot of them? Makes me want to get him out of there, haircut, off the cigarettes, help get a job, a wife, a life, a bright outlook, and happiness. It takes time and commitment to do that though, and I have always been too selfish to do it.  This photo makes me want to be a better neighbour, person, and friendCongratulations - that is not an easy thing to do! You look like you care about this man. I guess you may not have been kidding about the Ghetto comment on the reflecting flower shot!', '2008-07-09 19:56:21.000000', NULL, 0),
