(5064849, 532504, 63398, '<td valign="top">A powerful and evocative image, yet disturbing nonetheless. I think that the look of distress on the mother''s face is so incongruous with her actions, the concerned look on the boy''s face so painful to see. A brave and poignant image, made more special and riveting with the selective desaturation. Bravo.</td>', 'A powerful and evocative image, yet disturbing nonetheless. I think that the look of distress on the mother''s face is so incongruous with her actions, the concerned look on the boy''s face so painful to see. A brave and poignant image, made more special and riveting with the selective desaturation. Bravo.', '2008-11-15 09:18:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5204558, 531678, 30861, '<td valign="top">My goodness! It''s funny how the "miniature" aspect of Lensbaby is involved in a perceptual contest with the figures: without the figures, this would be the full-tilit-boogie effect, but WITH the figures our brains start readjusting, and it comes out all pushme-pullyou, to borrow a Doolitleism... Luscious!</td>', 'My goodness! It''s funny how the "miniature" aspect of Lensbaby is involved in a perceptual contest with the figures: without the figures, this would be the full-tilit-boogie effect, but WITH the figures our brains start readjusting, and it comes out all pushme-pullyou, to borrow a Doolitleism... Luscious!', '2009-01-19 15:54:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5205045, 531678, 12076, '<td valign="top">First of all, this was a very underrated photograph.  And speaking of getting slaughtered, it looks like the group in the photo is getting ready for a sacrifice of some sort.  Great shot.  I always wanted to visit this place.</td>', 'First of all, this was a very underrated photograph.  And speaking of getting slaughtered, it looks like the group in the photo is getting ready for a sacrifice of some sort.  Great shot.  I always wanted to visit this place.', '2009-01-19 18:52:36.000000', NULL, 0),
